Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.27,0:14:40.48,单行字幕,,0000,0000,0000,,《惊天魔盗团》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.50,0:01:10.82,单行字幕,,0000,0000,0000,,(芝加哥 星期一)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.39,0:02:05.03,单行字幕,,0000,0000,0000,,(新奥尔良 星期二)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.23,0:04:20.82,单行字幕,,0000,0000,0000,,(纽约 星期三)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.76,0:05:31.56,单行字幕,,0000,0000,0000,,(洛杉矶 星期四)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.96,0:08:04.54,单行字幕,,0000,0000,0000,,(爱神)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.91,0:08:41.83,单行字幕,,0000,0000,0000,,(死神)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.38,0:08:50.75,单行字幕,,0000,0000,0000,,(隐士)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.15,0:09:13.65,单行字幕,,0000,0000,0000,,(女祭司)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.19,0:14:45.15,单行字幕,,0000,0000,0000,,(拉斯维加斯 一年后)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.41,0:20:34.75,单行字幕,,0000,0000,0000,,(巴黎 在同一时刻)
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.59,0:47:11.47,单行字幕,,0000,0000,0000,,(魔术揭秘 赛迪斯·布莱德利)
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.75,0:51:55.55,单行字幕,,0000,0000,0000,,(去死吧)
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.47,1:10:52.68,单行字幕,,0000,0000,0000,,(何露斯的监护人)
Dialogue: 0,1:51:42.33,1:51:43.66,单行字幕,,0000,0000,0000,,(大型逃脱魔术成了史莱克一生最后一个魔术)
Dialogue: 0,1:56:43.20,1:56:43.20,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.99,0:00:35.74,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,靠近点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.08,0:00:38.37,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,再近点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.24,0:00:42.25,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,正因为 越是你认为自己看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.33,0:00:44.75,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,就越容易瞒过你的双眼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.38,0:00:48.29,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,也因为 被看得到的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.38,0:00:52.42,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你正在看的 其实只是你的眼睛在过滤信息
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.47,0:00:54.43,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,并解释 传递给你的大脑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.43,0:00:57.68,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,而我的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.76,0:01:01.77,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,就是笑纳你们所赐予我的礼物 你们的注意力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.64,0:01:06.73,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,然后用其欺骗你们的双眼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.86,0:01:14.07,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我开始快速翻动这叠牌堆
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.15,0:01:15.66,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要你看到一张牌
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.74,0:01:17.16,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,当然不是这张 如果是这张就太明显了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.57,0:01:18.87,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,请仔细注意观察
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.45,0:01:22.75,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,刚太快了 我再来一次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.83,0:01:24.04,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.12,0:01:25.12,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.17,0:01:28.96,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 现在看到一张牌了吗 - 看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.13,0:01:31.05,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 记住了吗 - 记住了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.25,0:01:32.96,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,现在 在这堆里能找到你刚才看的到牌吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.59,0:01:34.55,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.63,0:01:36.84,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那是因为你看的时候站得太近了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.93,0:01:38.97,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我整晚都在告诉你们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.05,0:01:40.51,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,站的越近…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.60,0:01:42.14,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你的视野越狭隘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.37,0:02:07.79,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,现在 看着我的双眼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.00,0:02:10.04,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,然后 睡着吧 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.34,0:02:14.55,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,然后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.72,0:02:18.30,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你能够到这张钞票 那它就归你了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.51,0:02:20.35,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 拿走啊 别客气
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.55,0:02:23.06,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,或者你说出你的名字 你也可以拿走它
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.23,0:02:28.65,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 你可以不用动了 在原地站一会儿吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.73,0:02:31.11,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在呢 准备偷窥一下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.19,0:02:32.73,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你老公的大脑 - 原来是这样的 我的天…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.82,0:02:33.94,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我看到了一幅画面…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.03,0:02:36.03,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 千万别告诉我你在想什么 - 那肯定的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.24,0:02:38.24,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,沙滩 鸡尾酒…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.70,0:02:39.86,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,佛罗里达州
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.95,0:02:41.45,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 那是出差 别想歪了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.62,0:02:43.62,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说 算是出差吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.70,0:02:46.58,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 思想上"出差"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.70,0:02:47.91,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你瞎说"小可爱"我们走…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.04,0:02:49.54,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,她动不了的 老兄
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.62,0:02:51.04,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你现在在想一个女人的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.25,0:02:52.59,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,开头字母是 A B C
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.67,0:02:53.92,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,D E F G
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.00,0:02:55.13,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,H I J…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.26,0:02:57.05,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,J 珍 简 珍妮特
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.26,0:02:58.34,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,谁是珍妮特
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.97,0:03:01.18,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你认识珍妮特吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.30,0:03:02.55,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,原来是你最好的朋友啊 我猜对了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.93,0:03:05.56,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你妹妹 - 求你别这样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.64,0:03:07.89,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,是她妹妹啊 我的天呐
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.98,0:03:10.02,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是去出差了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.10,0:03:11.86,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你是去上珍妮特了 - 我没有
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.94,0:03:13.23,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那可是你老婆的妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.19,0:03:15.90,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 我们还是站过来点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.98,0:03:18.53,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,因为现在你老婆看起来有点不开心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.61,0:03:20.82,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你想解决这个事情吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.91,0:03:22.57,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那当然 - 好 把你钱包掏出来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.12,0:03:24.58,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,别磨叽了 拿出来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.66,0:03:25.95,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你也是这样勒索其他人的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.08,0:03:27.83,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不 就比较特殊的几个人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.91,0:03:30.00,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧瞧这里 200美元很公平吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.08,0:03:32.17,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗 这个事情看起来很严重 我们还是收250美元吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.25,0:03:33.25,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,您打劫真有艺术感
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.33,0:03:35.00,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 那必须的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.75,0:03:38.55,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 继续沉睡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.63,0:03:40.01,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,现在 当我打一下响指
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.09,0:03:41.55,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你就什么都不记得了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.63,0:03:42.84,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,还有你 沃伦 贝提
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.09,0:03:45.93,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,每当你看到 甚至想起珍妮特
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.26,0:03:48.73,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你的脑海里就浮现出我的裸体
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.81,0:03:49.93,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那可不会是什么好看的"景色"了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.02,0:03:51.02,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.10,0:03:53.27,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 你完全清醒了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.36,0:03:58.86,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 我们已经尽力了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.94,0:04:01.11,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,只不过有的人天生就无法被催眠
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.20,0:04:03.49,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是吗 是不是我哪里做错了 - 该走了 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.62,0:04:05.28,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 当然没有 你做的完全正确 - 来 给你买晚餐吃
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.45,0:04:06.62,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,照顾好她哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.70,0:04:08.45,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不过得先去取点钱
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.59,0:04:26.18,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,女士们先生们 我是下一个最有名的魔术师
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.26,0:04:28.43,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,如果有谁能识破我的把戏
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.51,0:04:30.85,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我就给他100美元
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.06,0:04:34.56,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我在布鲁克林 就这个城市的梅尔熟食店拿了把普通勺子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.65,0:04:36.06,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,检查一下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.15,0:04:39.82,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好 现在请各位非常认真的看好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.03,0:04:43.40,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我会用我的意念把这个勺子折弯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.62,0:04:56.00,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 谢谢各位 递给大家看看
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.08,0:04:57.59,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是什么 - 你想干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.67,0:05:00.92,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧瞧这里好像这是一个勺子和一个杆子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.01,0:05:02.13,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我还能识破其他把戏呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.22,0:05:04.43,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,或者给我100美元就算了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.51,0:05:05.59,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你说你要给的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.68,0:05:06.93,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,钱包挺好看的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.01,0:05:08.22,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这位先生 你眼力不错
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.30,0:05:09.31,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.48,0:05:17.81,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,糟了 钱包
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.02,0:05:20.19,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,钱包 手表
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.86,0:05:25.95,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,抓小偷啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.03,0:05:27.16,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,就是那个穿皮夹克的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.24,0:05:28.24,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他偷了我钱包
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.67,0:05:38.04,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你们好 洛杉矶的观众们
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.13,0:05:39.79,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,准备好 见证奇蹟的时刻了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.88,0:05:40.88,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.96,0:05:43.01,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,当那个计时器清零的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.46,0:05:45.80,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,一满满水箱的食人鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.88,0:05:47.80,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,就会从上面掉下来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.89,0:05:50.60,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,一位女士被考起来关在里面 仔细看好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.89,0:05:53.56,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,一 二 三
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.55,0:06:24.26,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,快帮忙 停下来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.17,0:06:27.93,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,她好像是真的逃不出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.05,0:06:31.51,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,快找人帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.22,0:06:33.39,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,哥们快救人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.93,0:06:37.23,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,快让开 让开
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.22,0:07:18.27,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,别沮丧啊 这太简单了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.39,0:07:21.60,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,刚有谁觉得会失败啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.07,0:07:30.66,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我可是你的终极粉丝
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.74,0:07:32.66,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,看你吻的这么深情 我就知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.74,0:07:33.99,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,关门先 隔墙有耳
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.08,0:07:35.66,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 魔术师 过来呀 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.75,0:07:39.33,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 等等 等等 - 什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.41,0:07:40.87,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么办到的…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.96,0:07:42.29,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说刚塔上的7个菱形
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.38,0:07:43.92,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是啊 - 那可是机密
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.05,0:07:48.38,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我给你个提示 贿赂一下塔里的电工就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.46,0:07:49.55,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,多少钱
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.63,0:07:50.63,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,50块
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.93,0:07:52.80,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 但是那也好难啊 - 当然 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.93,0:07:54.01,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,一般都是7吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.10,0:07:55.68,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以用52种不同的方式来变那个魔术
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.76,0:07:57.64,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那你能在我身上变52个魔术嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.06,0:07:59.14,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我尽量看我能干点什么吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.43,0:08:01.10,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,神秘的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.48,0:08:02.90,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢你的沐浴露味道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.19,0:08:06.44,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 等下 - 什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.82,0:08:09.86,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你该走了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.94,0:08:10.95,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你在开玩笑吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.15,0:08:13.16,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,天呐 这样我好尴尬啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.41,0:08:14.41,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你平常也是这样的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.49,0:08:16.45,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,对女人来说 这算哪门子戏法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.62,0:08:18.74,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,45号 埃文东街
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.91,0:08:20.33,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心 我会给你打电话的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.50,0:08:21.91,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你没我号码
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.12,0:08:24.17,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我有魔力 我会找到的 祝你晚上愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.25,0:08:25.75,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你真变态
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.32,0:09:39.37,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.49,0:09:41.54,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,亨利
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.87,0:09:43.91,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼 你好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.33,0:09:46.79,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你拿到卡片了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.75,0:09:50.00,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,恩 不错 挺好的 恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.09,0:09:51.09,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 我的打算是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.21,0:09:52.46,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我先进去打探一下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.55,0:09:53.76,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你在外面等着 我马上回来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.84,0:09:54.92,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,然后接你 行吗 别进来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.01,0:09:56.76,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 丹尼我不再是你的助理了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.05,0:09:58.34,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,发型不错
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.43,0:10:00.14,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 那你想怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.22,0:10:02.35,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼 你应该清楚我想怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.43,0:10:05.18,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我看到了你在我网站所有的匿名留言了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.27,0:10:06.52,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,原来你还有个网站 不错啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.60,0:10:08.35,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,挺好的 还可以帮你宣传一下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.86,0:10:12.32,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,很 好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.40,0:10:15.57,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,很显然我们不是被单独选中的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.70,0:10:18.28,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我成了第一个失去自我的人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.45,0:10:19.53,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,行了 打扰一下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.62,0:10:21.41,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 门是锁着的 - 是吗 我再看下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.58,0:10:24.08,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你 先别说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.20,0:10:25.75,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,海伦 不对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.91,0:10:27.29,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,亨利
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.37,0:10:28.58,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你咖啡杯子上写的有
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.79,0:10:30.46,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,多谢你提醒
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.54,0:10:32.09,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,顺便说下 刚那不是什么读心术
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.21,0:10:33.30,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,只是观察而已
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.42,0:10:36.97,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,再观察一下 你很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.38,0:10:38.18,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.47,0:10:40.97,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,很好 非常好 精心打造的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.05,0:10:43.31,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我是简 丹尼尔·阿特拉斯 很高兴见到你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.56,0:10:45.18,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 我知道你是谁 不过我对你所做的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.31,0:10:46.27,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,有点不满意
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.35,0:10:47.52,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,包括你的读心术
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.77,0:10:48.64,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,尤其是在我们都不知真假是非
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.64,0:10:50.31,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,还有到底是谁引我们过来的情况下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.02,0:10:55.11,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,等下 我感觉到 我感觉到你是个控制狂
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.19,0:10:56.44,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思 我们之前见过
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.53,0:10:57.95,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这不用读心术也看得出来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.03,0:10:59.11,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你就是个控制狂
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.20,0:11:01.28,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,很好 我就当是在表扬我了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.37,0:11:02.74,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,就他才会把这个当成是赞赏
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.83,0:11:04.83,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,很好 不错 又换了种赞赏我的方式
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.91,0:11:08.29,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 这就是你们两个分手的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.37,0:11:09.46,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,情侣 我们不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.54,0:11:10.75,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们怎么可能是情侣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.83,0:11:12.63,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他经常把我锯成两半儿
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.71,0:11:13.75,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,她这个助理还挺不错的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.84,0:11:14.88,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,但是丹尼嫌我太肥了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.96,0:11:17.80,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,谁说的 我只说过一次 那是因为你连道具的后门都过不去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.88,0:11:19.88,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这尺寸很正常 - 这么一点点大小
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.97,0:11:21.47,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,谁能爬过去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.55,0:11:22.72,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,丽贝卡就可以
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.89,0:11:24.47,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,丽贝卡都钻了几年了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.56,0:11:26.22,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道钻进那么小的戏服
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.35,0:11:28.18,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,就已经很难了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.39,0:11:30.23,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道 我才是主演
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.52,0:11:32.48,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,所以 他从未让你觉得自己很特别
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.56,0:11:36.48,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,相信我 你应该感到天生与众不同
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.57,0:11:37.99,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这话说的像讲故事一样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.07,0:11:39.74,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,祝你们互相捧的愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.99,0:11:41.16,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.32,0:11:43.91,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,简 丹尼尔·阿特拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.03,0:11:46.62,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟 我看过你所有的魔术
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.70,0:11:48.00,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你就像…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.08,0:11:49.33,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很崇拜你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.41,0:11:50.92,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,作为一个你的粉丝 真心向你问候
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.00,0:11:52.50,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,顺便说下 我叫杰克
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.58,0:11:54.00,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,问一下 你有这个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.04,0:11:55.92,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,有 是死神
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.80,0:11:57.96,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我的是女祭司
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.13,0:11:59.30,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,恋人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.47,0:12:00.51,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,三分钟热度的恋人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.51,0:12:02.59,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,隐士
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.80,0:12:05.43,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们现在在这里是… 是在等人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.64,0:12:07.06,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们为什么不直接 - 门是锁着的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.14,0:12:09.68,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,没有东西可以锁住我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.36,0:12:21.15,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这里是干什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.49,0:12:27.12,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,哇 我以为我的公寓够脏了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.79,0:12:36.96,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,天呐 这里真冷
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.63,0:12:39.67,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.88,0:12:41.09,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.34,0:12:45.34,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,上面说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.60,0:12:48.14,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,"现在你不能"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.97,0:12:52.27,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,"玫瑰的别名是…"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.19,0:12:59.40,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,各位 看看发生什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.07,0:13:02.61,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.33,0:13:10.45,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,是瓦斯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.66,0:13:12.75,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,放松 只是干冰而已
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.54,0:13:14.54,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好酷
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.50,0:13:17.00,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,等下 你觉得这到底是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.08,0:13:18.84,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,等等…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.67,0:13:24.84,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 我什么都没感觉到
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.01,0:13:26.76,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 你刚说的东西真"有意义"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.97,0:13:28.97,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想创造一个富有智慧的环境
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.05,0:13:30.60,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 要是佛像没有了灵气
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.68,0:13:32.10,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那你和他还挺像的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.18,0:13:33.56,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,要是耶稣不自大也没有那么多奇蹟
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.64,0:13:36.19,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那你就长得像耶稣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.27,0:13:37.56,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,行了 一堆基友 你们找个房间行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.65,0:13:39.48,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼 说实话 这是不是你弄的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.57,0:13:40.69,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,当然不 等下 是你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.82,0:13:42.11,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我也希望是我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.61,0:13:44.86,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么没有人问我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.86,0:13:47.03,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,恩 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.41,0:13:54.16,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这房子没电
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.08,0:13:56.79,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,走 我们过去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.64,0:14:15.10,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,是蓝图
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.94,0:14:17.31,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,太不可思议了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.77,0:14:20.11,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你们觉得是谁做了这些东西
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.27,0:14:22.44,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道 不过我很想见见他们
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.40,0:14:25.95,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这是演出
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.80,0:14:47.22,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,梅里特·麦金尼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.97,0:14:50.30,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼尔·阿特拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.72,0:14:52.97,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,亨利·里夫斯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.93,0:14:56.64,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克·怀尔德
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.43,0:15:01.36,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,亚瑟·特雷斯特 以及 MGM为您隆重呈现
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.11,0:15:06.19,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,四骑士团
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.65,0:15:09.07,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.15,0:15:11.32,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚我们会尝试一些
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.45,0:15:13.95,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,让更不一样 更高端的魔术
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.03,0:15:15.54,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,也是我们最后的四个表演
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.62,0:15:17.58,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会带来一场在拉斯维加斯舞台上
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.66,0:15:19.67,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,从未出现过的表演
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.71,0:15:23.04,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,没有任何有名的表演能和我们的相提并论
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.84,0:15:25.67,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,女士们 先生们
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.63,0:15:28.72,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.63,0:15:31.76,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们将会打劫一家银行
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.35,0:15:44.48,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,犯罪真让人兴奋
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.19,0:15:48.86,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我好激动 在座的各位 你们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.37,0:15:56.58,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,1 2 3
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.29,0:16:07.21,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 先生 表演过程中
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.30,0:16:08.55,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不允许录影
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.63,0:16:10.63,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,是是 行 没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.72,0:16:11.80,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我马上收起来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.88,0:16:13.18,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思 我需要把它带走
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.26,0:16:15.72,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,表演结束了 你可以来领取
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.43,0:16:17.81,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.93,0:16:22.64,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 好了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.90,0:16:24.73,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,现在请安静一下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.48,0:16:28.32,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,在座的各位有谁的银行想被我们打劫
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.57,0:16:31.57,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,人不可貌相 开银行的人这么多
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.74,0:16:33.45,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那么 我们随机从中抽取一位
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.07,0:16:37.70,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我的同事会确定是随机抽取的 没问题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.62,0:16:40.95,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- "猫王"帮我挑一个 - 非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.16,0:16:43.71,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克手里的框子里是写着区号的乒乓球
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.79,0:16:45.79,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克能递给我一个区域号码吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.00,0:16:47.46,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 是 B区
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.54,0:16:48.71,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,B区在哪呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.38,0:16:51.88,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 在那 可能就是你们其中的一个人 准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.38,0:16:53.72,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道为什么每个人都这么开心
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.80,0:16:54.84,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,就他们B区有机会
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.14,0:16:56.72,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,梅里特 能帮我抽一下 看是哪排
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.60,0:16:58.68,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 梅里特
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.76,0:17:00.56,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们看到的是第五排
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.64,0:17:01.77,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.85,0:17:04.69,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,然后亨利 再帮我选一个座位号码
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.56,0:17:07.11,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 是幸运数字13
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.36,0:17:08.86,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,B-5-13 你在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.19,0:17:12.82,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,先生 请起立 你在那呢 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.45,0:17:16.07,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你能再帮我确定一下座位号码吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.16,0:17:18.20,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,看下座位是不是B-5-13
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.28,0:17:19.28,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,千真万确
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.37,0:17:21.37,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,很好 现在请你告诉我们
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.45,0:17:22.79,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你和你银行的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.00,0:17:25.21,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,恩 我的名字是艾蒂安 福希尔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.46,0:17:28.79,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我的银行叫巴黎信用合作社
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.00,0:17:30.17,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,法国 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.38,0:17:31.92,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还希望是近一点的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.01,0:17:34.26,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那种本地夫妻经营的小银行 没什么保安的那种
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.34,0:17:36.39,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不过没关系 承诺就是承诺
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.47,0:17:37.72,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你能上来舞台这里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.80,0:17:39.05,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,然后我们就开始抢劫你的银行
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.14,0:17:41.27,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,与此同时
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.35,0:17:42.64,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,还有一位今晚也值得一提
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.72,0:17:44.48,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,没了他 我们四个
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.56,0:17:46.56,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,可能还在马戏团当小魔术师
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.65,0:17:47.65,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,然后还要摸爬滚打
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.86,0:17:49.23,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,才能有今天的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.48,0:17:50.61,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,就算你不是他众多
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.69,0:17:52.19,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,公司的一员
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.32,0:17:53.57,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你也可能认识他
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.65,0:17:55.74,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他就是我们的朋友 我们的赞助商
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.82,0:17:57.16,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,亚瑟·特雷斯特先生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.24,0:17:59.32,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,请起立 阿特 麻烦您站起来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.41,0:18:00.41,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他是这里在座的唯一一个
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.49,0:18:02.62,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,拥有女皇号码的人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.16,0:18:05.16,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,如果可以 请继续站会儿 阿特
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.16,0:18:08.42,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我想说 当我们找到特雷斯勒的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.50,0:18:10.88,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们保证过 作为一个团体
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.00,0:18:12.09,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会成为最伟大的魔术师
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.17,0:18:13.59,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们想说"谢谢"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.67,0:18:15.67,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,然后顺便再说一句 阿特 你看到了前排的名单了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.76,0:18:17.84,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们已经确保你的名字在第一位了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.01,0:18:20.10,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的小女孩 如果你想证明自己有你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.18,0:18:22.01,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,自己所想的那么好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.18,0:18:24.27,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那么这个也就没有这么重要了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.52,0:18:25.77,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还没有进行最后的表演呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.85,0:18:27.02,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你何不先看一下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.10,0:18:28.44,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,然后再做决定
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.52,0:18:30.98,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,女士们 先生们 这就是亚瑟·特雷斯特
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.06,0:18:32.44,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 然后 再一次把掌声给
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.52,0:18:34.57,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,主角梅里特·麦金尼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.78,0:18:38.03,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,艾蒂安 杰克带来的是我们魔术界
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.24,0:18:41.87,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,的传送头盔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.03,0:18:44.12,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你需要带着这个 因为它能
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.37,0:18:48.12,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,扭曲时空和时间
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.37,0:18:50.54,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,带你去你的银行
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.71,0:18:51.75,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,8号
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.96,0:18:53.88,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 9号 行政区大街 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.05,0:18:55.88,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 一旦你到那之后
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.96,0:18:58.05,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就只能通过这个头盔和你对话了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.13,0:18:59.89,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,如果…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.09,0:19:01.85,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 天呐 太帅气了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.93,0:19:04.14,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,时髦之中 又添几分吸引力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.26,0:19:07.98,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,是时候 法国向美国学学什么叫时髦了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.60,0:19:10.73,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,真是个美丽的头饰 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.81,0:19:12.40,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谢谢 谢谢 - 的确是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.48,0:19:16.07,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 十分感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.44,0:19:18.78,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,但 在你出发之前
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.90,0:19:20.91,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,请抽一张牌
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.11,0:19:22.24,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 不是这张
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.45,0:19:25.74,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,没事 这是个老掉牙的美国笑话 你可以拿刚那张
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.95,0:19:27.41,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 就这个了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.58,0:19:29.58,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,给你B区的朋友看看 但是别被我们看到
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.25,0:19:33.29,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 很好 把你的名字签上去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.42,0:19:35.84,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好 - 如果能用英语最好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.25,0:19:37.67,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 很好 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.80,0:19:39.93,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,放到你口袋里去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.26,0:19:42.68,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,现在 还有一点小细节没有处理
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.11,0:20:04.66,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,现在 艾蒂安 请走进这个复杂的机器
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.87,0:20:07.12,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我呢 从里面走出来 祝你好运
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.20,0:20:09.96,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,现在拉斯维加斯是晚上11点50
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.16,0:20:12.29,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,巴黎呢是早上8点50分
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.46,0:20:14.84,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你的银行还有不到10分钟就开门了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.04,0:20:16.04,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,一
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.13,0:20:17.21,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,2
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.30,0:20:18.34,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,三
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.63,0:20:22.80,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,什么情况
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.01,0:20:24.64,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 艾蒂安 - 艾蒂安
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.80,0:20:26.76,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,应该不是这样的啊 是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.85,0:20:28.10,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,艾蒂安
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.47,0:20:30.48,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我还挺喜欢那个法国小伙儿的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.68,0:20:31.73,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他去哪里了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.69,0:20:42.24,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 他在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.53,0:20:46.58,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,别别别 大家别吵
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.83,0:20:49.49,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我是丹尼尔·阿特拉斯 你听得到我说话吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.58,0:20:50.83,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,艾蒂安 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.91,0:20:52.00,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.08,0:20:54.46,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,很好 你在里面看到什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.42,0:20:57.50,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,钱…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.00,0:20:59.13,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.21,0:21:01.72,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 看起来有三百万欧元
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.93,0:21:05.51,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,很好 现在我们需要你做点事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.59,0:21:07.55,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,请你把刚那张牌
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.64,0:21:08.89,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,从你口袋里拿出来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.35,0:21:10.43,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,然后带着你今晚的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.52,0:21:11.56,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,入场券
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.77,0:21:12.81,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,然后把它放在
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.89,0:21:14.94,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,钱的正中央
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.02,0:21:19.19,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,丢吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.24,0:21:34.46,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,现在 你摸摸看你头盔侧面有个按钮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.54,0:21:35.87,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,先别按
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.96,0:21:37.71,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那个按钮可以启动链接巴黎和拉斯维加斯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.79,0:21:40.55,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,的空气管道
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.71,0:21:42.05,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,很好 你现在可以按了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.26,0:21:44.38,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好 艾蒂安 准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.47,0:21:45.84,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你可能会感觉到一点点真空感
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.92,0:22:18.29,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.01,0:23:14.26,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 艾蒂安 谢谢各位
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.35,0:23:15.52,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是四骑士团
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.60,0:23:16.73,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,晚安各位
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.81,0:23:18.39,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.74,0:23:31.95,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,在这等下
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.32,0:23:33.91,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我是迪伦 罗兹
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.41,0:23:37.54,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,什么 我听错了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.62,0:23:39.08,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你刚是说魔术师吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.16,0:23:41.08,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,是的迪伦 是魔术师
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.17,0:23:42.38,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你现在在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.46,0:23:44.46,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我在亚里亚 我正过去逮捕他们
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.67,0:23:50.59,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,FBI手放到我可以看到的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.68,0:23:52.05,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,起来 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.43,0:23:55.14,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,走 抓他们起来
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.35,0:23:56.64,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,把书放下
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.85,0:23:58.60,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 你抓到我了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.68,0:24:00.19,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 别动 手举高 - 噢 天
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.69,0:24:03.44,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你们有没有人可以帮我们提下包
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.98,0:24:05.02,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.87,0:24:24.83,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,老大 告诉我这不是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.92,0:24:27.96,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚收到威利·米尔斯指认波利·阿塔纳西奥
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.05,0:24:29.76,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我一个月最多两次
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.84,0:24:31.30,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,已经忙得炸开了锅了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.38,0:24:32.43,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你找特克尔森
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.51,0:24:33.64,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他就在亚特兰大市
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.72,0:24:34.97,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,或者考恩 你看看他
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.05,0:24:36.47,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,屁股都粘在板凳上了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.55,0:24:37.76,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,罗兹 你真喜剧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.22,0:24:39.35,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.68,0:24:40.73,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,蠢货
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.93,0:24:42.48,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有时间管这些什么魔术师
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.56,0:24:45.11,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这些人渣刚从巴黎银行偷了三百万欧元
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.19,0:24:46.36,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那全是他们拿的 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.44,0:24:47.94,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上是320万
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.61,0:24:52.61,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,她是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.61,0:24:54.61,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.70,0:24:56.37,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,阿尔玛 德雷 法国国际刑警
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.53,0:24:57.99,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我会和你一起展开调查
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.08,0:24:59.29,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你是在开玩笑吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.37,0:25:00.91,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,大卫 科波菲尔和几个朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.04,0:25:02.16,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我就己经够呛的了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.25,0:25:05.46,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,现在又来一个…国际刑警 没有别的意思 别误会
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.54,0:25:07.79,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我也很高兴和你合作调查 罗兹
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.88,0:25:10.84,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 我不觉得我需要你的帮助 懂吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.92,0:25:13.47,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那个法国人呢 - 我已经跟他谈过了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.55,0:25:16.09,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 是吗 你在我之前跟我的目击证人说话
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.18,0:25:19.31,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你的目击证人 我还以为你不想管这个案子
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.39,0:25:20.93,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,再说了 他基本上没用
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.18,0:25:22.81,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 是吗 为什么这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.89,0:25:25.15,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,因为他相信魔术是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.23,0:25:26.90,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 他觉得是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.98,0:25:28.44,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你说的对 那他真可能没有用
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.52,0:25:31.86,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你没问题 我们一起再去跟他谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.94,0:25:33.53,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.15,0:25:37.32,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我一生中从未偷过任何一样东西 明白吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.41,0:25:39.78,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我试过把钱还回去 但是他们不要
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.87,0:25:42.33,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好了好了 这么说吧 你抢了一家银行
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.41,0:25:44.96,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我做的 - 很好 你承认了 就你做的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.04,0:25:47.58,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我还是这方面的新手 你能解释下
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.67,0:25:50.09,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你如何在3秒内从拉斯维加斯去到巴黎的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.55,0:25:52.30,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,用的是传送头盔
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.76,0:25:54.42,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 是他疯了还是我疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.51,0:25:56.38,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他在表演的时候被催眠了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.47,0:25:58.30,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉过你 他没有用了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.39,0:25:59.51,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 我一会儿问完了其他的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.60,0:26:01.14,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,东西再跟你算账
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.73,0:26:05.69,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.77,0:26:07.44,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,表演期间 一般的观众都被催眠
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.52,0:26:08.81,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,认为自己在交响乐队
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.90,0:26:11.19,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我认为"bullshit"就是触发这个的机关
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.27,0:26:14.74,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 艾蒂安 下来
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.82,0:26:16.11,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你不在交响乐团
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.20,0:26:18.62,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 法语的"停止"怎么说 - 就是"Stop"
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.70,0:26:19.74,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那你叫他停下来
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.82,0:26:24.08,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我做不到 你必须等他跳完
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.41,0:26:26.25,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 我需要休息一下
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.33,0:26:27.83,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,受不了了 全是法国人
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.96,0:26:29.46,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,特工罗兹
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.54,0:26:32.25,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我的上级命令我提供一份报告
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.34,0:26:35.38,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,直到完成任务 我都在这里 不管你乐不乐意
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.47,0:26:37.05,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,因此 我们可以一起办事
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.22,0:26:39.14,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,或者你可以跟在我后面问
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.22,0:26:41.35,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我之前已经问过的话
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.47,0:26:42.64,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,随便你了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.48,0:26:47.89,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我还没说完
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.98,0:26:51.77,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚飞了12个小时 过了这么久的一个白天
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.86,0:26:54.19,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我还没能适应时差
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.32,0:26:59.70,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想看看谁的脾气更大
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.82,0:27:01.91,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我保证你输得很彻底
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.54,0:27:05.62,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,很好 那这些白痴里面 你想
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.70,0:27:07.12,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,先和谁谈
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.21,0:27:08.25,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.80,0:27:14.92,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,迪伦 先提醒你一下
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.00,0:27:17.13,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,读心术从未准确的验过是真是假
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.22,0:27:18.26,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.34,0:27:19.68,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这么说的话 那就不是科学了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.84,0:27:21.09,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,听起来更像娱乐
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.18,0:27:22.43,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.51,0:27:25.89,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,只要不相信他讲的东西 就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.85,0:27:29.69,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,请转达我对你外面
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.81,0:27:31.56,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那位同事的深深的歉意
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.65,0:27:34.02,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉给你带来了一个完全不一样的周二
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.11,0:27:35.28,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我实在是太不对了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.36,0:27:36.61,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不一样的周二
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.69,0:27:38.36,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 这是他跟他老婆的安排
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.49,0:27:40.20,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你相信富勒说的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.32,0:27:42.74,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,所有的东西都是对的 也有可能并没有安排好
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.82,0:27:45.45,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,但FBI是不是有一个让你们自豪
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.54,0:27:47.41,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,的传统就是男人穿裙子
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.12,0:27:51.83,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不要不好意思 富勒 没关系的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.92,0:27:56.50,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得好过瘾啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.59,0:27:58.92,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你刚抽的牌吗 不 不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.01,0:28:00.30,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,看到了吗 我知道你的不是红桃
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.38,0:28:01.38,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我相信
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.47,0:28:03.34,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我没有被绑在这里 我会变得更好
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.43,0:28:04.47,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我了解 走过场嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.55,0:28:05.89,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 行了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.97,0:28:08.56,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那么 如果跟你半点关系没有
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.64,0:28:11.23,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那么那张牌是怎么进去的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.31,0:28:12.31,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.40,0:28:13.90,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,现在的孩子们都管这个叫
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.02,0:28:15.15,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 对 叫魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.23,0:28:17.23,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,回答我的问题 别自作聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.32,0:28:19.90,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 对不起 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.90,0:28:22.86,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以拿走 但别给他看
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.07,0:28:26.08,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,据说你会读心术
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.70,0:28:29.33,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,读心术到底是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.41,0:28:32.37,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,算是把戏吧 又有一些科学
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.58,0:28:36.42,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,有针对性的猜测 可以算是最准确的描述了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.59,0:28:39.84,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,然后伴着一些直觉和偶然
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.51,0:28:43.18,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,还有出现在我脑海里的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.43,0:28:47.43,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这里说你曾一度很有名
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.51,0:28:49.52,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,说你甚至可以通过电话催眠别人
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.60,0:28:52.10,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,环美旅行几年
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.19,0:28:54.19,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 参加过两次电视节目 - 《荣耀时光》
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.40,0:28:55.65,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,然后你的弟弟/管理员
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.65,0:28:57.90,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,带着你来之不易的钱玩失踪
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.94,0:28:59.28,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你调查过我 是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.36,0:29:01.19,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,国税局审计后 又补缴税款
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.28,0:29:03.03,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,经过很久的努力
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.11,0:29:05.53,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你才成为公众的焦点 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.62,0:29:07.04,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 那当然
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.04,0:29:10.32,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我对那次旅行还挺感激的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.50,0:29:12.46,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我只知道 当那个法国男人带上
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.54,0:29:13.71,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,魔法头盔之后
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.79,0:29:14.79,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.92,0:29:17.46,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你没有抢银行 那你应该知道谁干的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.54,0:29:18.67,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那你也就是共犯
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.75,0:29:21.17,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你今天想从这里出去 我建议你开始…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.26,0:29:22.30,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你听我说 除非你想
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.38,0:29:23.80,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,如果内华达州有地区检察官
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.88,0:29:25.34,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那他应该乐意跟陪审团解释这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.43,0:29:26.59,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那么我们就还会有一次表演机会
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.80,0:29:27.85,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,至于你 罗兹特工
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.93,0:29:29.26,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你也有机会重新实施你的计划了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.35,0:29:30.81,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你们第一次约会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.89,0:29:33.02,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.10,0:29:34.35,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,没事 我是说 很显然
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.35,0:29:36.94,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个人可能互相一点都不认识
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.98,0:29:40.48,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这房间里氛围已经是剑拔弩张了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.57,0:29:42.40,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,在你被卷入这事之前
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.49,0:29:45.99,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你要考虑清楚 她可是有一堆秘密的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.11,0:29:47.78,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 她第一个秘密是
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.87,0:29:50.99,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你第一次不做文职 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.41,0:29:52.87,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该告诉他的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.95,0:29:55.12,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这居然还是我告诉你的 不会感觉怪怪的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.21,0:29:57.04,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你是想求着被抓走 是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.17,0:29:59.50,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你真的要抓 那我就认了 不过你不会抓的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.59,0:30:01.05,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,因为如果你抓了 那就说明你
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.13,0:30:03.21,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,和FBI还有你国际刑警的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.30,0:30:06.76,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,在直觉层面上相信了魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.84,0:30:09.47,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,各大媒体就又有得忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.68,0:30:11.47,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那么我们就会比我们现在更出名
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.56,0:30:12.81,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,然后你们看起来就跟傻瓜一样
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.89,0:30:14.18,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,甚至比现在看起来还要傻
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.27,0:30:17.77,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 不包括你 但他肯定傻 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.85,0:30:19.52,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你这种在我们魔术界叫
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.61,0:30:21.02,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,"老实巴交"
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.19,0:30:22.28,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你自己也知道这点的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.36,0:30:24.44,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,别把他牵扯进来然后又抛弃他
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.61,0:30:27.99,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,因为抛弃对他来说是个很恐怖的"词汇"
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.53,0:30:29.66,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,妈咪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.37,0:30:31.58,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,爹地
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.91,0:30:33.37,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你有恋父情结
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.45,0:30:35.00,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好了 够了 - 我告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.08,0:30:36.21,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你这种情况平均治疗费用
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.21,0:30:38.41,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,一般是200-300美元
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.46,0:30:40.75,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我呢 收你10块吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.29,0:30:44.38,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 迟些再看吧 如果你不觉得没面子
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.46,0:30:46.38,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是只收你10块
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.63,0:30:48.68,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你想知道之前还有谁坐在你现在这个位置吗
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.80,0:30:50.89,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,黑帮老大 杀人犯还有小偷
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.10,0:30:52.51,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道是谁抓他们来这儿的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.60,0:30:54.52,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,抓他们来的人 是现在坐在我这个位置的人
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.60,0:30:58.56,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我警告你 我可以咬着你一辈子不放
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.65,0:31:01.48,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,而你的虚假嚣张气焰最多维持一时
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.56,0:31:03.69,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉你 只要你这张自鸣得意的脸庞
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.78,0:31:06.44,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,露出半点蛛丝马迹
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.53,0:31:07.82,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我就会瞬间出现在你身边 逮捕你
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.90,0:31:09.49,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我会在时刻监视着你 就像…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.57,0:31:10.74,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,就像狗皮膏药
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.03,0:31:12.53,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思 说话太直接了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.70,0:31:13.70,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,警告你
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.87,0:31:14.91,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我想你 不要放弃这个案子
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.12,0:31:16.45,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,因为 即便你觉得自己好像了如指掌了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.54,0:31:18.08,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们其实都早已料到
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.16,0:31:19.21,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你的下一步是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.29,0:31:20.50,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,当你感觉好像要追上我们的思路的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.58,0:31:21.96,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那正将是我们在你后面伏击你的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.04,0:31:23.50,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你出现在任何地方
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.59,0:31:24.67,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,都是我精心设计好的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.75,0:31:26.38,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,所以 跟的再近一点 试着形影不离吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.46,0:31:27.80,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,因为 你越觉得自己很近
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.88,0:31:29.26,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你能看到的东西就越少
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.34,0:31:30.34,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我会抓住你
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.81,0:31:37.14,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,小姐 苏打水不好喝吗
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.44,0:31:46.69,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 呵呵
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.28,0:31:48.78,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,魔法第一法则
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.61,0:31:51.86,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我永远是这房间里最聪明的一个
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.97,0:32:16.85,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,老大 这就放他们走了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.06,0:32:19.10,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他们全部都只说 他们会再偷一次
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.18,0:32:21.23,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,但半小时前 你还觉得他们都一无是处
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.31,0:32:23.06,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 怎么突然变了 - 因为我见过他们了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.15,0:32:24.15,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 你们俩
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.48,0:32:26.94,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚又彻查了一遍观众
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.02,0:32:28.15,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,大部分都是特雷斯勒给钱
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.23,0:32:29.90,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,要他们去充场子的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.99,0:32:31.78,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,但是你们知道是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.86,0:32:33.03,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,一直坐在后面录下了整个过程吗
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.16,0:32:34.16,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.24,0:32:35.70,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,是赛迪斯·布莱德利
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.24,0:32:40.41,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,布莱德利就是那个电视里经常表演节目的人 你不知道？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.50,0:32:41.50,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.58,0:32:43.92,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 他是经常解密魔术的一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.00,0:32:45.84,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他喜欢曝光他们 他会演示他们是怎么变的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.92,0:32:47.00,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,立刻打电话给他
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.09,0:32:48.76,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,已经联系了 你11点45跟他见面
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.84,0:32:49.88,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.05,0:32:52.72,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,布莱德利以前也曾是魔术师
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.80,0:32:54.51,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他以前挺厉害的 - 是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.84,0:32:56.97,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 最厉害的其中一个 - 不用你说
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.31,0:33:01.18,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,"智者往往能够看透表面"
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.27,0:33:03.69,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他还真热爱他的事业
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.15,0:33:06.94,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定不用喝杯酒吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.02,0:33:09.86,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不不不 谢谢你 我们在工作
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.32,0:33:11.49,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,给我来杯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.04,0:33:22.58,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,太不可思议了 太神奇了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.21,0:33:25.37,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,红燃料而已 雕虫小技
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.46,0:33:28.13,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这太难以置信了 跟上帝耍戏法儿一样
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.21,0:33:29.55,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思 我能打扰一会儿吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.63,0:33:31.92,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你也曾是伟大的魔术师 为什么又不做这行了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.55,0:33:35.22,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道这5年来 有多少人想看到
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.30,0:33:36.89,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,魔术解密直播吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.97,0:33:38.22,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,大约有160万
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.30,0:33:41.64,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道这些年我卖了多少DVD吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.72,0:33:43.02,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,5百万
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.10,0:33:44.14,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那这么说 是因为钱了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.23,0:33:45.73,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这么说吧 有钱赚也是因为
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.81,0:33:49.07,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,渴望答案要比渴望被耍 强烈很多
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.15,0:33:50.69,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,就像你 我很讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.69,0:33:53.48,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,以欺骗民众为生的人
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.53,0:33:57.20,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,无意冒犯 难道没有什么代价吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.74,0:33:58.78,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,代价
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.87,0:34:00.16,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我只知道求生计
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.24,0:34:01.37,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,养家糊口
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.45,0:34:04.66,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜你说的应该是 莱昂内尔·史瑞克吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.12,0:34:06.96,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 他是
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.04,0:34:08.54,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,莱昂内尔·史瑞克
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.63,0:34:13.01,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,一个二流魔术师30年前在哈德逊河被淹死了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.09,0:34:14.88,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,在布莱德利先生的节目上
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.88,0:34:16.88,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他揭秘了史瑞克所有的把戏
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.93,0:34:20.39,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,第二年 史瑞克决定东山再起
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.47,0:34:21.93,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他被铐在一个保险柜里面
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.01,0:34:23.81,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,然后丢进河里
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.89,0:34:25.02,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不过就再也没有浮起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.10,0:34:27.35,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说 他死了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.44,0:34:29.23,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有杀他
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.31,0:34:30.82,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他过于急功近利
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.82,0:34:33.60,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,根本没准备好就表演 最后踉成惨剧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.65,0:34:35.86,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得魔术是游戏吗
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.95,0:34:37.74,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,相信我 肯定不是游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.82,0:34:38.99,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,其实就是游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.07,0:34:40.83,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,玩的就是你
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.91,0:34:44.37,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,别害躁 我意思就是说你阿谀奉承
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.45,0:34:46.21,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不就是为了获得我的信任吗
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.29,0:34:47.29,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你真了解我
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.37,0:34:48.62,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你真想知道 巴黎的银行怎么会
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.71,0:34:52.50,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,在拉斯维加斯的一个舞台上被盗了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.59,0:34:54.55,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,敬请关注我下期节目
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.63,0:34:55.76,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那我就告你妨碍公务
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.84,0:34:58.30,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,抓你去告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.38,0:34:59.93,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,当然 除非你努力解释给我说
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.01,0:35:03.10,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你其实压根儿不知道他们怎么变的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.10,0:35:07.27,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,都是障眼法和舞台效果
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.48,0:35:09.60,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,当一个魔术师舞动双手 说
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.73,0:35:11.31,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,"接下来就是见证奇蹟的时刻"
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.56,0:35:13.98,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这个时候 其实真正变化是发生在其他地方的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.48,0:35:17.45,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,误导法 魔术的基本概念
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.65,0:35:19.91,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我对魔术的概念不感兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.11,0:35:21.62,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我只想知道他们怎么抢银行的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.78,0:35:24.49,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你真觉得 他们当时抢了银行 那你真是个白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.74,0:35:26.00,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,恕我多言
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.50,0:35:28.16,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,现在来说下 瞬间转移到巴黎
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.62,0:35:31.75,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,赫米亚 传送头盔 你不会当真吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.29,0:35:33.59,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你开玩笑的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.79,0:35:36.05,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你想知道他们是怎么办到的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.76,0:35:39.43,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在把这个给你带上
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.13,0:35:41.47,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,上去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.76,0:35:44.43,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.10,0:35:48.77,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我们慢慢把这个拉下来
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.81,0:35:52.73,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,随意点 就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.81,0:35:54.94,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,然后 当你准备好去巴黎了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.02,0:35:57.11,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,就故弄玄虚一下 说个魔法词汇
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.44,0:35:58.61,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,给我吹
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.61,0:36:01.36,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这也足够 - 一路顺风
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.38,0:36:16.50,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得还是走楼梯舒服点
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.17,0:36:19.13,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎来到灯光之城巴黎
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.30,0:36:21.09,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,呵 呵 呵 这头盔没用吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.47,0:36:22.68,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,用来调戏你的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.01,0:36:25.26,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.35,0:36:26.72,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.47,0:36:29.64,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这么说 他们有个地下室
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.73,0:36:30.81,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.89,0:36:31.98,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,然后和那法国家伙的银行
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.14,0:36:33.23,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,一模一样
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.31,0:36:34.36,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那他就是托儿
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.44,0:36:35.90,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他不是托儿 他是被骗了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.98,0:36:38.15,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他们选他是因为他们知道他坐哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.61,0:36:40.82,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不不不 是观众选的座位
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.65,0:36:44.41,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,当然不是观众选的座位
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.49,0:36:46.58,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,而是"让"大家觉得的确是观众自己选的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.66,0:36:48.04,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那么我们来随机抽取一个
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.54,0:36:50.41,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,其实他们把手中的球换成了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.50,0:36:52.21,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他们想要的座位号码
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.67,0:36:54.50,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们抽到了5号
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.67,0:36:56.00,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,亨利 再帮我挑一个座位号
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.50,0:36:57.50,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,幸运数字13
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.59,0:36:59.63,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,您能再确认下座位是对的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.71,0:37:01.30,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,其实他早就被选好了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.05,0:37:04.09,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他们早就催眠他 让他去拉斯维加斯
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.18,0:37:05.34,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,拉斯维加斯万岁
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.43,0:37:09.47,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,然后通过不同方式来强调维加斯 直到他真的去了维加斯
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.68,0:37:11.93,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,紧接着 跟踪他
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.02,0:37:13.14,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,研究他
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.23,0:37:14.98,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,以确保万无一失
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.27,0:37:18.27,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我测到他头部尺寸了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.36,0:37:20.74,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,成了他们的目标 自己却浑然不知
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.86,0:37:22.99,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,然后他们假装把他从维加斯送走
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.15,0:37:24.36,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,当我打响指…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.57,0:37:27.03,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 再次热烈掌声给梅里特·麦金尼
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.16,0:37:28.24,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,但怎么知道他们银行是哪家
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.58,0:37:29.70,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你还不懂啊 - 谁能懂
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.91,0:37:32.46,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你能别故作高深吗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.54,0:37:33.54,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.33,0:37:35.33,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,就像这样
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.50,0:37:39.80,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,通过一种非常神秘 不常见的手段
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.88,0:37:43.38,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,魔术师们就知道哪家银行属于他
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.38,0:37:45.38,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.80,0:37:46.80,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.72,0:37:49.10,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,信用卡
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.47,0:37:52.31,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他们就是这样把带有签名的牌
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.39,0:37:54.35,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,留在了巴黎银行的地下室
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.44,0:37:55.44,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,非常正确
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.69,0:37:57.15,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你已经领先一步了 罗兹
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.44,0:38:00.27,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,但他们必须把签名的扑克放到那个地下室
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.40,0:38:01.90,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你说他们没有偷钱
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.15,0:38:03.65,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不啊 我没说他们没有偷钱
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.74,0:38:05.20,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我只说了他们没有打劫银行
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.36,0:38:08.32,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜测是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.41,0:38:10.08,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他们看中了开往那家银行的装甲卡车
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.16,0:38:14.08,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,上面新鲜出炉的钱
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.50,0:38:18.29,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,当然进去很难
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.42,0:38:21.05,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,除非…你已经在里面了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.61,0:38:43.65,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不管银行让你觉得他们是有多安全
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.73,0:38:46.57,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,但是这些开车的人绝对不可靠
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.28,0:38:49.82,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,而对我们的四骑士团来说
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.91,0:38:52.16,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这就太简单了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.01,0:39:07.47,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那他们是怎么让那些地下室的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.47,0:39:09.59,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,假钞凭空消失的 你解释下
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.01,0:39:11.43,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,魔术火纸
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.68,0:39:15.89,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,魔术师一般都用这个
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.06,0:39:23.86,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,燃烧之后没有烟 没有残渣
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.24,0:39:31.62,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,两天前 这些家伙都还名不见经传
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.78,0:39:34.37,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,但今晚的表演门票35秒就已售罄
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.45,0:39:36.91,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,看似这些人对如何运作生意 已经初窥门径
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.00,0:39:39.75,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你给了观众三百万
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.96,0:39:41.33,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,让他们好好演 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.42,0:39:42.63,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,压轴的才是最好的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.71,0:39:45.17,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他们的表演将会永垂不朽
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.25,0:39:47.72,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,记住了要是飞机氧气面罩掉下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.80,0:39:49.84,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 记得先给你的律师带上 - 哦 必须的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.93,0:39:52.26,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我会的 一定给律师先带
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.34,0:39:54.39,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 然后才给自己带 接着给孩子带 - 然后你自己
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.47,0:39:55.89,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 然后才轮到小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.77,0:39:59.44,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,让我说说 我们大家都在想什么
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.52,0:40:00.69,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 你说
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.77,0:40:03.86,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,很显然 你对丹尼尔有好感
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.94,0:40:06.11,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,但是却一直没有得到回应
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.19,0:40:08.99,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,都怪他情商过低
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.07,0:40:11.74,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,因此 你一直深深地…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.82,0:40:13.45,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么说好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.95,0:40:14.95,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,憋着
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.03,0:40:16.04,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 我是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.12,0:40:19.75,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,现在呢 意识到自己身理上得不到满足
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.83,0:40:22.46,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,然后就抠破脑袋 帮你妹妹解决这方面的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.54,0:40:27.25,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以考虑下我 帮你私下"排忧解难"
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.46,0:40:28.59,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,哇 谢谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.67,0:40:31.43,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,如此廉价的机会 我得深思熟虑下
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.51,0:40:35.43,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,可能是很廉价无意义 但是又不花时间
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.06,0:40:41.06,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,飞机将会提前几分钟抵达目的地
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.14,0:40:42.23,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,放松自己
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.31,0:40:44.06,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,很快将会抵达纽奥良
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.15,0:40:45.86,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,感谢您乘坐此次航班
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.94,0:40:48.40,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那你说 特雷斯勒有什么好处 除了钱之外
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.48,0:40:49.57,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,自我层面
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.24,0:40:52.99,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好 选张牌
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.49,0:40:55.95,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,看一下 然后放回牌堆 别告诉我是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.03,0:40:57.87,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 别让我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.95,0:40:59.75,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好了 - 行了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.83,0:41:01.25,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,萨帝厄斯 那晚在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.33,0:41:03.75,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他应该清楚 问问他怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.83,0:41:05.50,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.58,0:41:07.09,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他们可能是一伙儿的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.17,0:41:08.59,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道 我所知道的就是
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.67,0:41:10.13,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这些家伙一年前是无名鼠辈
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.21,0:41:11.76,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,没钱没资源
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.84,0:41:14.39,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你说 如果没有外界的帮助的话
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.47,0:41:15.93,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他们怎么开始着手干这些的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.01,0:41:17.43,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你刚的牌
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.51,0:41:20.93,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,没有 我刚那张牌 在那哥们大腿上
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.56,0:41:23.27,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,变得好
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.35,0:41:24.52,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道 这真的很难
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.60,0:41:25.65,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这本书上说
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.73,0:41:27.32,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,一些很简单的动作
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.32,0:41:29.81,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,有一些人每天要练习8小时 一练就是几年
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.86,0:41:32.90,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗 那这些人真应该找份事做
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.99,0:41:35.24,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你是不是对魔术师 有抵触情绪
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.32,0:41:37.57,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,还是说那几个人
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.33,0:41:40.91,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,魔术师并没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.00,0:41:43.83,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我讨厌的是为牟利 而利用别人的混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.91,0:41:45.04,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么利用
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.12,0:41:46.46,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,再抽一张
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.58,0:41:49.50,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,利用他人弱点
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.59,0:41:52.34,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,以及他人的天真
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.42,0:41:55.30,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,来维持生计
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.51,0:41:57.18,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得这是优势
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.26,0:41:59.22,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,天真一点 我的一生会更开心
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.26,0:42:01.64,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你的牌了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.81,0:42:03.93,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.77,0:42:05.85,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.94,0:42:07.48,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是的 - 太酷了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.86,0:42:13.24,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,刚你笑了 不是假装的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.32,0:42:14.57,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,可能吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.03,0:42:17.45,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那我问你 大侦探先生
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.53,0:42:18.95,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你有没有觉得被利用了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.03,0:42:22.29,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,还是说 你觉得有一点点好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.54,0:42:25.79,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,有一个男的去看病
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.87,0:42:26.92,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,医生说: "先生"
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.00,0:42:28.08,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,"你不能再自慰了"
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.17,0:42:29.17,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他问到"为什么"
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.25,0:42:30.71,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,医生说"这样我可以早点下班"
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.79,0:42:31.88,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 丹尼 能跟你简单的谈一下
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.96,0:42:33.51,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 表演里我的角色吗 - 是 是 是 没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.59,0:42:34.84,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 伙计们
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.30,0:42:36.72,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有表演要准备了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.80,0:42:39.14,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,现在吗
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.22,0:42:40.26,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,走开 别对我用那招
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.35,0:42:41.51,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你那招对我没用的 别试了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.64,0:42:42.93,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,什么东西 看你以眼不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.02,0:42:44.60,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你就是想催眠我 我观察你一整年了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.68,0:42:46.06,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你的小把戏
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.14,0:42:47.31,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,对你来说 我这些全是小把戏
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.39,0:42:49.10,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,对啊 都说是骗人的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.19,0:42:50.90,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不就是看眼神 肢体语言 我也会
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.98,0:42:52.65,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,如果真这么容易 你怎么不对亨利试下
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.73,0:42:54.49,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,对啊 丹尼 你怎么不来试试我
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.57,0:42:56.74,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不用了 你太容易了 我还是试下贾斯敏
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.82,0:42:58.32,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.66,0:42:59.66,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,来试试我
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.74,0:43:01.16,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 对啊 你试试阿特看
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.24,0:43:02.24,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,行
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.37,0:43:03.41,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,防着他点
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.49,0:43:04.50,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 阿特 - 来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.58,0:43:06.37,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我警告你 如果我不想被读心
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.46,0:43:07.46,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那就没那么容易
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.54,0:43:09.75,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,仔细看着我 好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.38,0:43:12.29,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,阿特 说你小时候很坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.38,0:43:14.42,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你懂的 那种流氓恶棍都欺负的对象
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.51,0:43:16.42,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你有一只狗 也很坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.51,0:43:18.43,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,比较粗暴的品种 就像…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.51,0:43:20.68,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,斗牛犬
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.76,0:43:23.18,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我实际上是个比较谨慎的小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.26,0:43:26.35,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我养了只白色 毛比较蓬松的猫 名字叫"斯纳佛"
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.89,0:43:29.19,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.35,0:43:30.48,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,要不让我试试
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.56,0:43:31.65,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我可以猜的比他准很多 - 让他试试
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.73,0:43:32.82,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,别这样啊 再给我次机会 就一次
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.90,0:43:34.48,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他能猜得更准点
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.57,0:43:35.57,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这次我们来猜猜家庭方面的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.69,0:43:38.86,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你妈妈那边你有个舅舅
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.03,0:43:41.62,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他的名字很男人
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.70,0:43:43.95,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,一种有点像社会精英
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.03,0:43:45.54,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道 有点难的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.62,0:43:49.79,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,比如 保罗·汤姆森 还是 保罗…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.96,0:43:51.54,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 你赢了 我什么都读不出
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.63,0:43:53.13,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不过很近了 - 是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.21,0:43:56.63,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 我舅舅名字叫 库什曼·阿米蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.80,0:43:58.34,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗 斯纳佛 和 库什曼·阿米蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.42,0:43:59.47,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这就你的童年
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.55,0:44:01.93,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我真心希望今晚表演能比现在这处戏精彩
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.80,0:44:04.93,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心 妥妥的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.23,0:44:13.31,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托 你到底找到酒店房间了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.40,0:44:14.52,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,什么 不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.61,0:44:16.15,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不是的 是马蒂·格拉斯 迪伦
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.23,0:44:18.15,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,戏院附近没有酒店了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.24,0:44:20.61,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,等下 等等 那个傻女人跑哪里去了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.49,0:44:24.45,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 终于找到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.74,0:44:26.12,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,看到纽奥良 你就忍不住
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.24,0:44:27.24,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,观光旅游了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.33,0:44:29.54,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道这里到处都是
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.62,0:44:31.33,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,法国人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.42,0:44:32.92,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你看到那边那个女人了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.96,0:44:35.09,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那是玛丽 克莱尔
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.17,0:44:37.42,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,她给我们提供了个温馨的住处
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.76,0:44:41.09,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不客气
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.43,0:44:42.72,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.80,0:44:44.43,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有地方住了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.39,0:44:49.60,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这里安排2个 另外30个人到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.68,0:44:51.06,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,屋顶 小巷 阳台
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.14,0:44:54.23,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 随时看着骑士团 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.31,0:44:58.15,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,哇 100年前 威廉·罗宾森 改名为 程连苏
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.23,0:45:02.11,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,一生再也没有在公共场合说英文
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.95,0:45:05.78,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,另一个家伙 马克西米兰…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.99,0:45:08.95,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我对魔术历史课不感兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.41,0:45:11.87,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你甘愿被他们占便宜 那你就去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.96,0:45:13.87,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我反正是要先搞懂他们怎么想的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.96,0:45:16.17,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我帮倒忙是不
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.25,0:45:19.05,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,万一弄巧成拙怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.13,0:45:21.30,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可能 魔术会帮到他们
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.76,0:45:24.09,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,莱昂内尔·史瑞克
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.30,0:45:27.85,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,在公园的正中央 他叫一个人选一张牌 然后签名
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.93,0:45:30.93,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,然后他走到一个有20岁的大树旁边
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.10,0:45:32.52,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他们看到大树中间部分
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.60,0:45:34.69,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,透过玻璃一样看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.77,0:45:36.61,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那张签了名的牌
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.69,0:45:37.81,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你说他是怎么做到的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.90,0:45:41.23,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道 但是我肯定可以用科学解释
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.49,0:45:45.91,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,大厅里安排人了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.99,0:45:47.57,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,还没有 不过我有好消息
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.78,0:45:49.74,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道阿特拉斯是个控制狂吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.83,0:45:51.58,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他叫整组人都装了跟踪手表
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.66,0:45:52.96,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,什么跟踪手表
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.04,0:45:54.29,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他要每个人都带着一个
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.37,0:45:55.96,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,GPS定位的手表
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.04,0:45:58.13,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这些东西都是8号通讯信道
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.21,0:45:59.38,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,只要阿特拉斯能跟踪他们
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.46,0:46:00.55,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,下一个
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.63,0:46:01.71,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的人也就可以在这
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.80,0:46:03.22,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,移动通讯单位里跟踪阿特拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.30,0:46:05.26,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 有任何进展跟我汇报
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.34,0:46:06.68,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,收到
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.48,0:46:17.85,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,迪伦 这里很漂亮吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.19,0:46:22.82,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,巴黎有个地方叫艺术桥
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.99,0:46:26.82,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,有时候 早上我就坐在长凳上
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.24,0:46:28.87,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,看着人们许愿
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.99,0:46:31.08,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,然后用锁把它锁在桥上
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.16,0:46:33.83,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,然后把钥匙扔进塞纳河
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.66,0:46:40.25,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,很多人都这么做 母亲们 恋人们 老人们
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.50,0:46:42.46,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,然后看着钥匙伴随着他们的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.55,0:46:45.80,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,永远地沉入水底
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.68,0:46:51.01,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,即真实 又魔幻
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.19,0:47:02.86,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得有没有可能四骑士里有第五个人
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.36,0:47:05.61,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,可能吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.03,0:47:13.95,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,古埃及有一个
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.04,0:47:15.91,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,神秘的传说
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.37,0:47:17.66,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,正义之眼
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.37,0:47:21.84,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,据说他们完善了魔术
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.92,0:47:24.00,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,并从法老那里窃取食物
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.09,0:47:25.88,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,然后把它们给奴隶
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.26,0:47:27.47,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,至于目的是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.55,0:47:31.55,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,就是用魔法和障眼法来伸张正义
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.43,0:47:34.02,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,还会有更多的傻子排队
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.02,0:47:36.76,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,看他们的表演 相信这个美丽的神话吗
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.14,0:47:38.86,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他们能再次像在拉斯维加斯一样
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.86,0:47:41.89,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,躲过科学和逻辑的法则吗
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.73,0:47:46.99,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他们能再次在这片土地上
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.57,0:47:49.15,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,施展无知的魔术吗
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.58,0:47:57.08,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,布莱德利先生 你演的好极了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.25,0:47:59.25,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你要么闭嘴 要么走
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.33,0:48:01.63,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我知道 你不会闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.83,0:48:07.92,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想看到的人 就一定会从这个世界消失
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.13,0:48:09.30,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,休息下
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.63,0:48:11.43,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,据说你最好的一期节目
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.64,0:48:16.97,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他们给你注资了250万
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.18,0:48:19.85,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我这儿呢 有一张支票
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.60,0:48:22.85,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,价值350万
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.27,0:48:27.94,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,飞去哪里都行 我的私人飞机任你差遣
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.11,0:48:32.78,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,特雷斯勒 我们开门见山的说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.37,0:48:36.45,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你是他们出名的幕后人
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.95,0:48:38.95,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我将会是让他们名声扫地的幕后黑手
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.29,0:48:42.29,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以理解成我们协议没有达成吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.79,0:48:48.13,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这之中相比一定会有冲突
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.55,0:48:52.80,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,恕我直言
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.22,0:48:57.68,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我的钱多的可以压死你
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.89,0:49:00.73,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,帮我的律师也都是顶尖人物
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.06,0:49:04.15,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他们的手段
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.40,0:49:07.23,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,多种多样
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.48,0:49:09.73,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,到最后 你就只能无助的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.82,0:49:12.49,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,用你贪婪的小眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.32,0:49:15.82,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,看着自己所有的东西 慢慢的逝去
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.95,0:49:18.16,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我这不是第一次被威胁了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.54,0:49:21.04,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,但我到现在还活的好好的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.12,0:49:25.46,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 但是你现在是第一次被我威胁
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.33,0:49:30.76,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你敢做半点搅乱我投资的事
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.84,0:49:33.22,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,也就是你刚提到的 扳倒他们四个
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.30,0:49:38.56,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我保证你 后果不堪设想
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.18,0:49:42.18,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你这样做会后悔的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.52,0:49:45.10,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,有迷信说
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.31,0:49:48.32,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,只要有人用玩偶去发泄愤怒
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.40,0:49:52.86,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,就会有同样的愤怒带到自己身上
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.70,0:49:55.20,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你不觉得很滑稽吗
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.03,0:49:58.03,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为你不相信魔法呢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.96,0:50:09.04,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,帮我个忙
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.13,0:50:13.17,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,想像一下你最刺激的一次性爱体验
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.26,0:50:14.30,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你个不正经的 别想着钻我脑袋里来
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.38,0:50:16.26,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那可不行 如果我不进去
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.26,0:50:18.09,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那我这辈子都没机会得到你
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.18,0:50:20.18,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好了 - 那么我们继续来练习下
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.26,0:50:22.14,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这样可以帮助… - 请恕我突然登门造访
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.22,0:50:24.81,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我前来祝你们今晚好运的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.89,0:50:27.48,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,干什么 你想在你的网站上继续曝光我们的表演
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.56,0:50:28.77,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那是应众人所需
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.86,0:50:31.82,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不可能给你曝光 - 哦 是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.90,0:50:34.90,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不怕曝光 还在飞机上练习表演
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.61,0:50:40.45,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我听说是个很漂亮的飞机 阳光充裕
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.53,0:50:42.99,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,让所有魔术师梦想成真
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.08,0:50:44.50,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,没有人料到你们
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.58,0:50:46.41,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,能走到今天
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.50,0:50:48.50,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,既有成功 又有新的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.58,0:50:50.92,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你说成功 我觉得你是在说我
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.92,0:50:52.71,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我真是深感荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.84,0:50:56.22,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我一直以为自己是"什么都做不到"
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.30,0:50:58.47,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你不介意我稍微读一下你的心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.26,0:51:00.26,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,当然可以
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.26,0:51:05.93,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 我看到一个小男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.02,0:51:08.94,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,总想着有一天能成为魔术师
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.02,0:51:10.81,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,尽管他很优秀 但是还不够
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.90,0:51:14.99,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,穷尽一生也只是娱乐圈最低端的人物
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.07,0:51:18.66,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,被那些他触不可及的更有才能的人踩在脚下
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.74,0:51:21.28,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我 很接近了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.95,0:51:24.96,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,等下 你走之前我给你看下
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.96,0:51:26.91,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我新发明的魔术 有时间不
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.62,0:51:30.46,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 随便说一张牌
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.54,0:51:32.13,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 红桃K - 我就知道你要说这个
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.21,0:51:33.42,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.64,0:51:43.72,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 在你左边的袖子里 - 是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.81,0:51:45.56,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,没有啊 我没这里找不到
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.64,0:51:46.85,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,要不 你看下
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.85,0:51:49.35,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你胸口的口袋
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.19,0:51:52.19,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,就那个
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.65,0:51:58.03,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎样 十分感谢您过来参观
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.03,0:52:00.65,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,只是这里都是聪明人才来的地方 所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.91,0:52:02.91,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,祝你好运
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.99,0:52:05.16,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 你也别灰心
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.24,0:52:06.54,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,女士们 先生们
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.62,0:52:08.33,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,萨沃伊管理人员欢迎你们
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.41,0:52:10.08,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,来到今晚的精彩演出
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.17,0:52:12.92,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,四骑士团 第二弹
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.00,0:52:15.05,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,和以往演出不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.13,0:52:17.30,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,四骑士团鼓励你们录影
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.38,0:52:18.38,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,叫上你们的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.47,0:52:21.55,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,随意上传 随意微博
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.63,0:52:25.01,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 演出即将开始
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.98,0:52:30.48,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,表挺漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.64,0:52:33.98,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,祖传的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.19,0:52:39.90,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,顺便告诉你 我知道他怎么变的了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.99,0:52:41.57,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谁 - 史瑞克
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.65,0:52:43.91,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他14岁的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.99,0:52:46.16,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他看到了公园中央那棵树上有一个洞
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.24,0:52:49.91,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他认识了一个在旋转木马工作的人
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.00,0:52:52.62,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,像平常一样找他在牌上签了一个名
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.71,0:52:53.88,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,然后呢
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.96,0:52:58.13,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那个人退休之后 也就是18年后
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.21,0:53:01.47,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,伯劳去那里表演了 要之前那个人又签了次名
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.55,0:53:03.13,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,然后"嗖"一下
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.22,0:53:04.97,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,牌就进到树里去了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.05,0:53:06.93,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,其实 卡早在18年前就已经在树里了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.01,0:53:08.47,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,牌在树里面
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.56,0:53:10.56,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,跟着树一起长了18年
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.56,0:53:12.55,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说 这根本不是魔法 不是魔术
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.64,0:53:15.56,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,关键是 这个戏法就是不能近距离观看
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.65,0:53:17.65,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,要远观 甚至是年代上的久远
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.73,0:53:20.53,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,以至于能看到过去的20年
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.61,0:53:23.49,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,史瑞克淹死之后 没有人找到他的尸体
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.57,0:53:25.37,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你的意思是
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.99,0:53:31.16,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,亚瑟·特雷斯特 为您带来
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.25,0:53:32.41,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克·怀尔德
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.50,0:53:33.83,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,亨利·里夫斯
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.92,0:53:34.96,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,梅里特·麦金尼
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.04,0:53:36.71,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,以及丹尼尔·阿特拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.79,0:53:38.75,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,有请我们的四骑士
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.93,0:53:45.59,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 在我们开始前
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.68,0:53:47.72,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们今晚将把精彩的演出呈现给
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.80,0:53:48.73,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,一男一女
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.73,0:53:50.26,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,两个特殊的人
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.35,0:53:52.18,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,FBI 特工迪伦
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.27,0:53:55.40,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,以及可爱的 没经验的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.40,0:53:57.98,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,国际刑警特工艾尔玛德雷 掌声 各位
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.90,0:54:03.03,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 罗兹特工发誓说要抓到我们
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.11,0:54:07.62,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,如果他有那个能耐 当然我们也非常欢迎
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.87,0:54:14.04,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,魔术是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.12,0:54:16.62,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,就我们看来 只是障眼法
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.33,0:54:19.71,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,所以请仔细看
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.30,0:54:22.34,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,越近越好
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.76,0:54:24.47,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,因为接下来你们将看到的表演
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.01,0:54:26.72,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,看似毫无联系
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.80,0:54:28.72,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,但我保证 一定紧密相关
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.68,0:54:32.47,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,到底是七十二变呢
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.81,0:54:36.48,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,还是一个幻觉
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.11,0:54:47.11,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,现在 我们带来的是一个非常老的魔术
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.24,0:54:49.37,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼 麻烦把盒子打开
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.45,0:54:51.70,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,给大家展示一下 里面空空如也
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.91,0:54:55.91,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,现在 我们要请12位勇敢的观众
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.12,0:54:58.37,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我把这小家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.46,0:55:01.29,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,放进这个神秘的盒子
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.71,0:55:03.42,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,观众席有两支铅笔
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.51,0:55:04.76,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,麻烦举高 让我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.84,0:55:06.30,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这里 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.76,0:55:08.72,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,现在 说一个很有魔力的词
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.80,0:55:10.05,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,麻里麻里哄
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.14,0:55:11.51,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,很好 现在我挥动一下这个魔棒
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.60,0:55:13.18,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然没有用 然后…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.26,0:55:15.68,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,小兔子在众目睽睽之下凭空消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.02,0:55:19.27,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们没体验过集体催眠
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.35,0:55:20.52,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,现在就有机会了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.77,0:55:21.86,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,睡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.94,0:55:24.78,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,睡吧 沉睡吧 睡吧 …
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.86,0:55:26.44,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,睡吧 好的 睡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.53,0:55:28.57,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚我们将揭秘一些
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.66,0:55:30.78,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,神秘的魔术
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.87,0:55:34.04,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都知道那只小兔子肯定没死
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.33,0:55:36.87,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,但是又奇蹟般的出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.96,0:55:38.46,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,由于镜子的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.54,0:55:40.96,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,盒子无论如何看起来都是空的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.04,0:55:43.13,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,当你们听到"不许动"这个词的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.34,0:55:45.55,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你们就都变成了橄榄球员
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.05,0:55:48.55,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你们的任务就是擒住 摔倒
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.72,0:55:50.05,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,卸球
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.22,0:55:51.39,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,压倒
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.64,0:55:53.97,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,撕扯
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.35,0:55:56.06,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,四分卫
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.43,0:56:00.94,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都看过从帽子里变出兔子
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.02,0:56:04.02,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,但有人看过把兔子变成帽子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.44,0:56:10.91,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你们等下就会知道谁是四分卫了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.99,0:56:15.58,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,四分卫等下会说出 我告诉你们的单词"不准动"
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.38,0:56:28.38,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,三 二 一
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.76,0:56:37.72,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,把手放到中间来 一 二 三…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.81,0:56:39.23,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,干掉四分卫
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.31,0:56:40.94,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,回到你们的座位区
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.14,0:56:43.27,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我有预感马上就会见到你们
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.72,0:57:17.35,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我感觉你轻了不少
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.90,0:57:34.07,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,在休息的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.28,0:57:36.62,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要你们把银行卡的余额都写在了纸上
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.82,0:57:38.20,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,然后封在信封里
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.28,0:57:39.91,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,现在是时候拿出信封了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.99,0:57:41.12,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,都拿出来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.54,0:57:44.04,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,现在请所有人
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.12,0:57:47.09,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,大声的喊出你们自己的名字 一起喊…喊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.80,0:57:50.34,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,喊出声
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.42,0:57:54.34,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,克莱门特 佛兰尼克
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.55,0:57:56.59,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 对 我在这儿 - 哦 在后排
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.68,0:57:58.64,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 蒂娜 罗伯森
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.85,0:58:00.22,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,是我
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.31,0:58:02.64,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 喊出自己名字 喊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.02,0:58:05.98,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,希基 约瑟法
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.06,0:58:07.06,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,是我
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.15,0:58:10.07,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,约瑟法 我要你集中精力想着你的余额
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.19,0:58:12.15,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,然后大声从1数到10
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.36,0:58:13.99,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,一 二 三 四 五…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.07,0:58:15.32,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,停
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.61,0:58:17.37,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你的余额第一位是5吗
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.45,0:58:18.41,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.49,0:58:19.83,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,再来一次 这次快点
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.91,0:58:21.33,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,一 二 三 四 五 六
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.41,0:58:22.50,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,停
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.20,0:58:24.71,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,六 再数次
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.79,0:58:25.79,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,一 二
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.00,0:58:29.96,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,约瑟法 你今天账户余额是562吗
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.17,0:58:32.34,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 我就这么多
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.09,0:58:35.63,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思 你错了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.80,0:58:36.84,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 蒂娜
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.76,0:58:39.80,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,一
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.39,0:58:41.43,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,四
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.14,0:58:43.14,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,七
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.10,0:58:45.73,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是7 - 对的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.81,0:58:49.56,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得你对了 但是你错了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.65,0:58:50.82,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,克莱门特
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.90,0:58:53.86,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你账户余额不是6500
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.07,0:58:57.86,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,实际上 所有人起立
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.87,0:59:02.66,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 把信封举到额头上
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.16,0:59:05.62,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,集中精力想着余额数字
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.88,0:59:12.96,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这太…我也怕发生这样的事 天呐
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.09,0:59:15.26,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,太奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.67,0:59:18.84,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗 很不好意思 你们都错了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.05,0:59:20.89,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,关于自己银行余额有多少
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.97,0:59:23.10,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你们全都搞错了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.18,0:59:24.60,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 你们可以坐下了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.22,0:59:27.52,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 我差点忘记了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.64,0:59:30.52,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚要不是投资商特雷斯特
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.61,0:59:34.11,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们也不可能有这个演出的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.65,0:59:37.28,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,热烈鼓掌 热烈欢迎
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.49,0:59:38.82,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,阿特 就算是为了最后几处演出
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.91,0:59:40.07,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,也有劳你也过来下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.16,0:59:41.95,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 下来吧 阿特 - 下来 阿特
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.03,0:59:43.95,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他来了 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.04,0:59:45.08,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,安排妥善了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.16,0:59:47.21,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,妥妥的 全员待命
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.29,0:59:48.75,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,很好 封锁现场 不允许任何人出入
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.83,0:59:50.00,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他来了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.63,0:59:52.84,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,阿特 你填了你自己的信封吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.92,0:59:54.75,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 不用了 我们帮你准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.42,0:59:58.22,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,阿特 让我猜猜
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.30,1:00:00.51,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,140以上 对吗
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.64,1:00:04.31,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,顺便说下 是1.4亿
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.93,1:00:08.94,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 梅里特
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.10,1:00:11.02,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他的余额为什么是正确的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.10,1:00:12.27,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,而其他人的都发生错误了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.40,1:00:15.78,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得有可能是 他的 也错了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.94,1:00:18.07,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,请所有人拿出那张纸
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.24,1:00:20.78,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,用座位底的手电
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.95,1:00:22.78,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,照亮你们那张纸
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.95,1:00:26.12,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,然后你们正确的余额就会慢慢浮现
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.75,1:00:32.96,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,阿特 你先别担心 我们也给你准备了一个手电
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.29,1:00:34.34,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.09,1:00:42.47,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,看着
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.30,1:00:44.64,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼尔什么情况
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.72,1:00:46.22,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,等下 这真奇怪 一秒前还是…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.47,1:00:50.23,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,144,579,651美元
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.31,1:00:51.31,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,而现在
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.85,1:00:54.86,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,少了 70,000美元
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.15,1:00:59.61,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,约瑟法麻烦你站起来
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.69,1:01:00.74,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.99,1:01:02.66,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你新的余额是多少
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.95,1:01:07.29,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,现在有70,562在我账上
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.41,1:01:13.79,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,有没有可能是因为 阿特的钱变到了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.92,1:01:16.00,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,约瑟法的账户里
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.13,1:01:18.63,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 快看 又一次减少了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.05,1:01:20.09,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.51,1:01:23.84,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 真的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.18,1:01:27.35,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,阿特的余额又少了280,000美元
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.51,1:01:29.56,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,蒂娜 罗伯斯 你的余额是多少来着
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.81,1:01:33.56,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,281,477美元
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.40,1:01:39.07,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们承认我们错了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.28,1:01:41.28,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,她说的对 我们撒谎了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.36,1:01:43.03,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 你们都不是随机抽选的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.15,1:01:45.57,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你们都有一个共同点
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.12,1:01:47.99,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你们所有人都是经济危机时期的受害者
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.08,1:01:50.95,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,在曾经辉煌的城市里
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.04,1:01:53.62,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,一个个失去了你们的房子 你们的车
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.08,1:01:55.08,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,生意倒闭
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.25,1:01:56.25,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,失去了你们爱的人
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.38,1:01:59.55,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,但是你们所有人都投保了同一家公司
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.71,1:02:01.59,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,特雷斯勒保险公司
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.72,1:02:03.88,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你们被抛弃了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.97,1:02:05.05,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,保险公司钻各种空子
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.13,1:02:06.34,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不给予赔偿
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.72,1:02:10.35,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这些都是表演 不是真的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.43,1:02:12.98,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你说的"这些"是指 当着这么多观众和在舞台上吗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.27,1:02:14.89,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这样的话 那我回答 是的 为了表演 - 哇 哇
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.19,1:02:17.69,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我银行账户里有82,000美元了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.86,1:02:19.69,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚手机收到银行短信说的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.94,1:02:23.07,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,所有人快看你们的手机
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.87,1:02:31.87,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这都是真的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.08,1:02:33.25,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.54,1:02:34.62,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,又偷到了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.79,1:02:36.37,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道 说不定
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.12,1:02:39.25,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 是你干的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.46,1:02:41.67,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可能是我们 阿特
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.75,1:02:42.92,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们又没有你的密码
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.26,1:02:44.55,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们也想知道你的私人信息
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.63,1:02:46.55,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,但却无从着手
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.76,1:02:48.72,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你的密保 比如
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.93,1:02:50.47,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你妈妈的中间名字 我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.60,1:02:52.06,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,或者你第一个宠物的名字
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.14,1:02:53.93,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你说我们怎么可能知道 阿特
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.43,1:02:56.06,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你肯定不会告诉我们的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.85,1:03:00.94,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,收到确认 确实偷到了 他们刚打劫了他
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.28,1:03:04.74,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,别让他们逃了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.82,1:03:06.82,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心 飞机和车留给你了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.79,1:03:15.12,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你们会付出惨重代价的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.12,1:03:19.13,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,站住
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.83,1:03:21.63,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,站住 所有人都别动
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.59,1:03:24.67,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不许动
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.92,1:03:26.47,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,四分卫
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.34,1:03:31.35,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是四骑士团
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.85,1:03:32.93,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,各位晚安
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.15,1:03:46.53,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,把他们推开
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.28,1:03:48.86,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,滚开 都下去
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.21,1:04:00.58,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.01,1:04:11.18,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 所有这条街上的人注意
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.93,1:04:19.89,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 四分卫 - 四分卫
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.35,1:04:22.86,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,富勒 在戏院门口等我
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.94,1:04:24.52,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,带上跟踪器
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.61,1:04:26.98,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,快走 快点
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.07,1:04:28.19,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,跟踪器给我
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.65,1:04:29.65,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,出发了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.78,1:04:35.08,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,FBI 让开
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.79,1:04:36.95,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 迪伦 - 混蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.04,1:04:38.04,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么发现
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.12,1:04:39.62,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,跟着红点 他就在那里
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.71,1:04:42.75,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 我带着这个 包抄他们 断掉他们后路
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.71,1:04:46.25,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他在勃艮第大街左转了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.96,1:05:24.50,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 让开
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.58,1:05:25.92,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,让开 让开
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.59,1:05:30.30,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我看到他朝北走了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.38,1:05:32.26,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不好意思 快让开 - 嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.34,1:05:34.34,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 借过快让 借过
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.81,1:05:47.48,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟丢了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.86,1:05:54.86,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋 你在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.83,1:06:08.04,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,借过
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.13,1:06:16.14,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他正朝交易所跑去
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.51,1:06:19.56,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,站住
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.56,1:06:27.90,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你犯什么傻呢
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.36,1:06:33.49,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他进拿破仑小区了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.53,1:06:37.07,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,让开 让开
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.95,1:06:39.49,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,快让开
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.20,1:06:41.20,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.04,1:06:43.04,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,让开
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.37,1:06:47.63,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他在厕所 我抓到他了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.75,1:06:50.04,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 不
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.92,1:06:53.09,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不许动
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.92,1:06:55.22,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,放下你的武器
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.47,1:06:56.55,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.80,1:06:58.80,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直在跟踪自己
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.30,1:07:01.26,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,四骑士他们把追踪器放到
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.35,1:07:03.02,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他们嘴里所说的新手特工身上了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.10,1:07:04.27,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,FBI的能力问题
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.39,1:07:06.64,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,遭到了质疑
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.77,1:07:09.48,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,以及这单案子的负责人
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.56,1:07:11.02,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,迪伦
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.11,1:07:12.78,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,该特工被当众取笑
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.86,1:07:15.74,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,甚至参与了今晚的表演
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.11,1:07:17.36,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,说他弄巧成拙
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.45,1:07:19.28,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这个笑话瞬间传遍了全国
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.57,1:07:22.37,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,看起来四骑士在这几天的时间里
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.58,1:07:24.87,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,又一次带来了奇蹟
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.12,1:07:26.83,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,而仅在两晚前 四骑士
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.96,1:07:28.33,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,成功障眼 偷走了巴黎一家银行的钱
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.62,1:07:29.79,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.96,1:07:32.09,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你干嘛呢
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.17,1:07:33.55,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我在喝闷酒
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.63,1:07:38.01,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我来接你的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.59,1:07:39.80,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我很担心你
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.97,1:07:41.47,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你担心我 好吧 应该是我担心你
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.60,1:07:42.72,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你有机会瞄准阿特拉斯的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.81,1:07:44.06,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,但是他没有武器
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.14,1:07:45.64,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能就这样开枪 你自己清楚
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.77,1:07:48.60,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,是 但是你却让他走了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.77,1:07:49.98,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.56,1:07:52.23,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,一个法国妹子无端端跑出来
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.31,1:07:54.02,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,故意假装好像是我的搭档 然后让逃犯跑掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.11,1:07:55.23,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,放开我的手
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.32,1:07:56.99,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.15,1:08:01.16,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我记得好像 你说你是个文职啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.20,1:08:07.45,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,还不错
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.37,1:08:10.37,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.38,1:08:14.84,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,什么是荷鲁斯之眼
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.00,1:08:18.01,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚我什么都不想说
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.13,1:08:20.68,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,等你清醒了再跟我说
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.18,1:08:23.35,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,自己找回家的路吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.35,1:08:30.52,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,布莱德利先生 特雷斯勒想请你喝一杯
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.95,1:08:40.99,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,先生 你的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.20,1:08:42.45,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.82,1:08:46.04,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟他们到底什么关系
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.20,1:08:47.20,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,关系
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.41,1:08:49.12,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 你好像很清楚他们的一言一行
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.20,1:08:51.00,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他们要去哪里 他们要干什么
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.21,1:08:52.88,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,如果这样想能舒服点的话
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.00,1:08:54.21,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这跟你都没关系 不要自责
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.29,1:08:57.76,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那你告诉我 为什么都跟我没有关系
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.51,1:09:01.09,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,特雷斯勒先生 这些都是魔术小把戏
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.34,1:09:03.68,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,只是大规模的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.05,1:09:08.02,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,而你 只是个棋子
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.56,1:09:11.35,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他们设下陷阱 是用来娱乐的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.56,1:09:15.73,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我的1.4亿用来娱乐
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.57,1:09:17.73,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.40,1:09:22.57,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,正是你这种自大 让你一开始就陷入了他们的圈套
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.03,1:09:24.57,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你一直觉得
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.70,1:09:26.24,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你知道的… - "我可以轻松让你消失"
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.37,1:09:27.74,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.95,1:09:29.24,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,但 你不会
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.79,1:09:31.96,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会扳倒他们
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.08,1:09:34.12,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不管这个把戏如何
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.42,1:09:37.21,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟也是好久之前就设计好的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.42,1:09:41.97,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我坚信接下来发生的更令人惊讶
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.80,1:09:47.35,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我建议你 坐在前排的位置 慢慢的观看吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.81,1:09:50.47,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟你付了1.4亿门票
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.68,1:09:52.73,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,无论你曝光他们要多少钱
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.85,1:09:58.40,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我都双倍付给你
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.61,1:09:59.98,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我要你扳倒他们 曝光他们
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.40,1:10:02.40,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我说五百万
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.11,1:10:04.36,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我会退缩吗
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.49,1:10:08.08,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.86,1:11:29.99,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.37,1:11:33.58,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 昨天把你压在桌子上
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.66,1:11:35.25,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,应该是我道歉才对
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.33,1:11:37.58,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我是个混蛋 当时我喝醉了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.54,1:11:42.17,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我太失落了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.09,1:11:49.51,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道 梅里特他是对的 说我几乎没离开过书桌
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.55,1:11:52.85,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是个调研人员 这才是我的专业
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.97,1:11:57.85,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那么 这东西都说什么
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.56,1:12:01.23,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,据推测 如果你相信的话
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.31,1:12:02.69,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,正义之眼就是
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.77,1:12:03.94,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,魔法的先祖
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.02,1:12:06.94,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,它会保护练习真正魔法的人
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.03,1:12:08.95,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,入会的候选人
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.03,1:12:12.20,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,必须服从一系列的考验
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.20,1:12:16.41,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这不可能 - 但有人相信是真的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.87,1:12:18.41,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,能给我下不
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.21,1:12:24.50,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,根据这里所说 两个世纪才会重新选一次人
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.59,1:12:28.00,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那又如何 四骑士所做的事情就是为了通过测验
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.09,1:12:29.30,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我不知道 - 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.38,1:12:34.39,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我意思是 我猜如果不是的话 这些人可以直接偷银行
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.47,1:12:36.81,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,没必要表演出来
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.89,1:12:38.39,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,也有可能真的只是个神话
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.48,1:12:42.60,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,但是 这完全不符合逻辑 而且我觉得逻辑科学也无法解释
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.69,1:12:45.27,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你怎么知道 - 我不清楚
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.53,1:12:51.15,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得有些东西
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.24,1:12:55.62,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,向前迈进一大步才能明白
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.62,1:13:05.75,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好的 我该走… - 好的 没问题
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.84,1:13:08.01,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谢谢 晚安 - 你也是 晚安
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.09,1:13:09.88,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不好意思 - 没事
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.38,1:13:15.85,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,如果荷鲁斯之眼真的有 我们必须假设他们正监视着我们 是吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.93,1:13:17.18,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.26,1:13:19.89,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得有人监视我们 但是绝对不是魔法
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.98,1:13:22.94,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你猜测是对的 这根本就不是你的手机
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.02,1:13:27.73,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,是照你手机样子做出来的 除了安装了这个
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.82,1:13:29.11,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,漏洞
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.19,1:13:33.03,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,有人在监听你每一个电话和短信
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.28,1:13:34.49,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是他们如何总能提前猜到我们的行动
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.61,1:13:35.45,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.78,1:13:38.58,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,去拿阿特拉斯的审问录影过来
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.91,1:13:40.45,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 长官 我硬碟上有
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.29,1:13:43.37,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,有图像了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.83,1:13:45.58,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 快进
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.96,1:13:47.42,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,继续 继续 停住
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.21,1:13:50.01,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 一帧帧的快进 继续
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.88,1:13:51.92,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,播放
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.05,1:13:55.34,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,停 放大点
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.80,1:13:57.60,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,就那里 那就是他如何偷天换日的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.89,1:14:00.06,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那个东西还在发送消息吗
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.22,1:14:01.64,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不 只有你打电话和短信的时候才会
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.85,1:14:02.81,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,再加上我已经拿出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.89,1:14:04.44,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 把他放回去
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.69,1:14:06.48,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他们不知道 我们知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.69,1:14:08.69,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这样以来 反而我们领先他们一步
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.77,1:14:10.90,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还要假装和不知道一样 懂吗
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.32,1:14:12.65,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,找到我自己原本的手机 跟踪它
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.74,1:14:16.07,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,已经跟踪了 20分钟前在纽约
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.28,1:14:17.32,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,很好
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.70,1:14:19.41,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,切断他们所有供给
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.49,1:14:20.58,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他们的电 断掉
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.79,1:14:24.08,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,手机 电力 水 全部断掉
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.29,1:14:25.33,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,榨干他们
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.42,1:14:27.17,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我要他们感觉到我们的存在
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.25,1:14:28.75,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,给我安排飞机
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.51,1:14:33.34,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,防火墙崩溃 他们知道了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.42,1:14:34.38,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是指谁
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.47,1:14:36.26,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他们 就是 就是我们上面的人
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.47,1:14:37.64,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们上面是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.76,1:14:39.85,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们准备好坐牢了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.93,1:14:40.93,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,别自乱阵脚了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.14,1:14:42.22,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,但确实来抓我们了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.43,1:14:44.02,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那只是抓你 没说要抓我们
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.14,1:14:45.73,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,大家看下能不能这样
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.81,1:14:47.10,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我可不想坐牢 你知道吗
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.19,1:14:48.98,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那就别搞砸了 你一直说想被
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.06,1:14:50.27,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,当成年人一样看待
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.36,1:14:51.53,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那现在就表现的像个成年人一样
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.61,1:14:53.78,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,严格按照计划执行 在这待着 烧掉所有东西
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.87,1:15:08.08,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我都不知道我在干什么
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.29,1:15:09.25,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那你在别的地方又能干什么
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.33,1:15:11.80,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直等着熬出头
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.13,1:15:14.26,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,就这样了 我走了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.34,1:15:16.51,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,等这一切都结束了 你想干什么都行
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.72,1:15:18.84,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,但在那之前 按计划来
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.93,1:15:20.97,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,各位 条子来了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.81,1:15:24.81,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我的人准备好了 - 那快点出发吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.89,1:15:26.18,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不 - 什么
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.27,1:15:27.48,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,她没有权利
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.73,1:15:28.98,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,她跟我一起的 国际刑警
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.06,1:15:30.06,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,她留这里
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.15,1:15:31.44,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,什么 你说什么
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.52,1:15:32.52,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,在车里待着
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.78,1:15:35.99,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.62,1:15:42.66,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 出发了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.12,1:15:48.12,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,联邦调查局
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.38,1:15:53.71,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,女士优先
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.30,1:15:55.51,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,别动
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.55,1:16:03.01,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.10,1:16:04.85,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我的钱用对地方了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.35,1:16:07.27,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那必须的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.02,1:16:10.52,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那我问你
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.31,1:16:12.98,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你想怎么解决他们呢
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.15,1:16:15.19,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,是做炖肉丁还是油炸
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.44,1:16:16.48,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,剁碎吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.57,1:16:19.03,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我会跟大厨说的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.60,1:17:35.61,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,别动
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.78,1:17:43.78,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,迪伦
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.74,1:17:45.91,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,等等
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.24,1:17:49.29,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你这…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.79,1:17:54.79,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,过来
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.54,1:17:58.46,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,5号安全 6号待命
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.67,1:18:00.73,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 该死的 - 该死的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.01,1:18:03.22,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你在耍什么把戏 - 你在耍什么把戏
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.55,1:18:05.59,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,6号安全 过去7号
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.68,1:18:07.72,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,收到 去7号 快 快 快
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.39,1:18:10.39,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不要 不要 回去
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.97,1:18:12.10,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.85,1:18:15.06,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这边
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.09,1:18:47.22,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这边
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.30,1:18:49.01,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好…好…等等…等等
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.93,1:18:52.77,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 真的吗 - 对啊
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.94,1:18:57.94,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.78,1:19:03.23,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你这…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.29,1:19:20.34,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,该死的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.73,1:19:39.77,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,该死的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.15,1:19:42.52,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,快给我
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.51,1:20:10.47,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,各单位注意 包围北边出口
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.55,1:20:11.85,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,埃文这边安全
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.93,1:20:13.76,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,堵住所有可能的出口
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.85,1:20:15.35,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 别走 混蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.85,1:20:18.98,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 联邦调查局 算是吧 我要用你的车 谢谢 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.06,1:20:20.06,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.19,1:20:23.82,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,停下来 停下来
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.96,1:20:41.00,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,喂
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.82,1:21:11.74,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,很好 跟着他
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.86,1:21:13.91,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不要再跟我说什么待在车里 再也别
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.99,1:21:15.33,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有战术指挥权
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.41,1:21:17.79,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不相信我 直接告诉我就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.87,1:21:19.45,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,向我保证 下次 你会支持我
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.54,1:21:21.58,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们能迟点讨论这个问题吗 拜托了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.66,1:21:23.25,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不行
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.33,1:21:25.59,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好好好…我向你保证 走 马上
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.05,1:21:35.55,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他们去哪了 - 他们在哪
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.64,1:21:37.31,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道 她刚刚征用了别人的车
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.39,1:21:38.85,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他们在哪 - 那条路 那条路
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.93,1:21:39.97,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那是你的车吗 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.06,1:21:41.52,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.13,1:22:08.13,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他在那里
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.01,1:22:21.02,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,快点
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.40,1:22:26.44,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,转左
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.77,1:22:30.57,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在罗斯福路的东边
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.65,1:22:32.49,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这不是东边 - 是北边 北边
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.57,1:22:34.61,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们在罗斯福路的北边 - 什么啊
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.70,1:22:36.78,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们正向罗斯福路上方过去
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.86,1:22:39.78,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,纽约警察局和联邦特工
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.87,1:22:41.79,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,正在高速追击一部
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.87,1:22:43.12,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,黑色轿车
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.29,1:22:49.29,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,富勒 你在那里
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.54,1:22:51.34,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,就在这 正在你屁股后面
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.42,1:22:53.46,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在找一个更好的射击点
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.97,1:22:57.05,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,快点
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.82,1:23:13.94,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他们好像在转向
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.03,1:23:16.15,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,是去59号大桥路
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.20,1:23:19.78,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,一旦他们在范围内
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.87,1:23:21.70,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会转播你实时情况
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.21,1:23:28.42,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,很好 继续跟着他
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.80,1:23:37.05,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,快快快
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.05,1:23:42.60,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,小心点 你在巴士后面
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.18,1:23:47.23,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,超过去
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.81,1:23:51.86,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,该死的
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.55,1:24:16.55,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这边
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.80,1:24:19.22,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,退后 别过来
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.72,1:24:22.01,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,迪伦 走 我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.22,1:24:23.22,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 你…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.72,1:24:26.77,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快点 快走 - 他要死在里面了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.85,1:24:28.23,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,别管他了 你又不能做什么
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.31,1:24:30.23,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们快走 别管他了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.02,1:24:36.40,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那张纸 - 迪伦
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.65,1:24:38.57,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,快 快走 我们快走
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.76,1:25:08.02,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,今天 大受欢迎且存争议的魔术团
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.10,1:25:10.10,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,很快就捕获了人心
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.18,1:25:13.52,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,但一场从唐人街开始的追捕
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.60,1:25:17.40,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,演变成高速公路追击
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.48,1:25:20.44,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,最终造成致命的车祸并夺去了杰克·怀尔德的生命
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.53,1:25:22.82,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他正是所谓的"四骑士团"其中之一
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.03,1:25:28.12,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,至于其他3个骑士现在仍下落不明
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.00,1:25:35.67,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,迪伦 他们刚研究出杰克车里的那张纸是什么了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.75,1:25:37.04,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那他们知道是什么了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.13,1:25:38.84,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,还有为什么他宁愿死也要保护那张纸
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.92,1:25:40.59,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,埃文 正在路上 很快就过来向我们汇报了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.67,1:25:42.22,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.30,1:25:43.59,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定想先拿着这个吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.68,1:25:44.68,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.76,1:25:47.05,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你朋友赛迪斯·布莱德利打的
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.56,1:25:48.81,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,罗兹
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.89,1:25:50.52,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道这神奇的助理
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.60,1:25:52.73,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,是干什么的吧 罗兹警官
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.06,1:25:54.52,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,知道啊 她能在魔术师变戏法时
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.60,1:25:55.81,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,分散观众的注意力
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.06,1:25:59.23,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,大错特错
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.65,1:26:01.40,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,当你在看魔术师表演时
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.24,1:26:04.49,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,看似无辜的助理正在牵线搭桥
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.70,1:26:07.83,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你没觉得奇怪吗 国际刑警为什么要
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.91,1:26:11.37,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,一个新人来帮你
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.83,1:26:14.00,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么她要求接手这一单案子来
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.42,1:26:16.33,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,她是被派遣过来的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.21,1:26:18.59,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,天命难违啊
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.17,1:26:22.26,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,就像要你从牌堆里抽一张一样
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.42,1:26:26.01,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我发现奇怪的地方了 你怎么突然这么大方了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.09,1:26:27.22,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你有什么好处
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.39,1:26:29.22,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,只是想让这场争斗公平点
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.43,1:26:33.43,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么觉得我在对牛弹琴
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.60,1:26:38.36,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,聪明点 罗兹
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.57,1:26:44.78,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.95,1:26:47.03,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那是保险箱
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.11,1:26:48.57,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 不 嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.66,1:26:49.95,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他在这干嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.12,1:26:51.70,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,给我们条线索
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.79,1:26:53.66,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在过去五年里调查了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.75,1:26:54.91,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,一个叫埃尔克霍恩
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.00,1:26:56.96,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 的私家安保 - 然后呢
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.04,1:26:58.71,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他们藏了差不多50亿美元
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.79,1:27:01.25,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我没问你 我问他
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.63,1:27:03.97,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那些钱在女王路的一间仓库里的保险箱里
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.13,1:27:06.63,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得这个保险箱就是他们魔术师的终极目标
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.80,1:27:08.72,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你从刚刚死在桥上那个魔术师
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.80,1:27:12.27,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,快要烧焦的手里拿到了埃尔克霍恩的机密文件
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.64,1:27:14.64,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,以及他们有些什么扯淡花招
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.93,1:27:16.81,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那些魔术师跟贼没什么区别
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.89,1:27:18.10,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是怎么拿到文件的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.40,1:27:22.44,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,罗兹警官 这你应该再清楚不过了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.65,1:27:24.94,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他们利用你手机上的远程代码
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.03,1:27:27.32,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,骇了你的移动指挥中心之后
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.41,1:27:28.99,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,又骇进了我的伺服器
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.16,1:27:32.99,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,当时 是你要我们全部出去追他们的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.41,1:27:36.00,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你这不专业的程度表现得
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.08,1:27:38.58,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,就已经很像是魔术了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.67,1:27:40.92,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,"麻里麻里哄"我来接管了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.34,1:27:44.26,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,老大 他要接管
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.80,1:27:46.80,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.64,1:27:51.10,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 我有话跟你说
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.18,1:27:52.35,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不要再那样跟我说话了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.43,1:27:54.47,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你为什么要接这个案子 - 什么
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.56,1:27:56.73,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,人们说我"人心难懂"这是美国人的说法
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.81,1:27:58.23,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你明白吗
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.31,1:27:59.35,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,明白
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.48,1:28:01.73,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,很好 那就让我向你明确地说清楚
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.81,1:28:04.19,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我发现你不是你口口声声
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.28,1:28:05.57,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,所说的身份 我发誓…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.69,1:28:07.49,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,法国人也有这么个词
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.32,1:28:10.99,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,"愚公移山"
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.07,1:28:12.74,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要想抓到四骑士团
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.83,1:28:14.66,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那你得相信我
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.91,1:28:16.91,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我完全没必要害你
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.00,1:28:19.75,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚被数落了一番
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.83,1:28:21.38,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这个案子已经不归我管了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.46,1:28:24.80,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我没多少时间了 信念太奢侈
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.01,1:28:33.22,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克想成为最有名的魔术师
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.30,1:28:38.68,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,比他生命中的任何事都重要
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.77,1:28:40.14,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能说他已经做到了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.23,1:28:44.19,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我真心希望 有他的地方都充满了魔力
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.94,1:28:48.28,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,但关键是…抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.36,1:28:49.82,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,关键是…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.90,1:28:56.12,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,人在江湖 身不由己
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.20,1:28:58.75,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们已经着手一件比我们本身更重要的事了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.83,1:29:00.66,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们一定要把它做完
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.72,1:29:10.80,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,靠近仓库中
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.88,1:29:13.39,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,5号和6号队分别掩护北门和南门入口
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.47,1:29:14.72,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在就去地下室
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.81,1:29:22.73,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 保险箱呢 保险箱呢
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.90,1:29:27.90,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.98,1:29:29.36,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这该死的保险箱去哪了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.44,1:29:31.32,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你们刚在外面的时候就已经搬出去了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.40,1:29:32.57,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 埃文的命令 - 什么
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.66,1:29:33.70,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我从没说过啊
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.78,1:29:35.12,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,先生 你打了电话
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.24,1:29:36.83,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,还说"华盛顿"想搬走保险箱
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.91,1:29:38.99,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我绝对没有说
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.08,1:29:39.75,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.29,1:29:42.54,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你告诉我这是怎么回事 这简直是扯淡
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.62,1:29:43.71,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,别这样
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.59,1:29:51.09,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.30,1:29:54.26,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你这是在干什么
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.34,1:29:56.22,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,应该是贝多芬的 D大调协奏曲
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.30,1:29:57.30,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,保险箱呢
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.39,1:29:58.47,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他们正在装上货车
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.77,1:30:04.44,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嘿 嘿 - 嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.98,1:30:07.15,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 拦住货车 - 别走
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.15,1:30:10.32,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 别走 - 嘿 拦住货车
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.95,1:30:20.83,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这是怎么回事啊 我们还有任务呢
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.91,1:30:22.66,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,现在你有新的任务了 把它打开
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.63,1:30:28.42,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,听好 我是这样想的
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.50,1:30:30.75,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,现在 他们以为这保险箱已经送走了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.01,1:30:32.13,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们就跟着它吧
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.21,1:30:34.13,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们跟着它去…这是去哪的
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.38,1:30:35.47,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,女王街5号 在大街的那头
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.93,1:30:38.80,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们去女王街5号吧 保险箱去哪我们就去哪
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.01,1:30:40.10,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,它能带我们去到他们那儿
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.02,1:30:42.18,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩跟我
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.82,1:30:56.07,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,伙计们
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.03,1:30:59.53,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,看 局里打电话来了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.62,1:31:01.49,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,20分钟前四骑士团传到YouTube上的
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.87,1:31:05.46,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,人在江湖…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.71,1:31:07.54,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,身不由己
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.71,1:31:10.21,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们已经着手于一件比我们本身更重要的事了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.38,1:31:11.96,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们一定要把它做完
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.05,1:31:14.59,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,当你们看到我们时 记住杰克·怀尔德这个名字
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.67,1:31:16.55,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们7点到女王街5号
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.80,1:31:17.89,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他们的表演还有30分钟就开始了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.97,1:31:19.22,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,而那正是我们要去的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.39,1:31:21.51,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道啊 老大 虽然我不想唱反调
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.72,1:31:23.68,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,但不得不说 这些家伙太狡猾了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.77,1:31:26.39,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,罗兹 他们只是搞娱乐的
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.90,1:31:31.07,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚女王街5号 将让您头晕目眩
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.15,1:31:34.99,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,戏弄FBI的魔术团四骑士 将带来最后压轴大戏
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.07,1:31:36.49,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,骑士团诚邀大家观看他们最后一出戏
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.57,1:31:38.74,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,也是三人面向FBI的最后一站
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.24,1:31:42.58,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他们还有什么身藏绝技呢 今晚就来探个究竟吧
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.92,1:31:56.17,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,仔细监控那部货车 看看有谁接近
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.26,1:31:57.59,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,收到
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.77,1:32:15.61,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,罗兹警官 富勒
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.28,1:32:17.28,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,说吧
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.44,1:32:20.07,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这边有动静 有人向货车走去
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.20,1:32:21.66,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,是个女的
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.41,1:32:26.58,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 别动 - 该死的
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.37,1:32:29.87,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.96,1:32:33.29,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 他是电视上那家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.38,1:32:34.42,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,放下你的枪
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.63,1:32:37.46,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧瞧这是谁啊 第五骑士啊
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.63,1:32:38.63,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你在开玩笑吧
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.72,1:32:40.55,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我在跟着他们 跟你一样
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.63,1:32:42.22,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有跟踪任何人
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.30,1:32:44.05,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,而你一直领先我们一步
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.14,1:32:45.76,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不过你猜怎么着 我现在在你前面了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.97,1:32:47.60,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你干什么我都知道
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.81,1:32:49.56,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你们FBI还是这么白痴
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.77,1:32:50.81,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.89,1:32:51.98,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这是以前莱昂内尔史瑞克
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.10,1:32:54.15,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,排练表演的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.61,1:32:56.44,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,也是我第一次演出的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.65,1:32:59.45,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,现在 如果你想知道你到底有多白痴
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.65,1:33:00.90,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不如打开它
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.28,1:33:02.91,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,罗兹警官 当你打开它时
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.20,1:33:04.83,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你能表演给我看下
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.03,1:33:06.95,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,什么叫傻货吗
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.12,1:33:09.20,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,肯定会是我DVD一个很好的封面
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.54,1:33:11.79,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,打开保险箱
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.87,1:33:13.38,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 去吧 - 打开
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.71,1:33:18.76,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.18,1:33:22.26,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.51,1:33:23.59,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,把它给我
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.80,1:33:24.85,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,别
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.01,1:33:26.01,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,别这样
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.64,1:33:31.69,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.81,1:33:33.81,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,快退后
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.40,1:33:43.53,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,谁不喜欢看精彩的魔术呢
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.20,1:33:46.53,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你们追了一次空箱子
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.87,1:33:51.04,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,又一次啊 选错了方向
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.00,1:33:59.63,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,表演开始了 快走
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.71,1:34:02.22,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,罗兹警官 我现在想问你的是
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.72,1:34:04.84,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,"真的那个箱子呢"
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.49,1:34:27.24,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,让开 叫他们让开
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.32,1:34:28.91,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 叫他们让开 让出路来
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.33,1:34:32.20,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,联邦调查局 让出路来
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.83,1:34:34.42,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,让开 让开
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.67,1:34:36.04,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,什么是魔术呢
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.88,1:34:37.92,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,魔术就是障眼法
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.04,1:34:39.75,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,但 是能让观众高兴
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.00,1:34:41.67,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,娱乐观众 鼓舞观众的把戏
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.88,1:34:44.22,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,小心 让一让
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.59,1:34:45.68,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,是一种信念
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.76,1:34:46.76,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,信仰
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.89,1:34:47.89,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,信任
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.89,1:34:53.27,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,没有这些本质
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.35,1:34:56.77,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,魔术 作为一种艺术形式 就会永远消失
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.35,1:34:59.19,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,但是 如果这些本质
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.40,1:35:01.36,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,没有用在更好的目标上
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.57,1:35:04.36,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那就会变成了欺骗 谎言
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.57,1:35:06.78,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,如果是为了个人所需或贪念
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.95,1:35:08.62,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那就不再是魔术了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.78,1:35:09.87,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那是犯罪
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.08,1:35:13.08,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,所以今晚 为了我们的最后一轮演出
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.16,1:35:16.00,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,大家要帮我们矫正我们的行为
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.13,1:35:21.30,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,罗兹 这是怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.55,1:35:22.71,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.80,1:35:24.97,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,表演开始
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.14,1:35:31.14,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,看
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.48,1:35:37.39,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他们在屋顶 我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.48,1:35:38.77,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,快 快 快
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.48,1:35:40.81,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 迪伦 - 联邦调查局 让一让
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.40,1:35:43.44,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你在这干嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.57,1:35:44.65,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他们走的方向是错的
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.78,1:35:45.82,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道的
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.11,1:35:48.45,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,罗兹 我需要全部人都来
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.57,1:35:51.91,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你要相信我 相信我一次也好
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.74,1:35:53.83,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,等等
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.12,1:35:55.29,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我要跟她一起去
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.45,1:35:56.71,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,去吧 我在这里等你 我帮你看着
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.54,1:35:59.58,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,快去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.67,1:36:01.17,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,富勒 这次算你头上了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.56,1:36:20.60,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,快走 快 快 快
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.70,1:36:32.78,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼尔
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.91,1:36:39.54,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,对我们来说…这危险时期
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.75,1:36:43.09,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,越走越近 并且也快到尾声了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.29,1:36:45.96,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我想为了我们的友谊
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.05,1:36:47.63,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,发表一下感受
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.88,1:36:48.92,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,行啊
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.30,1:36:52.80,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯…当我第一次遇到你时 我就觉得你不是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.64,1:36:55.64,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好货
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.14,1:36:58.18,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,然后呢
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.98,1:37:01.65,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,没了 就这么多
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.90,1:37:02.90,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,很好
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.98,1:37:04.48,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嗯 - 我很感动
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.65,1:37:06.11,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 这是我的心里话
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.32,1:37:07.90,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这样啊 我还没告诉你我哪里感动了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.66,1:37:14.32,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊表演结束了我们怎么办啊
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.58,1:37:15.66,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还是我们啊
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.74,1:37:17.41,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的蓝图只说到表演结束之后
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.33,1:37:20.21,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,哪怕如果没有"正义之眼"
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.29,1:37:22.00,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们完成表演后
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.12,1:37:24.13,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,在监狱呆20年 然后
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.67,1:37:26.34,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我想说…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.59,1:37:28.96,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 我也是
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.30,1:37:32.22,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,太多愁善感了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.18,1:37:40.27,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他们在那
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.27,1:37:46.02,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,抓住他们 快 快 快
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.15,1:37:47.15,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,抓住他们
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.15,1:37:53.20,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,起来
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.66,1:37:54.82,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这是假的
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.62,1:37:59.79,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,靠
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.00,1:38:10.26,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你好 纽约
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.72,1:38:20.68,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,感谢魔术
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.89,1:38:21.98,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,感谢如此高清热涨的
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.06,1:38:25.06,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,观众们
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.48,1:38:27.48,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,很不幸的是 就像所有美好的事物一样
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.56,1:38:29.36,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,总会结束的
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.07,1:38:34.57,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,在今晚的表演开幕之际
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.66,1:38:36.20,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,就已经要跟大家说再见了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.57,1:38:38.91,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们所想做的只是
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.99,1:38:40.95,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,给世界带来一次充满魔幻的表演
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.04,1:38:42.50,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,由此带给世界一点点
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.58,1:38:43.75,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,魔力
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.75,1:38:48.92,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,让开
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.68,1:39:01.89,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这对我们来说将会是 精彩的最后一次
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.43,1:39:04.77,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,但是就要和你们告别了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.94,1:39:06.27,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,晚安 纽约
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.52,1:39:07.94,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢大家相信我们
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.61,1:39:11.73,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,别走
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.24,1:39:16.24,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,站住
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.66,1:39:17.82,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,别
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.92,1:39:37.22,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,该死的
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.83,1:40:07.04,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.71,1:40:09.71,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你说的对 唯有信念大过一切
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.67,1:40:14.76,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这次虽然我对了 但还是不开心
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.09,1:40:18.72,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜就这样了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.76,1:40:21.93,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.04,1:40:49.33,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,迪伦
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.71,1:40:52.17,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,迪伦 迪伦
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.63,1:40:56.59,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你看到了吗 - 什么
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.22,1:41:01.59,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,真钱呢
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.82,1:41:21.78,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你被捕了 举起手来 快
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.00,1:42:14.12,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我是被陷害的
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.46,1:42:16.50,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你是
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.59,1:42:17.88,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 我可以证明我清白的
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.38,1:42:19.63,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直都可以
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.01,1:42:21.97,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,就像之前我预测你被人耍一样简单
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.05,1:42:24.55,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不要再演戏了 行吗
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.80,1:42:26.97,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这里又没有摄影机
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.18,1:42:29.68,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,伙计们 能给我点时间让我单独跟他谈谈吗
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.76,1:42:31.60,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,当然可以
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.56,1:42:37.61,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好了
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.65,1:42:40.28,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我有消息可以作为交换
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.40,1:42:41.57,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我相信应该没有问题吧
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.78,1:42:43.40,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,行 如果你说的东西有价值的话
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.86,1:42:49.03,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这铁笼子总能给一人深思熟虑的机会
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.24,1:42:53.50,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我非常肯定 他们如何做到的
Dialogue: 0,1:42:53.96,1:42:56.08,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,还记得第二次表演的兔子戏法吗
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.25,1:42:59.09,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那个盒子一直都没空
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.42,1:43:02.59,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那个房间也是
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.88,1:43:06.26,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,进入仓库后
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.59,1:43:08.68,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,骑士团移走了真正的保险箱
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.76,1:43:11.18,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,把整间房变成
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.26,1:43:13.77,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,一个巨型兔子的盒子
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.35,1:43:17.52,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你过去查看时
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.77,1:43:20.19,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,认为保险箱已被运走了
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.44,1:43:21.40,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,喂
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.48,1:43:22.78,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 别走
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.98,1:43:24.40,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,再次被骗了
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.49,1:43:25.53,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这也让你觉得
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.78,1:43:27.32,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,保险箱已经被偷
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.41,1:43:29.62,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你让你警卫离开了
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.20,1:43:33.16,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,然而 在你忙着玩动物气球时
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.37,1:43:35.96,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,已经有人闯进了仓库
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.47,1:43:55.64,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,谁
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.06,1:43:58.56,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克·怀尔德
Dialogue: 0,1:43:59.31,1:44:00.65,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,真该死
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.86,1:44:03.23,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不可能 我亲眼看到他死在我眼前
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.03,1:44:06.15,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,当然 除非 他没有死
Dialogue: 0,1:44:13.49,1:44:14.74,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,锁住了
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.54,1:44:16.75,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你没听我说过吗
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.25,1:44:18.33,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,没有什么能锁上我
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.71,1:44:22.50,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,真棒 怀尔德先生 干的好
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.67,1:44:24.50,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克 你现在是大男人了
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.67,1:44:27.05,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他从联邦调查局的车里逃出去的 对吗
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.84,1:44:32.18,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,然后带你去桥上
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.43,1:44:34.06,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这时 其他几个骑士也在桥上等着
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.18,1:44:36.06,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,还准备了一部完全相同的车
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.06,1:44:38.06,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,只要你失去
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.18,1:44:39.14,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,视野一瞬间
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.23,1:44:40.23,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,调换一下
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.54,1:45:05.55,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,当你爬进烧着的车时
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.92,1:45:07.92,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,非常英勇可以说是
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.80,1:45:11.89,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你冒着生命危险
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.97,1:45:14.97,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜应该是停尸间找来的一个尸体
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.47,1:45:20.14,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么要冒着这么危险 复杂的计划
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.89,1:45:22.40,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,就为陷害一个人
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.73,1:45:23.77,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.90,1:45:25.32,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他们也不要偷来的钱
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.40,1:45:27.82,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那部分也是我想不通的
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.90,1:45:30.61,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我已经给了你足够重要的信息了
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.74,1:45:32.45,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不 不一定 - 什么意思
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.53,1:45:37.08,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我终于有个机会能调查下莱昂内尔斯莱克的案子了
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.37,1:45:40.12,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他的东山再起 他的事故
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.08,1:45:44.58,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,保险公司拒绝了他家庭的赔偿申诉
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.79,1:45:46.00,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,特雷斯勒 保险公司
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.92,1:45:50.17,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,而银行的笔记
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.26,1:45:52.93,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,是那个法国人的银行做的
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.13,1:45:54.76,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,巴黎信用合作行
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.10,1:45:57.51,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你这表情什么意思
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.60,1:45:59.77,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,每分钟都有混蛋出生
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.52,1:46:03.10,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这半夜2点 如果我们在
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.19,1:46:05.90,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,中央公园被打劫了怎么办
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.98,1:46:08.69,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不会的 我跟你说 这儿就是我们要来的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.78,1:46:09.86,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只是需要找到…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.94,1:46:11.07,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那个
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.61,1:46:15.32,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,莱昂内尔·史瑞克之树
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.28,1:46:18.79,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,和树里的那张牌
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.12,1:46:21.75,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在怎么办
Dialogue: 0,1:46:38.39,1:46:39.85,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.70,1:46:57.16,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那么 我有个新的理论
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.66,1:47:01.08,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,传说中的荷鲁斯之眼是无处不在的
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.74,1:47:02.91,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,等待
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.33,1:47:07.08,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,真正伟大的魔术师从无名鼠辈
Dialogue: 0,1:47:08.04,1:47:09.84,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,到大名鼎鼎
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.67,1:47:11.88,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,可能那个人曾会是你
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.51,1:47:14.76,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,发自内心的想成为荷鲁斯之眼其中成员之一
Dialogue: 0,1:47:14.84,1:47:17.47,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,但是你却从未被邀请
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.55,1:47:20.72,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你试着扳倒他们 猜猜反而结果是怎么样的
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.18,1:47:22.68,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你惹怒了他们
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.39,1:47:27.44,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那眼睛不是真实的
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.52,1:47:30.61,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 那你解释下 这背后到底都是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.86,1:47:32.19,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,肯定是个有妄想症的人
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.44,1:47:33.86,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 特别较真的人 - 谁
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.94,1:47:37.28,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,一个已经准备好失去一切
Dialogue: 0,1:47:37.36,1:47:39.95,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,已经都准备过头了
Dialogue: 0,1:47:40.03,1:47:42.54,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,以至于都没人发现他的可疑
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.62,1:47:45.46,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我不要详细资料 你就告诉我一个名字 是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.54,1:47:47.21,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.58,1:47:49.79,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,但是他们有能进入仓库的办法
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.88,1:47:51.21,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,能够有机会安置那块镜子
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.55,1:47:56.38,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,一直在我和FBI之前一步
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.47,1:47:59.72,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,让他们错过一次又一次
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.05,1:48:02.68,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,除非是他们内部自己的…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.57,1:48:16.95,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,人
Dialogue: 0,1:48:29.08,1:48:30.12,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,是你
Dialogue: 0,1:48:34.75,1:48:35.76,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么要这样
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.59,1:48:38.93,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这问题问的真好 不是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:48:39.76,1:48:41.30,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你说的对
Dialogue: 0,1:48:41.93,1:48:44.26,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道我等了多久
Dialogue: 0,1:48:44.35,1:48:46.31,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,才看到你这惊讶的脸庞
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.77,1:48:50.27,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.35,1:48:52.77,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底想我怎么样
Dialogue: 0,1:48:53.61,1:48:55.11,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我想怎么样
Dialogue: 0,1:48:55.53,1:48:58.44,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我要你余生都在监狱里过完
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.53,1:49:02.53,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你就一直盯着墙壁 想破脑袋
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.20,1:49:06.29,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,想念你是怎么让自己变得这么自大的
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.87,1:49:09.29,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,以至于自己一直落后一步却还要
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.37,1:49:12.13,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,一直强调自己领先一步
Dialogue: 0,1:49:16.80,1:49:18.01,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,迪伦
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.97,1:49:19.97,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:49:21.01,1:49:23.14,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,迪伦 什么情况
Dialogue: 0,1:49:30.81,1:49:32.48,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,迪伦
Dialogue: 0,1:49:32.60,1:49:33.60,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.31,1:49:35.32,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:49:39.32,1:49:41.49,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 我的天
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.49,1:49:44.37,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我都没猜到你来了
Dialogue: 0,1:49:44.49,1:49:45.74,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不可能啊
Dialogue: 0,1:49:45.83,1:49:46.83,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,难以置信
Dialogue: 0,1:49:46.91,1:49:49.33,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,真的很精彩
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.75,1:49:50.83,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:49:51.25,1:49:53.46,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,当我说 永远是那个房间里最聪明的人 的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:49:53.54,1:49:54.58,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们商量好了的
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.83,1:49:56.00,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,1:49:56.38,1:49:57.38,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,亨利
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.17,1:50:00.01,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我从没见她这样沉默
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.09,1:50:01.67,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我把这当成是赞赏的话了
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.38,1:50:05.05,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 太抱歉了 之前揍了你
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.85,1:50:07.35,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,听好了 先说好啊
Dialogue: 0,1:50:07.51,1:50:11.02,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我可是个100%的信仰者
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.18,1:50:13.44,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,用来信仰魔法的精力
Dialogue: 0,1:50:13.52,1:50:15.65,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,如果用在一个点上
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.73,1:50:17.77,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,不用说了 梅里特 你合格了
Dialogue: 0,1:50:18.61,1:50:19.69,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,感谢上帝
Dialogue: 0,1:50:19.78,1:50:20.82,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:50:21.86,1:50:25.03,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,真正的魔法就是把四股很强的力量
Dialogue: 0,1:50:25.24,1:50:27.12,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,汇集到一起
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.37,1:50:29.66,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这也正是你们所做的
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.62,1:50:31.70,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那么 欢迎加入
Dialogue: 0,1:50:35.04,1:50:37.09,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎加入正义之眼
Dialogue: 0,1:51:44.28,1:51:46.36,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,确实有联系这几个
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.99,1:51:49.99,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,法国银行 特雷斯特保险公司
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.44,1:51:52.63,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你好
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.07,1:51:55.34,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你好
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.38,1:52:00.67,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,以及埃尔克霍恩
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.79,1:52:02.71,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那跟斯莱克有什么关系
Dialogue: 0,1:52:05.21,1:52:08.43,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,埃尔克霍恩是做保险柜起家的
Dialogue: 0,1:52:08.76,1:52:10.89,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他们用廉价的铁料
Dialogue: 0,1:52:12.47,1:52:13.76,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,缺边减料的
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.85,1:52:17.06,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,当斯莱克沉入河底的时候保险柜变形了
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.14,1:52:18.52,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,然后他被困了
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.06,1:52:21.65,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,他是你的父亲
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.52,1:52:26.86,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那天早上 表演开始之前 一切都如同昨天
Dialogue: 0,1:52:27.90,1:52:32.91,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,当我父亲说他要去工作的时候 他没看出来我不想他离开
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.16,1:52:40.29,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,所以他给了我他的表 让我数到他回来
Dialogue: 0,1:52:41.46,1:52:44.17,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,之后他的表就再也没能停下来
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.25,1:52:46.38,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,从那一刻起
Dialogue: 0,1:52:46.46,1:52:49.01,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我给自己制定了一个角色
Dialogue: 0,1:52:49.63,1:52:51.55,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我开始计划 详细的部署每个细节
Dialogue: 0,1:52:51.64,1:52:54.93,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,但是有一样东西我没能预料到
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.35,1:52:56.52,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,那就是你
Dialogue: 0,1:52:58.18,1:53:01.15,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你的逻辑总结能力
Dialogue: 0,1:53:01.65,1:53:04.40,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,能带你找到这个案子的答案
Dialogue: 0,1:53:04.48,1:53:07.53,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,然后你会把我带走
Dialogue: 0,1:53:12.66,1:53:13.70,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:53:15.66,1:53:19.50,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,但是此刻我对逻辑和答案怎么理解
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.87,1:53:22.21,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你也知道
Dialogue: 0,1:53:23.08,1:53:27.42,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我认为有一些事还是作为秘密最好
Dialogue: 0,1:53:33.93,1:53:35.72,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,又有一个秘密可以锁住了
Dialogue: 0,1:54:03.29,1:54:04.79,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,近一点
Dialogue: 0,1:54:05.29,1:54:06.54,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,再近点
Dialogue: 0,1:54:06.63,1:54:08.88,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,因为现在你知道了我们的秘密
Dialogue: 0,1:54:08.96,1:54:11.30,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可能在任何一个地方 监视你
Dialogue: 0,1:54:11.92,1:54:15.55,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在寻找能帮助我们下个演出的人
Dialogue: 0,1:54:15.64,1:54:18.18,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,数到三 睁开你的双眼
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.26,1:54:20.22,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,然后告诉我 你看到什么
Dialogue: 0,1:54:21.23,1:54:22.31,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,一
Dialogue: 0,1:54:22.44,1:54:23.44,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,二
Dialogue: 0,1:55:55.28,1:55:57.15,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,快 停下来 拜托了
Dialogue: 0,1:55:57.53,1:56:01.24,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 快点停下来 不停我跳车了
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.24,1:56:03.70,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 谢天谢地
Dialogue: 0,1:56:05.66,1:56:07.75,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在哪
Dialogue: 0,1:56:07.83,1:56:10.25,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 又是个鸟不拉屎的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:56:10.33,1:56:12.25,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 就感受下这儿吧
Dialogue: 0,1:56:12.34,1:56:16.51,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,我感到疲劳 饥饿 骨架都散了
Dialogue: 0,1:56:17.55,1:56:19.43,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧瞧这儿啊
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.51,1:56:22.30,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你要带我们去哪里 - 能不能不要是垃圾场
Dialogue: 0,1:56:22.39,1:56:24.27,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这地方真酷
Dialogue: 0,1:56:25.81,1:56:26.81,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我们的新地方吗
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.89,1:56:28.44,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,最好别 这地方像拼起来的一样
Dialogue: 0,1:56:28.52,1:56:29.56,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我不爱这种地方
Dialogue: 0,1:56:29.65,1:56:32.02,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 锁起来的 - 各位 牌呢
Dialogue: 0,1:56:32.11,1:56:34.65,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么牌 - "什么牌"是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,1:56:38.74,1:56:39.74,ch,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.99,0:00:35.74,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Come in close.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.08,0:00:38.37,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Closer.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.24,0:00:42.25,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Because the more you think you see,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.33,0:00:44.75,en,,0000,0000,0000,,the easier it'll be to fool you.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.38,0:00:48.29,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Because what is seeing?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:48.38,0:00:52.42,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You're looking,but what you're really doing is filtering,interpreting,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:52.47,0:00:54.43,en,,0000,0000,0000,,searching for meaning.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.43,0:00:57.68,en,,0000,0000,0000,,My job?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.76,0:01:01.77,en,,0000,0000,0000,,To take that most precious of gifts you give me,your attention,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:04.64,0:01:06.73,en,,0000,0000,0000,,and use it against you.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.86,0:01:14.07,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to flip through this deck.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.15,0:01:15.66,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And I want you to see one card.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.74,0:01:17.16,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Not this one. That's too obvious.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.57,0:01:18.87,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Pay close attention.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.45,0:01:22.75,en,,0000,0000,0000,,That was too fast. I'll do it again.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.83,0:01:24.04,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.12,0:01:25.12,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.17,0:01:28.96,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Now did you see one? - Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.13,0:01:31.05,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Do you have one in mind? - Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.25,0:01:32.96,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Now,do you see your card here?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.59,0:01:34.55,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.63,0:01:36.84,en,,0000,0000,0000,,That's because you're looking too closely.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.93,0:01:38.97,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And what have I been telling you all night?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.05,0:01:40.51,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The closer you look...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.60,0:01:42.14,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The less you see.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.37,0:02:07.79,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Now look into my eyes.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.00,0:02:10.04,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And sleep. Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.34,0:02:14.55,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.72,0:02:18.30,en,,0000,0000,0000,,If you can get this bill from me,you can have it.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.51,0:02:20.35,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Go ahead. Take it. Get it.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.55,0:02:23.06,en,,0000,0000,0000,,If you can say your name,you can have it.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:26.23,0:02:28.65,en,,0000,0000,0000,,All right,just hang out there,wriggle a sec.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.73,0:02:31.11,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna take a little peek under the hood
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.19,0:02:32.73,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- of your hubby's brain. - Oh,no,no,no.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.82,0:02:33.94,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm picturing...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.03,0:02:36.03,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Don't tell me. - Of course.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:36.24,0:02:38.24,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Beach. Cocktails.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:38.70,0:02:39.86,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Florida?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.95,0:02:41.45,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Look,it was a business trip.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:41.62,0:02:43.62,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I mean,it is a kind of business.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.70,0:02:46.58,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe the oldest business.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.70,0:02:47.91,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You know what,Honey Bee,let's...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.04,0:02:49.54,en,,0000,0000,0000,,She can't move,Mack.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.62,0:02:51.04,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You're thinking of a woman's name.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.25,0:02:52.59,en,,0000,0000,0000,,A! B! C!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.67,0:02:53.92,en,,0000,0000,0000,,D E F G
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.00,0:02:55.13,en,,0000,0000,0000,,H,I,J...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.26,0:02:57.05,en,,0000,0000,0000,,J? Jean. Jane. Janet.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.26,0:02:58.34,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Who's Janet?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.97,0:03:01.18,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You know Janet?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:01.30,0:03:02.55,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not your best friend,is it?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.93,0:03:05.56,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Your sister? - No,please.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:05.64,0:03:07.89,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Her sister? Oh,my God.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.98,0:03:10.02,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You weren't away on business.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.10,0:03:11.86,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- You were away on Janet. - No.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.94,0:03:13.23,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Your wife's sister!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.19,0:03:15.90,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay,we need to move over here,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.98,0:03:18.53,en,,0000,0000,0000,,because it seems like she's a little bit upset right now.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.61,0:03:20.82,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You want this to go away?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.91,0:03:22.57,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Yes. - Okay,pull out your wallet.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.12,0:03:24.58,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on,get it out.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.66,0:03:25.95,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you shake down everybody like this?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.08,0:03:27.83,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No,only the special few.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.91,0:03:30.00,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What is this? Two hundred seem fair?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:30.08,0:03:32.17,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You know what? This is a big deal. Let's go $250.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:32.25,0:03:33.25,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You're a stick-up artist.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.33,0:03:35.00,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Of course.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.75,0:03:38.55,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay,and sleep!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.63,0:03:40.01,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Now,when I snap my fingers,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:40.09,0:03:41.55,en,,0000,0000,0000,,you won't remember any of this.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.63,0:03:42.84,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And you,Warren Beatty,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.09,0:03:45.93,en,,0000,0000,0000,,every time you see or even think of Janet,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.26,0:03:48.73,en,,0000,0000,0000,,you're gonna picture me naked.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:48.81,0:03:49.93,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And that's not a pretty sight.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.02,0:03:51.02,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:51.10,0:03:53.27,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And... You're wide awake!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.36,0:03:58.86,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Well,we did the best we could,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.94,0:04:01.11,en,,0000,0000,0000,,but some people just aren't to be hypnotized.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:01.20,0:04:03.49,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- I did it wrong? - Come on,Honey Bee.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.62,0:04:05.28,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Oh,no,you did it fine. - Let me buy you dinner.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:05.45,0:04:06.62,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Look after her.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.70,0:04:08.45,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Just have to hit an ATM first.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:22.59,0:04:26.18,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Ladies and gentlemen,I am the next great magician,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:26.26,0:04:28.43,en,,0000,0000,0000,,and I will give $100
Dialogue: 1,0:04:28.51,0:04:30.85,en,,0000,0000,0000,,to anyone who can tell me how this trick is done.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:31.06,0:04:34.56,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I have an ordinary spoon from Mel's Deli,right here in Brooklyn.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:34.65,0:04:36.06,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Check it out.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.15,0:04:39.82,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Now,everyone please pay very,very close attention.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:40.03,0:04:43.40,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Because I'm about to bend this spoon with my mind.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:53.62,0:04:56.00,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you. Thank you. Pass that around.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:56.08,0:04:57.59,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- What's this? - What are you doing,man?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.67,0:05:00.92,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Look at this! Looks like we got a spoon and a stem.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:01.01,0:05:02.13,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I've got other tricks.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:02.22,0:05:04.43,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Or you could give me my 100 bucks.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:04.51,0:05:05.59,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You said you would.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:05.68,0:05:06.93,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Nice wallet.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:07.01,0:05:08.22,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You have a very good eye,sir.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.30,0:05:09.31,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:16.48,0:05:17.81,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Wallet.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:18.02,0:05:20.19,en,,0000,0000,0000,,My wallet. My watch!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:24.86,0:05:25.95,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop that guy!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:26.03,0:05:27.16,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop that guy in the leather jacket!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:27.24,0:05:28.24,en,,0000,0000,0000,,He's got my wallet!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:36.67,0:05:38.04,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay,Los Angeles,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:38.13,0:05:39.79,en,,0000,0000,0000,,are we ready to end this thing?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:39.88,0:05:40.88,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.96,0:05:43.01,en,,0000,0000,0000,,When that timer hits zero,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:43.46,0:05:45.80,en,,0000,0000,0000,,a tank full of flesh-eating piranhas
Dialogue: 1,0:05:45.88,0:05:47.80,en,,0000,0000,0000,,will fall from above.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:47.89,0:05:50.60,en,,0000,0000,0000,,A lady has to have handcuffs. Right,girls?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.89,0:05:53.56,en,,0000,0000,0000,,One,two,three!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:22.55,0:06:24.26,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Help! Stop it!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.17,0:06:27.93,en,,0000,0000,0000,,She's serious! She can't get out!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.05,0:06:31.51,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Go get some help!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.22,0:06:33.39,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Help,dude!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:34.93,0:06:37.23,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Get out of the way! Move! Move!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:16.22,0:07:18.27,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on! This is bullshit!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:18.39,0:07:21.60,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Whoever thought of this is a sick sadist!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:29.07,0:07:30.66,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I am your biggest fan.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:30.74,0:07:32.66,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I could tell by the way you're attacking my face right now.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:32.74,0:07:33.99,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Close the door. Bad apartment building.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:34.08,0:07:35.66,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Magician,come here. - Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:37.75,0:07:39.33,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Wait,wait. - What? What?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:39.41,0:07:40.87,en,,0000,0000,0000,,How did you do that...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:40.96,0:07:42.29,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The seven of diamonds on the side of the tower?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:42.38,0:07:43.92,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Yes. - That's a trade secret.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:46.05,0:07:48.38,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll give you a hint. It involved bribing the tower electrician.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:48.46,0:07:49.55,en,,0000,0000,0000,,How much?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:49.63,0:07:50.63,en,,0000,0000,0000,,50 bucks.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.93,0:07:52.80,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- But it's so hard. - Oh,thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:52.93,0:07:54.01,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Is it always a seven?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:54.10,0:07:55.68,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I could do that trick 52 different ways.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:55.76,0:07:57.64,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Can you do 52 different tricks on me?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:58.06,0:07:59.14,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll see what I can do.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:59.43,0:08:01.10,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Magic man!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:01.48,0:08:02.90,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I love your shampoo.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:05.19,0:08:06.44,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Hold up. - What?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:08.82,0:08:09.86,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You need to leave.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:09.94,0:08:10.95,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:11.15,0:08:13.16,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh,my God,this is so embarrassing.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:13.41,0:08:14.41,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Is this what you do?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:14.49,0:08:16.45,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Some kind of sick trick you do to women?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:16.62,0:08:18.74,en,,0000,0000,0000,,"45 East Evan Street."
Dialogue: 1,0:08:18.91,0:08:20.33,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry about it. I'll call you.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:20.50,0:08:21.91,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't have my number.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.12,0:08:24.17,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm magic. I'll find it. Have a good night.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:24.25,0:08:25.75,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You are such an asshole.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:38.32,0:09:39.37,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:40.49,0:09:41.54,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Henley.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:41.87,0:09:43.91,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Danny? Hey.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:44.33,0:09:46.79,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You got a card,huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:47.75,0:09:50.00,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No,no,no,it's good for you. Congratulations.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:50.09,0:09:51.09,en,,0000,0000,0000,,All right,so here's what I'm gonna do,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:51.21,0:09:52.46,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna go inside. I'm gonna scope the place out.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:52.55,0:09:53.76,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You wait out here. I will come back
Dialogue: 1,0:09:53.84,0:09:54.92,en,,0000,0000,0000,,and get you,okay? Do not come in.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:55.01,0:09:56.76,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey,Danny! I'm not your assistant anymore.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:57.05,0:09:58.34,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Nice hair.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:58.43,0:10:00.14,en,,0000,0000,0000,,So,actually,what have you been up to?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:00.22,0:10:02.35,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I think you know exactly what I've been up to,Danny.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:02.43,0:10:05.18,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I saw all your anonymous posting on my website.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:05.27,0:10:06.52,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You have a website. That's good.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:06.60,0:10:08.35,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Good for you. Get the word out.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:10.86,0:10:12.32,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:12.40,0:10:15.57,en,,0000,0000,0000,,So apparently none of us was the only one chosen.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:15.70,0:10:18.28,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Let me be the first one to kick my ego to the curb.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:18.45,0:10:19.53,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:19.62,0:10:21.41,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Door's locked. - Is it? I'll check.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:21.58,0:10:24.08,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You. Now,hold it,don't tell me.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:24.20,0:10:25.75,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Helen? No,no.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:25.91,0:10:27.29,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Henley.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:27.37,0:10:28.58,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It's on your coffee cup.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:28.79,0:10:30.46,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for keeping me honest.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:30.54,0:10:32.09,en,,0000,0000,0000,,That wasn't mentalism,by the way.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:32.21,0:10:33.30,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It was just an observation.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:33.42,0:10:36.97,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Second observation,you are beautiful.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:37.38,0:10:38.18,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:38.47,0:10:40.97,en,,0000,0000,0000,,That's good. That's very nice. Very well-polished. Nice bit.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:41.05,0:10:43.31,en,,0000,0000,0000,,J. Daniel Atlas. Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:43.56,0:10:45.18,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Very nice. I know who you are and I just want to say that
Dialogue: 1,0:10:45.31,0:10:46.27,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not interested in you doing
Dialogue: 1,0:10:46.35,0:10:47.52,en,,0000,0000,0000,,your mentalism thing on us.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:47.77,0:10:48.64,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Especially when we don't know who brought
Dialogue: 1,0:10:48.64,0:10:50.31,en,,0000,0000,0000,,us here or even if it's real.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:51.02,0:10:55.11,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on,I'm sensing... I'm sensing you are a control freak.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:55.19,0:10:56.44,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry,have we met before?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:56.53,0:10:57.95,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn't take a mentalist to figure that out.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:58.03,0:10:59.11,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You are a control freak.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:59.20,0:11:01.28,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Well,I take that as a compliment.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:01.37,0:11:02.74,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Only he would take it as a compliment.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:02.83,0:11:04.83,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay,great. Good. Another compliment.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.91,0:11:08.29,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. So that's why you're no longer a couple.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:08.37,0:11:09.46,en,,0000,0000,0000,,A couple? No,no.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:09.54,0:11:10.75,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We were never a couple.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:10.83,0:11:12.63,en,,0000,0000,0000,,He used to saw me in half.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:12.71,0:11:13.75,en,,0000,0000,0000,,She was a very good assistant.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:13.84,0:11:14.88,en,,0000,0000,0000,,But I was too fat for Danny.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:14.96,0:11:17.80,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No. I said that one time because of the trap door.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.88,0:11:19.88,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- There were specs. - You built it this size.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:19.97,0:11:21.47,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No one could fit through there. No one.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.55,0:11:22.72,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Rebecca fit through.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:22.89,0:11:24.47,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Rebecca fit for years.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:24.56,0:11:26.22,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you know how hard it is to stay
Dialogue: 1,0:11:26.35,0:11:28.18,en,,0000,0000,0000,,in those tiny little costumes?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:28.39,0:11:30.23,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No. I'm the main attraction.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:30.52,0:11:32.48,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. So he never made you feel special.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:32.56,0:11:36.48,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And,trust me,you deserve to be made to feel special.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:36.57,0:11:37.99,en,,0000,0000,0000,,That's a really nice story.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:38.07,0:11:39.74,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hope you guys enjoy each other's company.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:39.99,0:11:41.16,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No way.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:42.32,0:11:43.91,en,,0000,0000,0000,,J. Daniel Atlas?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:44.03,0:11:46.62,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Dude,I've seen everything that you have ever done.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:46.70,0:11:48.00,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You're like...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:48.08,0:11:49.33,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I idolize you. Seriously.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:49.41,0:11:50.92,en,,0000,0000,0000,,From a true fan. It's so nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:51.00,0:11:52.50,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Jack,by the way.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:52.58,0:11:54.00,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Question. Did you get one of these?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:55.04,0:11:55.92,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Death.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:56.80,0:11:57.96,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The High Priestess.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:58.13,0:11:59.30,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm the Lover.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:59.47,0:12:00.51,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Three minutes.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:01.51,0:12:02.59,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hermit.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:02.80,0:12:05.43,en,,0000,0000,0000,,So,what are we... Are we waiting for someone?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:05.64,0:12:07.06,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Why are we just... - The door's locked.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:07.14,0:12:09.68,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh,no,nothing's ever locked.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:19.36,0:12:21.15,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:25.49,0:12:27.12,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow. Thought my apartment was nasty.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:34.79,0:12:36.96,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Man,it's freezing in here.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:38.63,0:12:39.67,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:39.88,0:12:41.09,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:44.34,0:12:45.34,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What's it say?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:46.60,0:12:48.14,en,,0000,0000,0000,,"Now you don't."
Dialogue: 1,0:12:48.97,0:12:52.27,en,,0000,0000,0000,,"A rose by any other name..."
Dialogue: 1,0:12:57.19,0:12:59.40,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Guys,what's happening?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:01.07,0:13:02.61,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Look at that.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:09.33,0:13:10.45,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It's gas!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:10.66,0:13:12.75,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Relax. Just dry ice.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:13.54,0:13:14.54,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Cool.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:15.50,0:13:17.00,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait. What do you think this is all about?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:17.08,0:13:18.84,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hang on. Hang on.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:23.67,0:13:24.84,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I got nothin'.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:25.01,0:13:26.76,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. Thank you. Thank you for the delay.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:26.97,0:13:28.97,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm just trying to create the space for wisdom.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:29.05,0:13:30.60,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay,so you're like Buddha,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:30.68,0:13:32.10,en,,0000,0000,0000,,if he wasn't so enlightened.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:32.18,0:13:33.56,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And you're like Jesus,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.64,0:13:36.19,en,,0000,0000,0000,,if he was arrogant and all of his miracles were fake.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:36.27,0:13:37.56,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay,lovebirds,get a room.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:37.65,0:13:39.48,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Danny,be honest. Did you do this?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:39.57,0:13:40.69,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No. Wait,did you?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:40.82,0:13:42.11,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I Wish.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:42.61,0:13:44.86,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Why didn't anyone ask me if I did it?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:45.86,0:13:47.03,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh,great.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:52.41,0:13:54.16,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Electricity is out.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:55.08,0:13:56.79,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Well,let's check.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:13.64,0:14:15.10,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Blueprints.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:15.94,0:14:17.31,en,,0000,0000,0000,,They're incredible.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:18.77,0:14:20.11,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Who do you think did this?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:20.27,0:14:22.44,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know,but I really want to meet them.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:24.40,0:14:25.95,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a show.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:45.80,0:14:47.22,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Merritt McKinney,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.97,0:14:50.30,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Daniel Atlas,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:51.72,0:14:52.97,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Henley Reeves,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:54.93,0:14:56.64,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Jack Wilder.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:57.43,0:15:01.36,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Arthur Tressler and the MGM Grand proudly presents
Dialogue: 1,0:15:04.11,0:15:06.19,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The Four Horsemen.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:07.65,0:15:09.07,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:09.15,0:15:11.32,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Tonight we would like to try something
Dialogue: 1,0:15:11.45,0:15:13.95,en,,0000,0000,0000,,that will,well,set us a bit apart.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:14.03,0:15:15.54,en,,0000,0000,0000,,For our final trick,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:15.62,0:15:17.58,en,,0000,0000,0000,,we're gonna do something never before
Dialogue: 1,0:15:17.66,0:15:19.67,en,,0000,0000,0000,,seen on a Las Vegas stage.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:20.71,0:15:23.04,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Or any stage for that matter.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:23.84,0:15:25.67,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:27.63,0:15:28.72,en,,0000,0000,0000,,tonight
Dialogue: 1,0:15:29.63,0:15:31.76,en,,0000,0000,0000,,we are going to rob a bank.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:42.35,0:15:44.48,en,,0000,0000,0000,,That's a lot of excitement for a crime.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:45.19,0:15:48.86,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm getting excited. What about you,people?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:54.37,0:15:56.58,en,,0000,0000,0000,,One,two,three!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:05.29,0:16:07.21,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry,sir. There's absolutely no recording allowed
Dialogue: 1,0:16:07.30,0:16:08.55,en,,0000,0000,0000,,during the performance.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:08.63,0:16:10.63,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh,yeah,yeah,sure,of course.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:10.72,0:16:11.80,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Let me just put this away.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:11.88,0:16:13.18,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Actually,I need to take that.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:13.26,0:16:15.72,en,,0000,0000,0000,,After the show,I can come and give it back to you.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:16.43,0:16:17.81,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:20.93,0:16:22.64,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay,okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:22.90,0:16:24.73,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Now,please,please,settle down.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:25.48,0:16:28.32,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Now who here has a bank they would like us to rob?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:29.57,0:16:31.57,en,,0000,0000,0000,,That's a lot of people with a vendetta.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:31.74,0:16:33.45,en,,0000,0000,0000,,So we'll choose one at random then.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:35.07,0:16:37.70,en,,0000,0000,0000,,My associates will make sure it's random. Right?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:38.62,0:16:40.95,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Elvis,help me out,bud. - Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:41.16,0:16:43.71,en,,0000,0000,0000,,In Jack's bowl are ping pong balls with section numbers.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:43.79,0:16:45.79,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Jack,could you hand me a section number?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:46.00,0:16:47.46,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you. We are looking at Section B.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:47.54,0:16:48.71,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Where is Section B?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:49.38,0:16:51.88,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. There. It's gonna be one of you guys. Get ready.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:52.38,0:16:53.72,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know why everybody's happy.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:53.80,0:16:54.84,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It's only them.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:55.14,0:16:56.72,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Merritt,can I get a row,please?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:57.60,0:16:58.68,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you,Merritt.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:58.76,0:17:00.56,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We are looking at row number 5.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:00.64,0:17:01.77,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Where is that?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:01.85,0:17:04.69,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And Henley,could I please have a random seat number?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:05.56,0:17:07.11,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh. Lucky number 13.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.36,0:17:08.86,en,,0000,0000,0000,,B-5-13. Where are you?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:09.19,0:17:12.82,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Sir,please,stand up. There you are. Hi.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:14.45,0:17:16.07,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Could you just confirm for me that this
Dialogue: 1,0:17:16.16,0:17:18.20,en,,0000,0000,0000,,is,in fact,your seat? B-5-13.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:18.28,0:17:19.28,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:19.37,0:17:21.37,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. Wonderful. Now,could you please tell us
Dialogue: 1,0:17:21.45,0:17:22.79,en,,0000,0000,0000,,your name and the name of your bank?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:23.00,0:17:25.21,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Well,my name is Etienne Forcier.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:25.46,0:17:28.79,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And my bank,it's Credit Republicain de Paris.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:29.00,0:17:30.17,en,,0000,0000,0000,,French. Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:30.38,0:17:31.92,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We were hoping for something a little more local,
Dialogue: 1,0:17:32.01,0:17:34.26,en,,0000,0000,0000,,a kind of mom-and-pop credit union with no security.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:34.34,0:17:36.39,en,,0000,0000,0000,,But that's fine. A promise is a promise.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:36.47,0:17:37.72,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Could you please come up to the stage
Dialogue: 1,0:17:37.80,0:17:39.05,en,,0000,0000,0000,,and we'll rob your bank.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:39.14,0:17:41.27,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And while he does that...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:41.35,0:17:42.64,en,,0000,0000,0000,,There is someone here tonight
Dialogue: 1,0:17:42.72,0:17:44.48,en,,0000,0000,0000,,without whom we would just be
Dialogue: 1,0:17:44.56,0:17:46.56,en,,0000,0000,0000,,four magicians working the circuit,
Dialogue: 1,0:17:46.65,0:17:47.65,en,,0000,0000,0000,,trying to get...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:47.86,0:17:49.23,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Well,actually,trying to get here.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:49.48,0:17:50.61,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You probably know this man,
Dialogue: 1,0:17:50.69,0:17:52.19,en,,0000,0000,0000,,if not from one of the many,many
Dialogue: 1,0:17:52.32,0:17:53.57,en,,0000,0000,0000,,companies he puts his name on.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:53.65,0:17:55.74,en,,0000,0000,0000,,He is our friend. He is our benefactor.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:55.82,0:17:57.16,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Mr. Arthur Tressler.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:57.24,0:17:59.32,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Please,stand up,Art. Please,stand up.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:59.41,0:18:00.41,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The only man here with
Dialogue: 1,0:18:00.49,0:18:02.62,en,,0000,0000,0000,,the Queen's cell phone number.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:03.16,0:18:05.16,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Actually,please,stay standing,Art.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:06.16,0:18:08.42,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to say that when we came to Mr. Tressler,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:08.50,0:18:10.88,en,,0000,0000,0000,,we promised that,as a unit,we could become
Dialogue: 1,0:18:11.00,0:18:12.09,en,,0000,0000,0000,,the biggest name in magic.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:12.17,0:18:13.59,en,,0000,0000,0000,,So we wanted to say,"Thank you."
Dialogue: 1,0:18:13.67,0:18:15.67,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And by the way,Art,you notice on the sign out front,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.76,0:18:17.84,en,,0000,0000,0000,,we made sure we put your name on top.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:18.01,0:18:20.10,en,,0000,0000,0000,,If you turn out to be as good
Dialogue: 1,0:18:20.18,0:18:22.01,en,,0000,0000,0000,,as you think you are,dear girl,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:22.18,0:18:24.27,en,,0000,0000,0000,,that won't be necessary much longer.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:24.52,0:18:25.77,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We haven't done our closer yet.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:25.85,0:18:27.02,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you watch it
Dialogue: 1,0:18:27.10,0:18:28.44,en,,0000,0000,0000,,and then you can decide for yourself.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:28.52,0:18:30.98,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Ladies and gentlemen,Arthur Tressler!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:31.06,0:18:32.44,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you. And,of course,once again,the Cardinal of Clairvoyance,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:32.52,0:18:34.57,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Merritt McKinney.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:34.78,0:18:38.03,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Etienne,what Jack is bringing to the stage now,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:38.24,0:18:41.87,en,,0000,0000,0000,,is what we in the magic world call a teleportation helmet.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:42.03,0:18:44.12,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You will need to wear this,as it will allow you
Dialogue: 1,0:18:44.37,0:18:48.12,en,,0000,0000,0000,,to literally fold through space and time
Dialogue: 1,0:18:48.37,0:18:50.54,en,,0000,0000,0000,,to your bank in the...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:50.71,0:18:51.75,en,,0000,0000,0000,,8th?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:51.96,0:18:53.88,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- 9th arrondissement. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:54.05,0:18:55.88,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Now,once you are there,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:55.96,0:18:58.05,en,,0000,0000,0000,,we will be able to speak with you through this helmet.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:58.13,0:18:59.89,en,,0000,0000,0000,,NOW if...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:00.09,0:19:01.85,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh,my God,that's beautiful.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:01.93,0:19:04.14,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It has the added attraction of being very stylish.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:04.26,0:19:07.98,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It's about time the French learned from America on that subject.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:09.60,0:19:10.73,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that a beautiful piece of headgear?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:10.81,0:19:12.40,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Thank you. Thank you... - it is.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:13.48,0:19:16.07,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:17.44,0:19:18.78,en,,0000,0000,0000,,But before you go anywhere,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:18.90,0:19:20.91,en,,0000,0000,0000,,could you please,pick a card,any card.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.11,0:19:22.24,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Not that card.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:22.45,0:19:25.74,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No,that's an old American joke. You can take that one.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:25.95,0:19:27.41,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. This one?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:27.58,0:19:29.58,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Show it to your friends in Section B. But not to us.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:31.25,0:19:33.29,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay,great. Now if you could just sign your name there.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:33.42,0:19:35.84,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Yes. - In English,if possible.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:36.25,0:19:37.67,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- That's good. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:38.80,0:19:39.93,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Put it in your pocket.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:40.26,0:19:42.68,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And now for one tiny detail.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:00.11,0:20:04.66,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Now,Etienne,let's step into this cockamamie contraption.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:04.87,0:20:07.12,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And I'll step off of it. Bonne chance.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:07.20,0:20:09.96,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It's 11:50 p.m. here in Vegas.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:10.16,0:20:12.29,en,,0000,0000,0000,,That's 8:50 a.m. in Paris.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:12.46,0:20:14.84,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Your bank opens in less than 10 minutes.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:15.04,0:20:16.04,en,,0000,0000,0000,,One,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:16.13,0:20:17.21,en,,0000,0000,0000,,two...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:17.30,0:20:18.34,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Three.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:21.63,0:20:22.80,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What the fuck?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:23.01,0:20:24.64,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Efienne? - Efienne?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:24.80,0:20:26.76,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It wasn't supposed to happen like that,was it?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:26.85,0:20:28.10,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Efienne?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:28.47,0:20:30.48,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I liked that little French guy.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:30.68,0:20:31.73,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Where did he go?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:40.69,0:20:42.24,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait,there he is.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:44.53,0:20:46.58,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No,no,no,no,please,please,please.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:46.83,0:20:49.49,en,,0000,0000,0000,,This is Daniel Atlas. Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:49.58,0:20:50.83,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Etienne? Are you okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:50.91,0:20:52.00,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:52.08,0:20:54.46,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Perfect. What do you see in there?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:56.42,0:20:57.50,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Money.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:58.00,0:20:59.13,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Is this real?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:59.21,0:21:01.72,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. Looks like three million or so Euros' worth.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:03.93,0:21:05.51,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay,now,here's what we're gonna need you to do.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:05.59,0:21:07.55,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I want you to take the card that you signed
Dialogue: 1,0:21:07.64,0:21:08.89,en,,0000,0000,0000,,out of your pocket.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:09.35,0:21:10.43,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And I want you to take the ticket stub
Dialogue: 1,0:21:10.52,0:21:11.56,en,,0000,0000,0000,,from tonight's show
Dialogue: 1,0:21:11.77,0:21:12.81,en,,0000,0000,0000,,and I want you to put it right there
Dialogue: 1,0:21:12.89,0:21:14.94,en,,0000,0000,0000,,in the middle of the money.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:18.02,0:21:19.19,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Now drop it.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.24,0:21:34.46,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Now,on the side of your helmet you should feel a button.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.54,0:21:35.87,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't press it just yet.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:35.96,0:21:37.71,en,,0000,0000,0000,,That button activates an air duct
Dialogue: 1,0:21:37.79,0:21:40.55,en,,0000,0000,0000,,that connects Paris to Las Vegas.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:40.71,0:21:42.05,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay,good. Now you can press it.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:42.26,0:21:44.38,en,,0000,0000,0000,,All right,now,Etienne,hold on tight.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:44.47,0:21:45.84,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You might feel a bit of a vacuum.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.92,0:22:18.29,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:12.01,0:23:14.26,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you,Etienne. Thank you,everyone!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:14.35,0:23:15.52,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We are The Four Horsemen.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.60,0:23:16.73,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And good night!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:16.81,0:23:18.39,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Good night!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:30.74,0:23:31.95,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold up here.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:32.32,0:23:33.91,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Dylan Rhodes.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.41,0:23:37.54,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What? I don't think I heard you correctly.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:37.62,0:23:39.08,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you say magicians?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:39.16,0:23:41.08,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah,Dylan,magicians.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:41.17,0:23:42.38,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Where are you now?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:42.46,0:23:44.46,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm at Aria. I'm heading up there to grab 'em now.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:48.67,0:23:50.59,en,,0000,0000,0000,,FBI! Hands where I can see them.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:50.68,0:23:52.05,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go. Get 'em up. Come on.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:53.43,0:23:55.14,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go. Get 'em up.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:55.35,0:23:56.64,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Put the book down.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:56.85,0:23:58.60,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. You got me.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:58.68,0:24:00.19,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Freeze! Hands in the air! - Oh,my!
Dialogue: 1,0:24:00.69,0:24:03.44,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Do one of you guys mind giving us a hand with our bags?
Dialogue: 1,0:24:03.98,0:24:05.02,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:22.87,0:24:24.83,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Boss,please tell me this is a joke.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:24.92,0:24:27.96,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I just got Willy Mears to finger Paulie Attanasio.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:28.05,0:24:29.76,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a month,two tops,
Dialogue: 1,0:24:29.84,0:24:31.30,en,,0000,0000,0000,,away from blowing this whole thing open.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:31.38,0:24:32.43,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Get Turkelson.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:32.51,0:24:33.64,en,,0000,0000,0000,,He's in Atlantic City.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:33.72,0:24:34.97,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What about Cowan? Look at him.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:35.05,0:24:36.47,en,,0000,0000,0000,,He's just sitting there on his ass.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:36.55,0:24:37.76,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hilarious,Rhodes.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:38.22,0:24:39.35,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I love you.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:39.68,0:24:40.73,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Asshole.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:40.93,0:24:42.48,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have time for this magic crap.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:42.56,0:24:45.11,en,,0000,0000,0000,,This crap just pulled three million Euro out of a Parisian bank.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:45.19,0:24:46.36,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- That's how much they got? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:46.44,0:24:47.94,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Actually,3.2.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:51.61,0:24:52.61,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Who is she?
Dialogue: 1,0:24:53.61,0:24:54.61,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 1,0:24:54.70,0:24:56.37,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Alma Dray from Interpol.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:56.53,0:24:57.99,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be working the investigation with you.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:58.08,0:24:59.29,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You gotta be kidding me.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:59.37,0:25:00.91,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It's bad enough they got me chasing down
Dialogue: 1,0:25:01.04,0:25:02.16,en,,0000,0000,0000,,David Copperfield and Friends.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:02.25,0:25:05.46,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Now I'm being saddled with,no offense,with Interpol?
Dialogue: 1,0:25:05.54,0:25:07.79,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I look forward to working with you,too,Agent Rhodes.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:07.88,0:25:10.84,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry. I don't think I'm gonna need your help on this. Okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:25:10.92,0:25:13.47,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Where's the French guy? - I already spoke to him.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:13.55,0:25:16.09,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh,you did? You spoke to my witness before me?
Dialogue: 1,0:25:16.18,0:25:19.31,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Your witness? I thought you didn't want the case.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:19.39,0:25:20.93,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Besides,he's useless.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:21.18,0:25:22.81,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh,really? Why is that?
Dialogue: 1,0:25:22.89,0:25:25.15,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Because he believes their magic was real.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:25.23,0:25:26.90,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh,he believes the magic was real?
Dialogue: 1,0:25:26.98,0:25:28.44,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You're right,he probably is useless.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:28.52,0:25:31.86,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Is it okay with Interpol if we talk to him,too?
Dialogue: 1,0:25:31.94,0:25:33.53,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:34.15,0:25:37.32,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I have never stolen a thing in my life,okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:25:37.41,0:25:39.78,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I tried to give the money back,but they won't take it.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:39.87,0:25:42.33,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay,okay,okay,let's just say you robbed a bank.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:42.41,0:25:44.96,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- I did. - Fine. Fantastic. You did.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:45.04,0:25:47.58,en,,0000,0000,0000,,But since I'm new to this,can you explain to me how you went
Dialogue: 1,0:25:47.67,0:25:50.09,en,,0000,0000,0000,,from Las Vegas to Paris in three seconds?
Dialogue: 1,0:25:50.55,0:25:52.30,en,,0000,0000,0000,,With the teleportation helmet.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:52.76,0:25:54.42,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay,what the hell is going on here?
Dialogue: 1,0:25:54.51,0:25:56.38,en,,0000,0000,0000,,He was hypnotized during the show.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:56.47,0:25:58.30,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I told you,he's useless.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:58.39,0:25:59.51,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay,I'll deal with you when I'm clone
Dialogue: 1,0:25:59.60,0:26:01.14,en,,0000,0000,0000,,with this other bullshit.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:04.73,0:26:05.69,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 1,0:26:05.77,0:26:07.44,en,,0000,0000,0000,,During the show,half the audience was hypnotized
Dialogue: 1,0:26:07.52,0:26:08.81,en,,0000,0000,0000,,to believe they were in the Philharmonic.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:08.90,0:26:11.19,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess that "bullshit" was the trigger word.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:11.27,0:26:14.74,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. Hey,hey. Ecoutez. Etienne,come on down from there.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:14.82,0:26:16.11,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You're not in the Philharmonic.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:16.20,0:26:18.62,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- How do you say "stop" in French? - Stop.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:18.70,0:26:19.74,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Tell him to stop.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:19.82,0:26:24.08,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No,I can't. You just have to let him finish his movement.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:24.41,0:26:26.25,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay,I need a time-out.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:26.33,0:26:27.83,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Too many French people in one room.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:27.96,0:26:29.46,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Agent Rhodes!
Dialogue: 1,0:26:29.54,0:26:32.25,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm ordered by my bosses to provide a report.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:32.34,0:26:35.38,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And until we have one,I'm here,like it or not.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:35.47,0:26:37.05,en,,0000,0000,0000,,So we can work together,
Dialogue: 1,0:26:37.22,0:26:39.14,en,,0000,0000,0000,,or you can continue to follow behind
Dialogue: 1,0:26:39.22,0:26:41.35,en,,0000,0000,0000,,asking the same exact questions I'm asking.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:41.47,0:26:42.64,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It's up to you.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:46.48,0:26:47.89,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not finished.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:47.98,0:26:51.77,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I just flew 12 hours,after what was already a long day.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:51.86,0:26:54.19,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And I do not handle jet lag well.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:57.32,0:26:59.70,en,,0000,0000,0000,,So if you want to see who can be grumpier,
Dialogue: 1,0:26:59.82,0:27:01.91,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I promise you,you will lose.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:03.54,0:27:05.62,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Fine. So which one of these idiots
Dialogue: 1,0:27:05.70,0:27:07.12,en,,0000,0000,0000,,do you want to talk to first?
Dialogue: 1,0:27:07.21,0:27:08.25,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Him?
Dialogue: 1,0:27:13.80,0:27:14.92,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Dylan,for the record,
Dialogue: 1,0:27:15.00,0:27:17.13,en,,0000,0000,0000,,mentalism has never actually been proven to be accurate.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:17.22,0:27:18.26,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:18.34,0:27:19.68,en,,0000,0000,0000,,That is to say,that it's not a science.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:19.84,0:27:21.09,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It's more for entertainment.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:21.18,0:27:22.43,en,,0000,0000,0000,,All right.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:22.51,0:27:25.89,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Just don't believe everything the guy says. That's all.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:26.85,0:27:29.69,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Please convey my deepest apologies
Dialogue: 1,0:27:29.81,0:27:31.56,en,,0000,0000,0000,,to your colleague out there.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:31.65,0:27:34.02,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm really sorry about this whole Tranny Tuesday thing.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:34.11,0:27:35.28,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I was out of line.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:35.36,0:27:36.61,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Tranny Tuesday?
Dialogue: 1,0:27:36.69,0:27:38.36,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Well,it's an arrangement he and his wife have.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:38.49,0:27:40.20,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Or might not have,if you believe
Dialogue: 1,0:27:40.32,0:27:42.74,en,,0000,0000,0000,,everything Agent Fuller is saying to be correct.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:42.82,0:27:45.45,en,,0000,0000,0000,,But isn't there a proud tradition in the FBI
Dialogue: 1,0:27:45.54,0:27:47.41,en,,0000,0000,0000,,of men wearing dresses?
Dialogue: 1,0:27:48.12,0:27:51.83,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No shame,Agent Fuller. No shame.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:54.92,0:27:56.50,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm just having fun.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:56.59,0:27:58.92,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Was this your card? No.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:59.01,0:28:00.30,en,,0000,0000,0000,,See,I knew you weren't a queen of hearts lady,
Dialogue: 1,0:28:00.38,0:28:01.38,en,,0000,0000,0000,,and I respect that.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:01.47,0:28:03.34,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The trick usually works better when I'm not strapped in here,
Dialogue: 1,0:28:03.43,0:28:04.47,en,,0000,0000,0000,,but I understand protocol.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:04.55,0:28:05.89,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay,okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:05.97,0:28:08.56,en,,0000,0000,0000,,So,if you had nothing to do with it,
Dialogue: 1,0:28:08.64,0:28:11.23,en,,0000,0000,0000,,then how did the playing card get into the vault?
Dialogue: 1,0:28:11.31,0:28:12.31,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh,yes. That would be...
Dialogue: 1,0:28:12.40,0:28:13.90,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What do the kids call it these days?
Dialogue: 1,0:28:14.02,0:28:15.15,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh,yes,that's right. Magic.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:15.23,0:28:17.23,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Just answer the question,okay,smartass.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:17.32,0:28:19.90,en,,0000,0000,0000,,All right. Sorry,sorry,sorry.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:20.90,0:28:22.86,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You can keep that. Don't share it with him.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:23.07,0:28:26.08,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It says here you are a mentalist.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:26.70,0:28:29.33,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What exactly is mentalism?
Dialogue: 1,0:28:29.41,0:28:32.37,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Tricks,mostly. Some science.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:32.58,0:28:36.42,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Targeted guessing might be a most apt description.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:36.59,0:28:39.84,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Along with some intuition and the occasional...
Dialogue: 1,0:28:41.51,0:28:43.18,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Voices in my head.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:44.43,0:28:47.43,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Says here you were fairly famous at one point.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:47.51,0:28:49.52,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You can even hypnotize people over the phone.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:49.60,0:28:52.10,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Some big tours around the U.S. for a few years,
Dialogue: 1,0:28:52.19,0:28:54.19,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- two TV specials. - Glory days.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:54.40,0:28:55.65,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Then your brother/manager
Dialogue: 1,0:28:55.65,0:28:57.90,en,,0000,0000,0000,,disappeared with all your hard-earned money.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:57.94,0:28:59.28,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Did your research,did you?
Dialogue: 1,0:28:59.36,0:29:01.19,en,,0000,0000,0000,,IRS audit. Back taxes.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:01.28,0:29:03.03,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You've had a long hard slog back
Dialogue: 1,0:29:03.11,0:29:05.53,en,,0000,0000,0000,,into the limelight,haven't you,Mr. McKinney?
Dialogue: 1,0:29:05.62,0:29:07.04,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes,indeed,
Dialogue: 1,0:29:07.04,0:29:10.32,en,,0000,0000,0000,,it has. And I do appreciate that trip down Memory Lane.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:10.50,0:29:12.46,en,,0000,0000,0000,,As far as I understand it,when the man from Paris
Dialogue: 1,0:29:12.54,0:29:13.71,en,,0000,0000,0000,,put on the magical helmet...
Dialogue: 1,0:29:13.79,0:29:14.79,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Listen to me.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:14.92,0:29:17.46,en,,0000,0000,0000,,If you didn't rob that bank,then you knew about it.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:17.54,0:29:18.67,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Which makes you an accomplice.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:18.75,0:29:21.17,en,,0000,0000,0000,,So if you wanna walk out of here today,I'd suggest you start...
Dialogue: 1,0:29:21.26,0:29:22.30,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Now you listen to me,unless you think
Dialogue: 1,0:29:22.38,0:29:23.80,en,,0000,0000,0000,,there's a D.A. in the state of Nevada
Dialogue: 1,0:29:23.88,0:29:25.34,en,,0000,0000,0000,,who'd be willing to make sense of this to a jury,
Dialogue: 1,0:29:25.43,0:29:26.59,en,,0000,0000,0000,,then we have a show to perform.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:26.80,0:29:27.85,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And you,Agent Rhodes,
Dialogue: 1,0:29:27.93,0:29:29.26,en,,0000,0000,0000,,have a drawing board to get back to.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:29.35,0:29:30.81,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Is this your first date?
Dialogue: 1,0:29:31.89,0:29:33.02,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:29:33.10,0:29:34.35,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No,I mean,obviously,
Dialogue: 1,0:29:34.35,0:29:36.94,en,,0000,0000,0000,,you guys don't know each other well,if at all.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:36.98,0:29:40.48,en,,0000,0000,0000,,But,like,there is a palpable tension in this room.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:40.57,0:29:42.40,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And before you get involved,
Dialogue: 1,0:29:42.49,0:29:45.99,en,,0000,0000,0000,,you should consider the fact that she has a lot of big secrets.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:46.11,0:29:47.78,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And I know the first one is that
Dialogue: 1,0:29:47.87,0:29:50.99,en,,0000,0000,0000,,this is your first time off the desk. Isn't it?
Dialogue: 1,0:29:51.41,0:29:52.87,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You should have said something to him.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:52.95,0:29:55.12,en,,0000,0000,0000,,This is a weird way for you to find out.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:55.21,0:29:57.04,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You are literally begging to be arrested. You know that?
Dialogue: 1,0:29:57.17,0:29:59.50,en,,0000,0000,0000,,If it means you would actually do it,then,yeah. But you won't.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:59.59,0:30:01.05,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Because if you did,it means that you,
Dialogue: 1,0:30:01.13,0:30:03.21,en,,0000,0000,0000,,and the FBI,and your friends at Interpol,
Dialogue: 1,0:30:03.30,0:30:06.76,en,,0000,0000,0000,,actually believe,at an institutional level,in magic.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:07.84,0:30:09.47,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The press would have a field day.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:09.68,0:30:11.47,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And we'd be even more famous than we already are.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:11.56,0:30:12.81,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And you guys would look like idiots
Dialogue: 1,0:30:12.89,0:30:14.18,en,,0000,0000,0000,,even more then you already are.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:14.27,0:30:17.77,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Well,no,not you. But him. Right?
Dialogue: 1,0:30:17.85,0:30:19.52,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You have,what we in the business,like to call,
Dialogue: 1,0:30:19.61,0:30:21.02,en,,0000,0000,0000,,"nothing up your sleeve."
Dialogue: 1,0:30:21.19,0:30:22.28,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And you know it.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:22.36,0:30:24.44,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't draw him in and then dump him
Dialogue: 1,0:30:24.61,0:30:27.99,en,,0000,0000,0000,,because abandonment is a big "area" for him.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:28.53,0:30:29.66,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Mommy?
Dialogue: 1,0:30:30.37,0:30:31.58,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Daddy.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:31.91,0:30:33.37,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You have big daddy issues.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:33.45,0:30:35.00,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Okay,that's enough. - I'll tell you what.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:35.08,0:30:36.21,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Your average therapist is gonna charge you
Dialogue: 1,0:30:36.21,0:30:38.41,en,,0000,0000,0000,,$200-$300 for this sesh.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:38.46,0:30:40.75,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Me? I'll take a tenner.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:41.29,0:30:44.38,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay,later,if you're feeling magnanimous,
Dialogue: 1,0:30:44.46,0:30:46.38,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll still take a tenner.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:46.63,0:30:48.68,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You wanna know who sat in that chair before you?
Dialogue: 1,0:30:48.80,0:30:50.89,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Mob bosses,murderers,and thieves.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:51.10,0:30:52.51,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And you know who put them there?
Dialogue: 1,0:30:52.60,0:30:54.52,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The guy who's sitting in this chair.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:54.60,0:30:58.56,en,,0000,0000,0000,,So I warn you,I can maintain my resolve much longer
Dialogue: 1,0:30:58.65,0:31:01.48,en,,0000,0000,0000,,than you can maintain that phony arrogance.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:01.56,0:31:03.69,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And the instant that you even show
Dialogue: 1,0:31:03.78,0:31:06.44,en,,0000,0000,0000,,the slightest crack in that smug facade,
Dialogue: 1,0:31:06.53,0:31:07.82,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be there.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:07.90,0:31:09.49,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I will be all over you like...
Dialogue: 1,0:31:09.57,0:31:10.74,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Like white on rice?
Dialogue: 1,0:31:11.03,0:31:12.53,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry. That's unfair.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:12.70,0:31:13.70,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Let me warn you.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:13.87,0:31:14.91,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I want you to follow.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:15.12,0:31:16.45,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Because no matter what you think you might know,
Dialogue: 1,0:31:16.54,0:31:18.08,en,,0000,0000,0000,,we will always be one step,three steps,
Dialogue: 1,0:31:18.16,0:31:19.21,en,,0000,0000,0000,,seven steps ahead of you.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:19.29,0:31:20.50,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And just when you think you're catching up,
Dialogue: 1,0:31:20.58,0:31:21.96,en,,0000,0000,0000,,that's when we'll be right behind you.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:22.04,0:31:23.50,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And at no time will you be anywhere other than
Dialogue: 1,0:31:23.59,0:31:24.67,en,,0000,0000,0000,,exactly where I want you to be.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:24.75,0:31:26.38,en,,0000,0000,0000,,So come close. Get all over me
Dialogue: 1,0:31:26.46,0:31:27.80,en,,0000,0000,0000,,because the closer you think you are,
Dialogue: 1,0:31:27.88,0:31:29.26,en,,0000,0000,0000,,the less you'll actually see.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:29.34,0:31:30.34,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna nail you...
Dialogue: 1,0:31:34.81,0:31:37.14,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Something wrong with that soda,Miss?
Dialogue: 1,0:31:45.44,0:31:46.69,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh! Shit!
Dialogue: 1,0:31:47.28,0:31:48.78,en,,0000,0000,0000,,First rule of magic.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:49.61,0:31:51.86,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Always be the smartest guy in the room.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:14.97,0:32:16.85,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Boss,what are we doing? We're letting them go?
Dialogue: 1,0:32:17.06,0:32:19.10,en,,0000,0000,0000,,They all but admitted they're gonna do it again.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:19.18,0:32:21.23,en,,0000,0000,0000,,About a half an hour ago,you didn't give a damn about them.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:21.31,0:32:23.06,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- What changed? - I met them.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:23.15,0:32:24.15,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey. Guys.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:24.48,0:32:26.94,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey,I ran a check on the audience.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:27.02,0:32:28.15,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Most of it was just filler.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:28.23,0:32:29.90,en,,0000,0000,0000,,People that Tressler dragged in to pack the room.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:29.99,0:32:31.78,en,,0000,0000,0000,,But guess who was sitting there in the back,
Dialogue: 1,0:32:31.86,0:32:33.03,en,,0000,0000,0000,,filming the whole damn thing?
Dialogue: 1,0:32:33.16,0:32:34.16,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:34.24,0:32:35.70,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Thaddeus Bradley.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:38.24,0:32:40.41,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Thaddeus Bradley,the guy from TV with the DVDs and shows?
Dialogue: 1,0:32:40.50,0:32:41.50,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:41.58,0:32:43.92,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay,well,he debunks magicians.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:44.00,0:32:45.84,en,,0000,0000,0000,,He exposes them. He shows you how to do their tricks.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:45.92,0:32:47.00,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Get him on the phone.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:47.09,0:32:48.76,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I did. You're having lunch with him in 45.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:48.84,0:32:49.88,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Good.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:50.05,0:32:52.72,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Mr. Bradley started as a magician.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:52.80,0:32:54.51,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- He was actually quite good. - Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:32:54.84,0:32:56.97,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- One of the best. - You don't say.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:58.31,0:33:01.18,en,,0000,0000,0000,,"The greatest genius is in seeing through the illusion."
Dialogue: 1,0:33:01.27,0:33:03.69,en,,0000,0000,0000,,That's a man who loves his work.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:05.15,0:33:06.94,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You sure I can't interest you in a glass of wine?
Dialogue: 1,0:33:07.02,0:33:09.86,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No,no,no. No,thank you,sir. We're working.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:10.32,0:33:11.49,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I will take one.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:20.04,0:33:22.58,en,,0000,0000,0000,,That's incredible. That's amazing.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:24.21,0:33:25.37,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Red dye,palmed.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:25.46,0:33:28.13,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that how Jesus did it? That's incredible.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:28.21,0:33:29.55,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry. Can I just take a minute here?
Dialogue: 1,0:33:29.63,0:33:31.92,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You were one of the great magicians. Why did you stop?
Dialogue: 1,0:33:32.55,0:33:35.22,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you know how many people went to see magic performed live
Dialogue: 1,0:33:35.30,0:33:36.89,en,,0000,0000,0000,,in the last half decade?
Dialogue: 1,0:33:36.97,0:33:38.22,en,,0000,0000,0000,,About 1.6 million.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:38.30,0:33:41.64,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You know how many DVDs I sold in the same period?
Dialogue: 1,0:33:41.72,0:33:43.02,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Five million.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:43.10,0:33:44.14,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Right,so it's about the money.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:44.23,0:33:45.73,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Well,the money is only there
Dialogue: 1,0:33:45.81,0:33:49.07,en,,0000,0000,0000,,because the need to know is greater than the desire to be fooled.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:49.15,0:33:50.69,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Like you,I detest those
Dialogue: 1,0:33:50.69,0:33:53.48,en,,0000,0000,0000,,who prey upon the gullibility of the masses.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:53.53,0:33:57.20,en,,0000,0000,0000,,With all due respect,isn't there a cost,though,to this game?
Dialogue: 1,0:33:57.74,0:33:58.78,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Cost?
Dialogue: 1,0:33:58.87,0:34:00.16,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know. Careers.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:00.24,0:34:01.37,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Lives.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:01.45,0:34:04.66,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I assume you're referring to Lionel Shrike.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:05.12,0:34:06.96,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry,who?
Dialogue: 1,0:34:07.04,0:34:08.54,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Lionel Shrike.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:08.63,0:34:13.01,en,,0000,0000,0000,,A middling magician who drowned in the Hudson River 30 years ago.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:13.09,0:34:14.88,en,,0000,0000,0000,,On Mr. Bradley's first special,
Dialogue: 1,0:34:14.88,0:34:16.88,en,,0000,0000,0000,,he revealed all of Shrike's tricks.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:16.93,0:34:20.39,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The next year,Shrike tried to stage a comeback.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:20.47,0:34:21.93,en,,0000,0000,0000,,He was shackled inside a safe,
Dialogue: 1,0:34:22.01,0:34:23.81,en,,0000,0000,0000,,and dropped into the river.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:23.89,0:34:25.02,en,,0000,0000,0000,,But he never resurfaced.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:25.10,0:34:27.35,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You mean he died?
Dialogue: 1,0:34:27.44,0:34:29.23,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't kill him.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:29.31,0:34:30.82,en,,0000,0000,0000,,He killed himself
Dialogue: 1,0:34:30.82,0:34:33.60,en,,0000,0000,0000,,trying to do something he wasn't prepared to handle.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:33.65,0:34:35.86,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You do realize this is a game?
Dialogue: 1,0:34:35.95,0:34:37.74,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Believe me,it's not a game.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:37.82,0:34:38.99,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It is a game.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:39.07,0:34:40.83,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You're the game. You're being played.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:40.91,0:34:44.37,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And your pathetic attempts at fawning to gain my trust...
Dialogue: 1,0:34:44.45,0:34:46.21,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I mean,come on.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:46.29,0:34:47.29,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You got me.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:47.37,0:34:48.62,en,,0000,0000,0000,,If you really want to know
Dialogue: 1,0:34:48.71,0:34:52.50,en,,0000,0000,0000,,how a bank in Paris was robbed from a stage in Las Vegas,
Dialogue: 1,0:34:52.59,0:34:54.55,en,,0000,0000,0000,,my special comes out next month.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:54.63,0:34:55.76,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Or I could just bring you in
Dialogue: 1,0:34:55.84,0:34:58.30,en,,0000,0000,0000,,on obstruction charges and force you to tell me.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:58.38,0:34:59.93,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Unless,of course,what you're trying to say to me is that
Dialogue: 1,0:35:00.01,0:35:03.10,en,,0000,0000,0000,,you actually don't know how they did it.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:05.10,0:35:07.27,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Showmanship and theatrics.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:07.48,0:35:09.60,en,,0000,0000,0000,,When a magician waves his hand and says,
Dialogue: 1,0:35:09.73,0:35:11.31,en,,0000,0000,0000,,"This is where the magic is happening."
Dialogue: 1,0:35:11.56,0:35:13.98,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The real trick is happening somewhere else.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:14.48,0:35:17.45,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Misdirection. A basic concept of magic.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:17.65,0:35:19.91,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Not interested in the concepts of magic.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:20.11,0:35:21.62,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I wanna know how they robbed a bank.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:21.78,0:35:24.49,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You're an idiot if you think they robbed a bank.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:24.74,0:35:26.00,en,,0000,0000,0000,,But don't take my word for it.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:26.50,0:35:28.16,en,,0000,0000,0000,,How about a trip to Paris?
Dialogue: 1,0:35:28.62,0:35:31.75,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hermia,the teleportation helmet,please,darling?
Dialogue: 1,0:35:32.29,0:35:33.59,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You're joking,right?
Dialogue: 1,0:35:33.79,0:35:36.05,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You wanna know how they did it or not?
Dialogue: 1,0:35:36.76,0:35:39.43,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm just gonna put this on your head.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:40.13,0:35:41.47,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Step right up.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:42.76,0:35:44.43,en,,0000,0000,0000,,There you go.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:45.10,0:35:48.77,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Now we just pull this down all safe and snug.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:49.81,0:35:52.73,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Make yourself comfortable. There we go.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:52.81,0:35:54.94,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And when you're ready to go to Paris,
Dialogue: 1,0:35:55.02,0:35:57.11,en,,0000,0000,0000,,just say the magic word.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:57.44,0:35:58.61,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Blow me?
Dialogue: 1,0:35:59.61,0:36:01.36,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- That'll suffice. - Bon voyage.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:13.38,0:36:16.50,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I personally prefer to take the stairs to Paris.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:17.17,0:36:19.13,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome to the City of Light,Agent Rhodes.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:19.30,0:36:21.09,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hardy har har. What was with the helmet?
Dialogue: 1,0:36:21.47,0:36:22.68,en,,0000,0000,0000,,My fun.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:24.01,0:36:25.26,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:36:25.35,0:36:26.72,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:28.47,0:36:29.64,en,,0000,0000,0000,,So they got a vault set.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:29.73,0:36:30.81,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:30.89,0:36:31.98,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And it's the exact replica
Dialogue: 1,0:36:32.14,0:36:33.23,en,,0000,0000,0000,,of the little French guy's bank.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:33.31,0:36:34.36,en,,0000,0000,0000,,So he's a plant.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:34.44,0:36:35.90,en,,0000,0000,0000,,He was a dupe,not a plant.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:35.98,0:36:38.15,en,,0000,0000,0000,,They chose him. They knew which seat he was in.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:38.61,0:36:40.82,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No,no,no,the audience picked the seat.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:41.65,0:36:44.41,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Unless,of course,the audience didn't pick the seat.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:44.49,0:36:46.58,en,,0000,0000,0000,,They let them think they picked the seat.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:46.66,0:36:48.04,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll choose one at random then.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:48.54,0:36:50.41,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Actually,they were just palming the ball
Dialogue: 1,0:36:50.50,0:36:52.21,en,,0000,0000,0000,,with the seat number they wanted.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:52.67,0:36:54.50,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We are looking at row number 5.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:54.67,0:36:56.00,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Henley,could I please have a seat number?
Dialogue: 1,0:36:56.50,0:36:57.50,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Lucky number 13.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:57.59,0:36:59.63,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Could you just confirm that this is,in fact,your seat?
Dialogue: 1,0:36:59.71,0:37:01.30,en,,0000,0000,0000,,He was selected.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:02.05,0:37:04.09,en,,0000,0000,0000,,They programmed his mind to make him go to Las Vegas.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:04.18,0:37:05.34,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Viva Las Vegas.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:06.43,0:37:09.47,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And then they kept reinforcing it,until he did.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:10.68,0:37:11.93,en,,0000,0000,0000,,They trailed him.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:12.02,0:37:13.14,en,,0000,0000,0000,,They studied him.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:13.23,0:37:14.98,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing was left to chance.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:17.27,0:37:18.27,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I got his measurements.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:18.36,0:37:20.74,en,,0000,0000,0000,,He had no idea he was their target.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:20.86,0:37:22.99,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And they simply activated him in Vegas.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:23.15,0:37:24.36,en,,0000,0000,0000,,When I snap my fingers...
Dialogue: 1,0:37:24.57,0:37:27.03,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And once again,Merritt McKinney.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:27.16,0:37:28.24,en,,0000,0000,0000,,But how did they know what bank was his?
Dialogue: 1,0:37:28.58,0:37:29.70,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- You're kidding. - Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:37:29.91,0:37:32.46,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Can you be any more of a condescending ass?
Dialogue: 1,0:37:32.54,0:37:33.54,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:34.33,0:37:35.33,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:36.50,0:37:39.80,en,,0000,0000,0000,,There's a very rare,very mysterious way
Dialogue: 1,0:37:39.88,0:37:43.38,en,,0000,0000,0000,,in which a magician divines an audience member's bank.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:44.38,0:37:45.38,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You ready?
Dialogue: 1,0:37:45.80,0:37:46.80,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:47.72,0:37:49.10,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Credit card.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:49.47,0:37:52.31,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And that's how they got the signature for the card
Dialogue: 1,0:37:52.39,0:37:54.35,en,,0000,0000,0000,,they left in the vault in Paris.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:54.44,0:37:55.44,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Very good.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:55.69,0:37:57.15,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You're being one-upped,Agent Rhodes.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:57.44,0:38:00.27,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay,but they had to get the signature card in the vault.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:00.40,0:38:01.90,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You said they didn't steal the money.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:02.15,0:38:03.65,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No,I didn't say they didn't steal the money.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:03.74,0:38:05.20,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I said they didn't rob the bank.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:06.36,0:38:08.32,en,,0000,0000,0000,,My guess is that they targeted
Dialogue: 1,0:38:08.41,0:38:10.08,en,,0000,0000,0000,,a shipment of freshly minted money
Dialogue: 1,0:38:10.16,0:38:14.08,en,,0000,0000,0000,,headed to the Frenchman's bank on-board an armored truck.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:15.50,0:38:18.29,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Which,of course,is just as hard to break into.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:18.42,0:38:21.05,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Unless you're already inside.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:40.61,0:38:43.65,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And despite what the banks would have you believe,
Dialogue: 1,0:38:43.73,0:38:46.57,en,,0000,0000,0000,,the men who drive these trucks are not exactly mental giants.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:48.28,0:38:49.82,en,,0000,0000,0000,,For our Horsemen,
Dialogue: 1,0:38:49.91,0:38:52.16,en,,0000,0000,0000,,it was almost too easy.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:06.01,0:39:07.47,en,,0000,0000,0000,,So,how did they make the fake
Dialogue: 1,0:39:07.47,0:39:09.59,en,,0000,0000,0000,,money disappear from the vault? What is that?
Dialogue: 1,0:39:10.01,0:39:11.43,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Flash paper.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:13.68,0:39:15.89,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Magicians use it all the time.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:21.06,0:39:23.86,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Creates no smoke,leaves no residue.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:29.24,0:39:31.62,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Two days ago,no one heard of these guys,
Dialogue: 1,0:39:31.78,0:39:34.37,en,,0000,0000,0000,,but tonight's show sold out in 35 seconds.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:34.45,0:39:36.91,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I think these guys have cracked the secret to show business.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:37.00,0:39:39.75,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Give your audience $3 million.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:39.96,0:39:41.33,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Puts 'em in a good mood,doesn't it?
Dialogue: 1,0:39:41.42,0:39:42.63,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Best finale ever.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:42.71,0:39:45.17,en,,0000,0000,0000,,They're gonna be the first magicians in history to get laid.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:45.25,0:39:47.72,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Remember,if the oxygen mask comes down,
Dialogue: 1,0:39:47.80,0:39:49.84,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- put it on the lawyer first. Remember. - Oh,yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:49.93,0:39:52.26,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I always do. It's lawyer first,
Dialogue: 1,0:39:52.34,0:39:54.39,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- then myself and then the children. - Then yourself.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:54.47,0:39:55.89,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. Then the children.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:56.77,0:39:59.44,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Allow me to make plain what we've both been thinking.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:59.52,0:40:00.69,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And what's that?
Dialogue: 1,0:40:00.77,0:40:03.86,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Well,obviously,you have feelings of affection for Daniel.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:03.94,0:40:06.11,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Unrequited and misguided,
Dialogue: 1,0:40:06.19,0:40:08.99,en,,0000,0000,0000,,owing to his lack of emotional availability.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:09.07,0:40:11.74,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Consequently,you're very tightly...
Dialogue: 1,0:40:11.82,0:40:13.45,en,,0000,0000,0000,,How should I put it?
Dialogue: 1,0:40:13.95,0:40:14.95,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Corked.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:15.03,0:40:16.04,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh,lam?
Dialogue: 1,0:40:16.12,0:40:19.75,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Now,recognizing that you have physical needs not being met,
Dialogue: 1,0:40:19.83,0:40:22.46,en,,0000,0000,0000,,and strictly in the vein of helping a sister out,
Dialogue: 1,0:40:22.54,0:40:27.25,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I invite you to think of me as your own personal corkscrew.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:27.46,0:40:28.59,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow. Thanks.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:28.67,0:40:31.43,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Let me mull over that offer of cheap and meaningless sex.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:31.51,0:40:35.43,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Cheap and meaningless,maybe,but not time-consuming.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:39.06,0:40:41.06,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We should be getting there a few minutes early.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:41.14,0:40:42.23,en,,0000,0000,0000,,So,sit back,relax.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:42.31,0:40:44.06,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We should be in the Big Easy soon.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:44.15,0:40:45.86,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Appreciate you flying with us today.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:45.94,0:40:48.40,en,,0000,0000,0000,,So,what's in it for Tressler,besides the money?
Dialogue: 1,0:40:48.48,0:40:49.57,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Ego.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:51.24,0:40:52.99,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay,pick your card.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:53.49,0:40:55.95,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Look at it,put it in the deck,and tell me.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:56.03,0:40:57.87,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No,don't tell me.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:57.95,0:40:59.75,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Okay. - Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:59.83,0:41:01.25,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Thaddeus was there that night.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:01.33,0:41:03.75,en,,0000,0000,0000,,He knows exactly how they pulled it off. What about him?
Dialogue: 1,0:41:03.83,0:41:05.50,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 1,0:41:05.58,0:41:07.09,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You think they could be working together.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:07.17,0:41:08.59,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know. All I know is that these guys
Dialogue: 1,0:41:08.67,0:41:10.13,en,,0000,0000,0000,,were a bunch of street magicians
Dialogue: 1,0:41:10.21,0:41:11.76,en,,0000,0000,0000,,a year ago with no resources.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:11.84,0:41:14.39,en,,0000,0000,0000,,So,how do they go from doing that to this
Dialogue: 1,0:41:14.47,0:41:15.93,en,,0000,0000,0000,,without some kind of outside help?
Dialogue: 1,0:41:16.01,0:41:17.43,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Is this your card?
Dialogue: 1,0:41:17.51,0:41:20.93,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No,my card is sitting over there in that guy's lap.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:21.56,0:41:23.27,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Nice shuffle.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:23.35,0:41:24.52,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You know,this is hard.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:24.60,0:41:25.65,en,,0000,0000,0000,,According to this book,
Dialogue: 1,0:41:25.73,0:41:27.32,en,,0000,0000,0000,,some of those guys
Dialogue: 1,0:41:27.32,0:41:29.81,en,,0000,0000,0000,,practice one simple move eight hours a day for years.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:29.86,0:41:32.90,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Really? Some of those guys seriously need to get a life.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:32.99,0:41:35.24,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Is it magicians,in general,you have a problem with?
Dialogue: 1,0:41:35.32,0:41:37.57,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Or specifically those guys?
Dialogue: 1,0:41:38.33,0:41:40.91,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I could care less about magicians in general.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:41.00,0:41:43.83,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What I hate is people who exploit other people.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:43.91,0:41:45.04,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Exploit them how?
Dialogue: 1,0:41:45.12,0:41:46.46,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Try again.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:47.58,0:41:49.50,en,,0000,0000,0000,,By taking advantage of their weaknesses.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:49.59,0:41:52.34,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Their need to believe in something that's unexplainable
Dialogue: 1,0:41:52.42,0:41:55.30,en,,0000,0000,0000,,in order to make their lives more bearable.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:55.51,0:41:57.18,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I see it as a strength.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:57.26,0:41:59.22,en,,0000,0000,0000,,My life is happier when I believe that.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:00.26,0:42:01.64,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Is this your card?
Dialogue: 1,0:42:02.81,0:42:03.93,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:04.77,0:42:05.85,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 1,0:42:05.94,0:42:07.48,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Yeah. - Cool.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:09.86,0:42:13.24,en,,0000,0000,0000,,That smile on your face. Is it real?
Dialogue: 1,0:42:13.32,0:42:14.57,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:15.03,0:42:17.45,en,,0000,0000,0000,,So let me ask you,Mr. Detective Man.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:17.53,0:42:18.95,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you feel exploited?
Dialogue: 1,0:42:19.03,0:42:22.29,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Or did you have maybe a tiny,tiny bit of fun?
Dialogue: 1,0:42:24.54,0:42:25.79,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Guy goes to the doctor.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:25.87,0:42:26.92,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Doctor says,"Sir,you're gonna
Dialogue: 1,0:42:27.00,0:42:28.08,en,,0000,0000,0000,,"have to stop masturbating."
Dialogue: 1,0:42:28.17,0:42:29.17,en,,0000,0000,0000,,He Says,"Why?"
Dialogue: 1,0:42:29.25,0:42:30.71,en,,0000,0000,0000,,He says,"So I can finish the examination."
Dialogue: 1,0:42:30.79,0:42:31.88,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh,Danny,can I talk to you about
Dialogue: 1,0:42:31.96,0:42:33.51,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- my role in the show real quick? - Yeah,yeah,yeah. Sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:33.59,0:42:34.84,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey,guys.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:35.30,0:42:36.72,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We got a show to prepare for.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:36.80,0:42:39.14,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Do we now?
Dialogue: 1,0:42:39.22,0:42:40.26,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No,no,no,don't do that.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:40.35,0:42:41.51,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You're not doing that thing to me. No.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:41.64,0:42:42.93,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What thing? I'm just looking at you.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:43.02,0:42:44.60,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No,you're not. I've been watching you for a year.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:44.68,0:42:46.06,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I know all of your little tricks.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:46.14,0:42:47.31,en,,0000,0000,0000,,That what they are to you? Tricks?
Dialogue: 1,0:42:47.39,0:42:49.10,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes,it's gimmicks. it's Barnum statements.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:49.19,0:42:50.90,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It's reading the eyes. Body language. I get it.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:50.98,0:42:52.65,en,,0000,0000,0000,,If it's such an easy thing,why don't you do Henley?
Dialogue: 1,0:42:52.73,0:42:54.49,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah,Danny. Why don't you do me?
Dialogue: 1,0:42:54.57,0:42:56.74,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No,you're too easy. I'll do Jasmine.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:56.82,0:42:58.32,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:58.66,0:42:59.66,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Do me.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:59.74,0:43:01.16,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh,yeah. Yeah. Do Art.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:01.24,0:43:02.24,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:02.37,0:43:03.41,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Even better.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:03.49,0:43:04.50,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Art. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:04.58,0:43:06.37,en,,0000,0000,0000,,But I warn you,I can be difficult to read,
Dialogue: 1,0:43:06.46,0:43:07.46,en,,0000,0000,0000,,when I want to be.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:07.54,0:43:09.75,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Just stay with me,okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:43:10.38,0:43:12.29,en,,0000,0000,0000,,So,Art,you were a tough kid.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:12.38,0:43:14.42,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You know,kind of a real rapscallion.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:14.51,0:43:16.42,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You had a dog. A real tough dog.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:16.51,0:43:18.43,en,,0000,0000,0000,,A brutish breed. Like a real...
Dialogue: 1,0:43:18.51,0:43:20.68,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to say,Ben the bulldog.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:20.76,0:43:23.18,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Actually,I was a prissy little tot.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:23.26,0:43:26.35,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I had a fluffy white cat called Snuffles.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:27.89,0:43:29.19,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:29.35,0:43:30.48,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait,let me try one.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:30.56,0:43:31.65,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- I can do way better than that. - Let him do it.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:31.73,0:43:32.82,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on,give me one more time. One more time.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:32.90,0:43:34.48,en,,0000,0000,0000,,He can do way better than that.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:34.57,0:43:35.57,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's do family.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:35.69,0:43:38.86,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You had an uncle on your mother's side.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:39.03,0:43:41.62,en,,0000,0000,0000,,He had a real,kind of... A real masculine name.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:41.70,0:43:43.95,en,,0000,0000,0000,,A real,kind of,salt-of-the-earth...
Dialogue: 1,0:43:44.03,0:43:45.54,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You know,a real stick-it-to-you...
Dialogue: 1,0:43:45.62,0:43:49.79,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Like it was some kind of Paul. Thompson? Was it a Paul...
Dialogue: 1,0:43:49.96,0:43:51.54,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. You know what? I got nothin'.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:51.63,0:43:53.13,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Nearly though. - Was I?
Dialogue: 1,0:43:53.21,0:43:56.63,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. My uncle's name was Cushman Armitage.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:56.80,0:43:58.34,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Really? Snuffles and Cushman Armitage?
Dialogue: 1,0:43:58.42,0:43:59.47,en,,0000,0000,0000,,That was your childhood?
Dialogue: 1,0:43:59.55,0:44:01.93,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I certainly hope tonight's show is gonna be better than this.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:02.80,0:44:04.93,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry. Just you wait.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:10.23,0:44:13.31,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey. Come on,give me some good news on a hotel room,please.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:13.40,0:44:14.52,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What,are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 1,0:44:14.61,0:44:16.15,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No,it's Mardi Gras,Dylan.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:16.23,0:44:18.15,en,,0000,0000,0000,,There's nothing within sight of the theater.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:18.24,0:44:20.61,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on a second. Hold on. Where is this woman?
Dialogue: 1,0:44:22.49,0:44:24.45,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey,hey! There you are.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:24.74,0:44:26.12,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What,the French girl doing a little sightseeing
Dialogue: 1,0:44:26.24,0:44:27.24,en,,0000,0000,0000,,while she's in New Orleans?
Dialogue: 1,0:44:27.33,0:44:29.54,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No. In fact,here,speaking French
Dialogue: 1,0:44:29.62,0:44:31.33,en,,0000,0000,0000,,is actually an asset.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:31.42,0:44:32.92,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you see that woman up there?
Dialogue: 1,0:44:33.96,0:44:35.09,en,,0000,0000,0000,,That's Marie Claire.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:35.17,0:44:37.42,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And she has a lovely apartment for us.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:39.76,0:44:41.09,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:41.43,0:44:42.72,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:42.80,0:44:44.43,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We got a place.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:46.39,0:44:49.60,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I want two each inside of here. The other 30 around here.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:49.68,0:44:51.06,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Roofs,alleys,balconies.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:51.14,0:44:54.23,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Eyes on The Horsemen at all times. - Yes,sir.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:54.31,0:44:58.15,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow,100 years ago,William Robinson took the name Chung Ling Soo
Dialogue: 1,0:44:58.23,0:45:02.11,en,,0000,0000,0000,,and spent his entire life never speaking English in public.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:03.95,0:45:05.78,en,,0000,0000,0000,,This other guy,Maximillian...
Dialogue: 1,0:45:05.99,0:45:08.95,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I am not interested in a history lesson on magic at this moment.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:09.41,0:45:11.87,en,,0000,0000,0000,,If you want to keep playing into their hands,go for it.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:11.96,0:45:13.87,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm just trying to understand how they think.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:13.96,0:45:16.17,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You think I'm playing in their hands,do you?
Dialogue: 1,0:45:16.25,0:45:19.05,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know how any of that is gonna go against this.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:19.13,0:45:21.30,en,,0000,0000,0000,,This what? This magic?
Dialogue: 1,0:45:22.76,0:45:24.09,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Lionel Shrike.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:24.30,0:45:27.85,en,,0000,0000,0000,,In Central Park,he has a guy pick a card and sign it.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:27.93,0:45:30.93,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Then he goes to a tree that has been there 20 years.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:31.10,0:45:32.52,en,,0000,0000,0000,,They saw the tree in half.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:32.60,0:45:34.69,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Inside the tree,encased in glass,
Dialogue: 1,0:45:34.77,0:45:36.61,en,,0000,0000,0000,,is the card with the signature.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:36.69,0:45:37.81,en,,0000,0000,0000,,How did he do that?
Dialogue: 1,0:45:37.90,0:45:41.23,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I have no idea. But I'm sure there's a logical explanation.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:44.49,0:45:45.91,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You guys got a guy in that lobby yet?
Dialogue: 1,0:45:45.99,0:45:47.57,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No,but I do have some good news.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:47.78,0:45:49.74,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Remember how Atlas is such a control freak,
Dialogue: 1,0:45:49.83,0:45:51.58,en,,0000,0000,0000,,he's got his whole crew on those tracking bracelets?
Dialogue: 1,0:45:51.66,0:45:52.96,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What tracking bracelets?
Dialogue: 1,0:45:53.04,0:45:54.29,en,,0000,0000,0000,,He has every member of his crew
Dialogue: 1,0:45:54.37,0:45:55.96,en,,0000,0000,0000,,wearing a tracking bracelet.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:56.04,0:45:58.13,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Those bracelets are on a sub-8 flat-band.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:58.21,0:45:59.38,en,,0000,0000,0000,,So as long as Atlas is tracking them...
Dialogue: 1,0:45:59.46,0:46:00.55,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Next.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:00.63,0:46:01.71,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Our boys can track Atlas...
Dialogue: 1,0:46:01.80,0:46:03.22,en,,0000,0000,0000,,from right here in the mobile command unit.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:03.30,0:46:05.26,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay,call me if you get any movement.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:05.34,0:46:06.68,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Copy that.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:15.48,0:46:17.85,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You are missing the big picture here,Dylan.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:19.19,0:46:22.82,en,,0000,0000,0000,,There is a place in Paris,Pont des Arts.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:22.99,0:46:26.82,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Sometimes in the mornings I sit on a bench there.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:27.24,0:46:28.87,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And I watch the people make a wish
Dialogue: 1,0:46:28.99,0:46:31.08,en,,0000,0000,0000,,and lock it in a lock on the bridge.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:31.16,0:46:33.83,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Then throw the key into the Seine.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:35.66,0:46:40.25,en,,0000,0000,0000,,All day they do this. Mothers,lovers,old men.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:40.50,0:46:42.46,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Watching the key sink into the water
Dialogue: 1,0:46:42.55,0:46:45.80,en,,0000,0000,0000,,and their secret is locked away forever.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:46.68,0:46:51.01,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Real and,at the same time,magical.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:59.19,0:47:02.86,en,,0000,0000,0000,,do you really think it's possible there's a fifth Horseman?
Dialogue: 1,0:47:04.36,0:47:05.61,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:47:12.03,0:47:13.95,en,,0000,0000,0000,,There is a legend of a secret order
Dialogue: 1,0:47:14.04,0:47:15.91,en,,0000,0000,0000,,born in ancient Egypt called
Dialogue: 1,0:47:16.37,0:47:17.66,en,,0000,0000,0000,,"The Eye."
Dialogue: 1,0:47:19.37,0:47:21.84,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It is said they perfected sleight of hand
Dialogue: 1,0:47:21.92,0:47:24.00,en,,0000,0000,0000,,to steal food from the Pharaohs
Dialogue: 1,0:47:24.09,0:47:25.88,en,,0000,0000,0000,,and give it to the slaves.
Dialogue: 1,0:47:26.26,0:47:27.47,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Their purpose?
Dialogue: 1,0:47:27.55,0:47:31.55,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Using magic and illusion to even the scales of justice.
Dialogue: 1,0:47:32.43,0:47:34.02,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Are The Horsemen next
Dialogue: 1,0:47:34.02,0:47:36.76,en,,0000,0000,0000,,in a long line of fools to believe this myth?
Dialogue: 1,0:47:37.14,0:47:38.86,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Will they evade the rules of law
Dialogue: 1,0:47:38.86,0:47:41.89,en,,0000,0000,0000,,and logic like they did in Las Vegas?
Dialogue: 1,0:47:42.73,0:47:46.99,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Or will the dark mysticism of this Southern swampland
Dialogue: 1,0:47:47.57,0:47:49.15,en,,0000,0000,0000,,get the better of them?
Dialogue: 1,0:47:55.58,0:47:57.08,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Bravo,Mr. Bradley.
Dialogue: 1,0:47:57.25,0:47:59.25,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Either you have a cease-and-desist,
Dialogue: 1,0:47:59.33,0:48:01.63,en,,0000,0000,0000,,which you don't,or you should leave.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:01.83,0:48:07.92,en,,0000,0000,0000,,If I want something to cease or desist,it does.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:08.13,0:48:09.30,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Take five.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:09.63,0:48:11.43,en,,0000,0000,0000,,According to your potential backers,
Dialogue: 1,0:48:11.64,0:48:16.97,en,,0000,0000,0000,,you stand to make 2.5 million tops from your best special.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:17.18,0:48:19.85,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I have here a check
Dialogue: 1,0:48:21.60,0:48:22.85,en,,0000,0000,0000,,for 3.5 million.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:24.27,0:48:27.94,en,,0000,0000,0000,,To fly away. My jet is at your disposal.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:30.11,0:48:32.78,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's not kid ourselves,Mr. Tressler.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:34.37,0:48:36.45,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You're in this to ride them up.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:36.95,0:48:38.95,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm in it to ride them down.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:39.29,0:48:42.29,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I take it that we do not have a deal.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:43.79,0:48:48.13,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And therein lies our conflict.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:51.55,0:48:52.80,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Let me be blunt.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:53.22,0:48:57.68,en,,0000,0000,0000,,My bank account is much,much bigger than yours.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:57.89,0:49:00.73,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And my lawyers are much stronger.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:01.06,0:49:04.15,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And they will manacle you
Dialogue: 1,0:49:05.40,0:49:07.23,en,,0000,0000,0000,,with so many injunctions.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:07.48,0:49:09.73,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Until you stand by,hopelessly watching
Dialogue: 1,0:49:09.82,0:49:12.49,en,,0000,0000,0000,,everything that you own drain away
Dialogue: 1,0:49:13.32,0:49:15.82,en,,0000,0000,0000,,in front of your greedy little eyes.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:15.95,0:49:18.16,en,,0000,0000,0000,,This isn't the first time I've been threatened.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:19.54,0:49:21.04,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And I'm still here.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:21.12,0:49:25.46,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It is,however,the first time you've been threatened by me.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:26.33,0:49:30.76,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And if you do anything to sully my investment,
Dialogue: 1,0:49:30.84,0:49:33.22,en,,0000,0000,0000,,the ride down,which you mentioned,
Dialogue: 1,0:49:33.30,0:49:38.56,en,,0000,0000,0000,,will be sudden,precipitous,and measurable on the Richter scale.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:40.18,0:49:42.18,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You shouldn't have done that.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:43.52,0:49:45.10,en,,0000,0000,0000,,According to superstition,
Dialogue: 1,0:49:45.31,0:49:48.32,en,,0000,0000,0000,,one who uses a doll to enact one's own wrath,
Dialogue: 1,0:49:48.40,0:49:52.86,en,,0000,0000,0000,,is likely to bring that very wrath unto himself.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:53.70,0:49:55.20,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't that funny?
Dialogue: 1,0:49:56.03,0:49:58.03,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And I thought you didn't believe in magic.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:07.96,0:50:09.04,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Do me a favor.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:09.13,0:50:13.17,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Visualize your most adventurous sexualexpnence.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:13.26,0:50:14.30,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Stay out of my head,you perv.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:14.38,0:50:16.26,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Well,no,if I stay out of your head,
Dialogue: 1,0:50:16.26,0:50:18.09,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm never gonna get into your pants.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:18.18,0:50:20.18,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Right. - So let's stick with this exercise.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:20.26,0:50:22.14,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- And it helps... - Pardon the intrusion.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:22.22,0:50:24.81,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I just wanted to wish you good luck tonight.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:24.89,0:50:27.48,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What,so you can try to expose us later on your little website?
Dialogue: 1,0:50:27.56,0:50:28.77,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And on demand.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:28.86,0:50:31.82,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- That's not gonna happen. - Oh,no?
Dialogue: 1,0:50:31.90,0:50:34.90,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Operating on a special plane because of The Eye?
Dialogue: 1,0:50:35.61,0:50:40.45,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I heard it's a lovely place. Lots of starshine and moonbeams.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:40.53,0:50:42.99,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Make any magician's wish come true.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:43.08,0:50:44.50,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You've come a long way,
Dialogue: 1,0:50:44.58,0:50:46.41,en,,0000,0000,0000,,much further than anyone would have expected
Dialogue: 1,0:50:46.50,0:50:48.50,en,,0000,0000,0000,,of a bunch of wanna-hes and has-beans.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:48.58,0:50:50.92,en,,0000,0000,0000,,If by "has-been" you're referring to me,
Dialogue: 1,0:50:50.92,0:50:52.71,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I just wanna say I'm flattered,
Dialogue: 1,0:50:52.84,0:50:56.22,en,,0000,0000,0000,,because I always considered myself a never-was.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:56.30,0:50:58.47,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you mind if I do a quick read on you?
Dialogue: 1,0:50:59.26,0:51:00.26,en,,0000,0000,0000,,By all means.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:01.26,0:51:05.93,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay,I'm picturing a little boy.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:06.02,0:51:08.94,en,,0000,0000,0000,,He wants to be a great magician someday.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:09.02,0:51:10.81,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And though he's good,he's not quite good enough.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:10.90,0:51:14.99,en,,0000,0000,0000,,So he ends up at the bottom of the entertainment food chain,
Dialogue: 1,0:51:15.07,0:51:18.66,en,,0000,0000,0000,,feeding off of those who have the talent that he never did.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:18.74,0:51:21.28,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Tell me. Am I getting close?
Dialogue: 1,0:51:23.95,0:51:24.96,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait. Before you go.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:24.96,0:51:26.91,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm working on something new. Do you have a second?
Dialogue: 1,0:51:27.62,0:51:30.46,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. Name a card.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:30.54,0:51:32.13,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- King of hearts. - Knew it.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:32.21,0:51:33.42,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:40.64,0:51:43.72,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- It's up your left sleeve. - Is it?
Dialogue: 1,0:51:43.81,0:51:45.56,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No. No,I don't see it up there.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:45.64,0:51:46.85,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You know,why don't you check
Dialogue: 1,0:51:46.85,0:51:49.35,en,,0000,0000,0000,,your unnecessary velveteen pocket there?
Dialogue: 1,0:51:51.19,0:51:52.19,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:55.65,0:51:58.03,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway,thank you so much for coming by,
Dialogue: 1,0:51:58.03,0:52:00.65,en,,0000,0000,0000,,but this is kind of a talent only area,so...
Dialogue: 1,0:52:01.91,0:52:02.91,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Break a leg.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:02.99,0:52:05.16,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey,you break something,too.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:05.24,0:52:06.54,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 1,0:52:06.62,0:52:08.33,en,,0000,0000,0000,,the Savoy management welcomes you
Dialogue: 1,0:52:08.41,0:52:10.08,en,,0000,0000,0000,,to tonight's special performance,
Dialogue: 1,0:52:10.17,0:52:12.92,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The Four Horsemen,Act Two.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:13.00,0:52:15.05,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Unlike traditional performances,
Dialogue: 1,0:52:15.13,0:52:17.30,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The Four Horsemen encourage you to film,
Dialogue: 1,0:52:17.38,0:52:18.38,en,,0000,0000,0000,,call your friends,
Dialogue: 1,0:52:18.47,0:52:21.55,en,,0000,0000,0000,,upload,stream,and tweet the show freely.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:21.63,0:52:25.01,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you. The show will begin in a few minutes.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:28.98,0:52:30.48,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Nice watch.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:31.64,0:52:33.98,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a family heirloom.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:37.19,0:52:39.90,en,,0000,0000,0000,,By the way,I know how he did that trick.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:39.99,0:52:41.57,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Who? - Shrike.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:41.65,0:52:43.91,en,,0000,0000,0000,,So,when he was 14,
Dialogue: 1,0:52:43.99,0:52:46.16,en,,0000,0000,0000,,he saw a hole in a tree in Central Park.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:46.24,0:52:49.91,en,,0000,0000,0000,,He had a guy who worked at the carousel
Dialogue: 1,0:52:50.00,0:52:52.62,en,,0000,0000,0000,,sign a card for what looked like a routine little trick.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:52.71,0:52:53.88,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And?
Dialogue: 1,0:52:53.96,0:52:58.13,en,,0000,0000,0000,,At the guy's retirement,18 years later,
Dialogue: 1,0:52:58.21,0:53:01.47,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Shrike performs,has the guy sign a card,
Dialogue: 1,0:53:01.55,0:53:03.13,en,,0000,0000,0000,,and presto!
Dialogue: 1,0:53:03.22,0:53:04.97,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The card is in the tree.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:05.05,0:53:06.93,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It was in the tree for 18 years.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:07.01,0:53:08.47,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The card was in the tree.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:08.56,0:53:10.56,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The tree grew around the card in 18 years.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:10.56,0:53:12.55,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I mean,that isn't magic. It's not magic.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:12.64,0:53:15.56,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The point is,the trick was not to look closely.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:15.65,0:53:17.65,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It was to look so far
Dialogue: 1,0:53:17.73,0:53:20.53,en,,0000,0000,0000,,that you see 20 years into the past.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:20.61,0:53:23.49,en,,0000,0000,0000,,After Shrike drowned,they never found the body.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:23.57,0:53:25.37,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you suggesting?
Dialogue: 1,0:53:28.99,0:53:31.16,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Arthur Tressler presents
Dialogue: 1,0:53:31.25,0:53:32.41,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Jack Wilder,
Dialogue: 1,0:53:32.50,0:53:33.83,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Henley Reeves,
Dialogue: 1,0:53:33.92,0:53:34.96,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Merritt McKinney,
Dialogue: 1,0:53:35.04,0:53:36.71,en,,0000,0000,0000,,and Daniel Atlas.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:36.79,0:53:38.75,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The Four Horsemen.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:43.93,0:53:45.59,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you. Before we begin,
Dialogue: 1,0:53:45.68,0:53:47.72,en,,0000,0000,0000,,we'd like to single out two people in particular.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:47.80,0:53:48.73,en,,0000,0000,0000,,A man and a woman to
Dialogue: 1,0:53:48.73,0:53:50.26,en,,0000,0000,0000,,whom we'd like to dedicate tonight's performance.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:50.35,0:53:52.18,en,,0000,0000,0000,,FBI Agent Dylan Rhodes
Dialogue: 1,0:53:52.27,0:53:55.40,en,,0000,0000,0000,,and the lovely,if somewhat inexperienced,
Dialogue: 1,0:53:55.40,0:53:57.98,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Interpol Agent Alma Dray,everyone.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:58.90,0:54:03.03,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah,Agent Rhodes has personally vowed to "nail us."
Dialogue: 1,0:54:03.11,0:54:07.62,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And we encourage him to do so if he has the brains and the fur.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:11.87,0:54:14.04,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What is magic?
Dialogue: 1,0:54:14.12,0:54:16.62,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Our argument,nothing but targeted deception.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:18.33,0:54:19.71,en,,0000,0000,0000,,So I want you to look.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:20.30,0:54:22.34,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Look as closely as possible.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:22.76,0:54:24.47,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Because the tricks you are about to see
Dialogue: 1,0:54:25.01,0:54:26.72,en,,0000,0000,0000,,may not seem connected.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:26.80,0:54:28.72,en,,0000,0000,0000,,But we assure you,they are.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:29.68,0:54:32.47,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Is what follows 100 different tricks?
Dialogue: 1,0:54:32.81,0:54:36.48,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Or is it one giant illusion?
Dialogue: 1,0:54:44.11,0:54:47.11,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And now for one of the oldest tricks in the book.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:47.24,0:54:49.37,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Danny,if you wouldn't mind opening up the box,
Dialogue: 1,0:54:49.45,0:54:51.70,en,,0000,0000,0000,,and showing everybody that it's completely empty.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:51.91,0:54:55.91,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Now,we're gonna need 12 courageous volunteers.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:56.12,0:54:58.37,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna take sweet little Fluffy here,
Dialogue: 1,0:54:58.46,0:55:01.29,en,,0000,0000,0000,,and put her inside this mystery box.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:01.71,0:55:03.42,en,,0000,0000,0000,,There are two pencils out there.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:03.51,0:55:04.76,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold 'em up high. Let me see 'em.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:04.84,0:55:06.30,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Here! - Yeah!
Dialogue: 1,0:55:06.76,0:55:08.72,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And now,you will say the magic word.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:08.80,0:55:10.05,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Abracadabra.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:10.14,0:55:11.51,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes,and I will wave this magic wand
Dialogue: 1,0:55:11.60,0:55:13.18,en,,0000,0000,0000,,for no reason. And then...
Dialogue: 1,0:55:13.26,0:55:15.68,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Fluffy has magically vanished before your very eyes.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:17.02,0:55:19.27,en,,0000,0000,0000,,If you haven't experienced mass hypnosis,
Dialogue: 1,0:55:19.35,0:55:20.52,en,,0000,0000,0000,,you're about to.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:20.77,0:55:21.86,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And sleep.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:21.94,0:55:24.78,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Down,down. Sleep,sleep. Completely sleep.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:24.86,0:55:26.44,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Good,good. Sleep,sleep.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:26.53,0:55:28.57,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And now we are gonna debunk
Dialogue: 1,0:55:28.66,0:55:30.78,en,,0000,0000,0000,,a few magic myths this evening.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:30.87,0:55:34.04,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We all know that Fluffy is,in fact,alive and well.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:34.33,0:55:36.87,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And Fluffy has miraculously appeared.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:36.96,0:55:38.46,en,,0000,0000,0000,,As has the mirror
Dialogue: 1,0:55:38.54,0:55:40.96,en,,0000,0000,0000,,which makes the box only appear as though it's empty.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:41.04,0:55:43.13,en,,0000,0000,0000,,When you hear the word "freeze"
Dialogue: 1,0:55:43.34,0:55:45.55,en,,0000,0000,0000,,you are all football players.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:46.05,0:55:48.55,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And your job is to tackle,
Dialogue: 1,0:55:48.72,0:55:50.05,en,,0000,0000,0000,,dismantle,
Dialogue: 1,0:55:50.22,0:55:51.39,en,,0000,0000,0000,,crush,
Dialogue: 1,0:55:51.64,0:55:53.97,en,,0000,0000,0000,,tear limb from limb,
Dialogue: 1,0:55:54.35,0:55:56.06,en,,0000,0000,0000,,the quarterback.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:57.43,0:56:00.94,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Now,we've all heard of pulling the rabbit out of the hat.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:01.02,0:56:04.02,en,,0000,0000,0000,,But has anyone heard of pulling a hat out of a rabbit?
Dialogue: 1,0:56:08.44,0:56:10.91,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You will know who the quarterback is.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:10.99,0:56:15.58,en,,0000,0000,0000,,He will be the one saying that word. Freeze.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:26.38,0:56:28.38,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Three,two,one...
Dialogue: 1,0:56:35.76,0:56:37.72,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Put your hands in the middle. One,two,three...
Dialogue: 1,0:56:37.81,0:56:39.23,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Kill the quarterback!
Dialogue: 1,0:56:39.31,0:56:40.94,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Get on back to your seats.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:41.14,0:56:43.27,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I got a feeling I'm gonna be seeing you soon.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:15.72,0:57:17.35,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess you have lost some weight.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:32.90,0:57:34.07,en,,0000,0000,0000,,At the intermission,
Dialogue: 1,0:57:34.28,0:57:36.62,en,,0000,0000,0000,,we asked you to write down your current bank balance,
Dialogue: 1,0:57:36.82,0:57:38.20,en,,0000,0000,0000,,and seal it in an envelope.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:38.28,0:57:39.91,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Now it's time to take those envelopes out.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:39.99,0:57:41.12,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone take 'em out.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:42.54,0:57:44.04,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Now,everybody,
Dialogue: 1,0:57:44.12,0:57:47.09,en,,0000,0000,0000,,shout out your name. All at once. Go.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:48.80,0:57:50.34,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Shout 'em out.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:52.42,0:57:54.34,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Clement? Frannick?
Dialogue: 1,0:57:54.55,0:57:56.59,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Yeah! Up here! - Oh. Way up there.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:56.68,0:57:58.64,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. Dina? Robertson?
Dialogue: 1,0:57:58.85,0:58:00.22,en,,0000,0000,0000,,That's me!
Dialogue: 1,0:58:00.31,0:58:02.64,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. Names. Names. Let's go.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:04.02,0:58:05.98,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Josepha Hickey?
Dialogue: 1,0:58:06.06,0:58:07.06,en,,0000,0000,0000,,That's me!
Dialogue: 1,0:58:07.15,0:58:10.07,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Josepha,I want you to focus on your balance,
Dialogue: 1,0:58:10.19,0:58:12.15,en,,0000,0000,0000,,and count from one to 10 out loud.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:12.36,0:58:13.99,en,,0000,0000,0000,,One,two,three,four,five...
Dialogue: 1,0:58:14.07,0:58:15.32,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:15.61,0:58:17.37,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Is the first digit 5?
Dialogue: 1,0:58:17.45,0:58:18.41,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:18.49,0:58:19.83,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Do it again. This time,faster.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:19.91,0:58:21.33,en,,0000,0000,0000,,One,two,three,four,five,six...
Dialogue: 1,0:58:21.41,0:58:22.50,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:23.20,0:58:24.71,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Six. Again.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:24.79,0:58:25.79,en,,0000,0000,0000,,One,two...
Dialogue: 1,0:58:26.00,0:58:29.96,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Josepha,is your bank balance $562 as of today?
Dialogue: 1,0:58:30.17,0:58:32.34,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. That's what I got.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:34.09,0:58:35.63,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Unfortunately,you're wrong.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:35.80,0:58:36.84,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay,Dina,
Dialogue: 1,0:58:38.76,0:58:39.80,en,,0000,0000,0000,,1
Dialogue: 1,0:58:40.39,0:58:41.43,en,,0000,0000,0000,,4
Dialogue: 1,0:58:42.14,0:58:43.14,en,,0000,0000,0000,,7
Dialogue: 1,0:58:44.10,0:58:45.73,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- 7. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:45.81,0:58:49.56,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You think it is. But in fact,you,too,are wrong.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:49.65,0:58:50.82,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Clement.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:50.90,0:58:53.86,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You do not have $6,500 in your account.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:54.07,0:58:57.86,en,,0000,0000,0000,,In fact,everybody stand up. Everybody.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:59.87,0:59:02.66,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Put your envelopes to your forehead.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:04.16,0:59:05.62,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Focus on your number.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:09.88,0:59:12.96,en,,0000,0000,0000,,This is... Oh,dear. Just as I feared.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:13.09,0:59:15.26,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh,this is strange.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:15.67,0:59:18.84,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You know,I hate to say this,but you're all wrong.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:19.05,0:59:20.89,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Every last one of you is dead wrong
Dialogue: 1,0:59:20.97,0:59:23.10,en,,0000,0000,0000,,about what you think is in your account.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:23.18,0:59:24.60,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay,you can sit down now.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:25.22,0:59:27.52,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. I almost forgot.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:27.64,0:59:30.52,en,,0000,0000,0000,,This evening would not be possible
Dialogue: 1,0:59:30.61,0:59:34.11,en,,0000,0000,0000,,if it weren't for our great benefactor Arthur Tressler.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:35.65,0:59:37.28,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Big applause! Big applause!
Dialogue: 1,0:59:37.49,0:59:38.82,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Art,actually,why don't you come up on stage
Dialogue: 1,0:59:38.91,0:59:40.07,en,,0000,0000,0000,,for the finale?
Dialogue: 1,0:59:40.16,0:59:41.95,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Come on down,Art! - Come on down,Art!
Dialogue: 1,0:59:42.03,0:59:43.95,en,,0000,0000,0000,,There he goes. Okay,good.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:44.04,0:59:45.08,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Are we on red?
Dialogue: 1,0:59:45.16,0:59:47.21,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Bright red. We're all standing by.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:47.29,0:59:48.75,en,,0000,0000,0000,,All right,no one leaves the theater. No one.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:48.83,0:59:50.00,en,,0000,0000,0000,,There he goes.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:50.63,0:59:52.84,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Now,Art,did you fill out your envelope?
Dialogue: 1,0:59:52.92,0:59:54.75,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Well,no need. We've done it for you.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:55.42,0:59:58.22,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Now,Art,I took a guess.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:58.30,1:00:00.51,en,,0000,0000,0000,,North of 140. Am I right?
Dialogue: 1,1:00:01.64,1:00:04.31,en,,0000,0000,0000,,That's 140 million,by the way.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:07.93,1:00:08.94,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry,Merritt.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:09.10,1:00:11.02,en,,0000,0000,0000,,How can he be right about his balance
Dialogue: 1,1:00:11.10,1:00:12.27,en,,0000,0000,0000,,and everyone else be wrong?
Dialogue: 1,1:00:12.40,1:00:15.78,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I think possibly because he,too,is wrong.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:15.94,1:00:18.07,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Everybody,take out your paper.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:18.24,1:00:20.78,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And using the flashlight under your seat,
Dialogue: 1,1:00:20.95,1:00:22.78,en,,0000,0000,0000,,start to warm up that paper.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:22.95,1:00:26.12,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I think your correct balance begins to appear.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:29.75,1:00:32.96,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Now,Art,don't worry,we have a flashlight for you.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:33.29,1:00:34.34,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:41.09,1:00:42.47,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Look.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:43.30,1:00:44.64,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What's going on there,Daniel?
Dialogue: 1,1:00:44.72,1:00:46.22,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait. This is weird. A second ago,it said
Dialogue: 1,1:00:46.47,1:00:50.23,en,,0000,0000,0000,,$144,579,651.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:50.31,1:00:51.31,en,,0000,0000,0000,,But now...
Dialogue: 1,1:00:51.85,1:00:54.86,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Now it says $70,000 less.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:58.15,1:00:59.61,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Josepha,can you stand up?
Dialogue: 1,1:00:59.69,1:01:00.74,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:00.99,1:01:02.66,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Now,what is your new number?
Dialogue: 1,1:01:02.95,1:01:07.29,en,,0000,0000,0000,,$70,562 now in my account.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:10.41,1:01:13.79,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Is it possible that Josepha's balance went up
Dialogue: 1,1:01:13.92,1:01:16.00,en,,0000,0000,0000,,the exact amount that Art's went down?
Dialogue: 1,1:01:16.13,1:01:18.63,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey. Check it out. It's happening again.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:19.05,1:01:20.09,en,,0000,0000,0000,,IS it?
Dialogue: 1,1:01:21.51,1:01:23.84,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow. It is.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:24.18,1:01:27.35,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Art's balance has gone down another 280K.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:27.51,1:01:29.56,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Dina Robertson? What did yours say?
Dialogue: 1,1:01:29.81,1:01:33.56,en,,0000,0000,0000,,$281,477.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:37.40,1:01:39.07,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We have a confession to make.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:39.28,1:01:41.28,en,,0000,0000,0000,,She's right. We lied about something.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:41.36,1:01:43.03,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. None of you were chosen at random.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:43.15,1:01:45.57,en,,0000,0000,0000,,All of you have one thing in common.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:46.12,1:01:47.99,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone in this room was a victim
Dialogue: 1,1:01:48.08,1:01:50.95,en,,0000,0000,0000,,of the hard times that hit one of America's most treasured cities.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:51.04,1:01:53.62,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Some of you lost your houses,your cars.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:54.08,1:01:55.08,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Your businesses.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:55.25,1:01:56.25,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Your loved ones.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:56.38,1:01:59.55,en,,0000,0000,0000,,But all of you were insured by the same company.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:59.71,1:02:01.59,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Tressler Insurance.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:02.72,1:02:03.88,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You were abandoned.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:03.97,1:02:05.05,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You were loopholed...
Dialogue: 1,1:02:05.13,1:02:06.34,en,,0000,0000,0000,,...out of your settlements.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:07.72,1:02:10.35,en,,0000,0000,0000,,This is all for show. Correct?
Dialogue: 1,1:02:10.43,1:02:12.98,en,,0000,0000,0000,,"All" meaning we're doing it onstage in front of a paying audience?
Dialogue: 1,1:02:13.27,1:02:14.89,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Then,yes,it's for show. - Whoa! Whoa!
Dialogue: 1,1:02:15.19,1:02:17.69,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I've got $82,000 in my bank account!
Dialogue: 1,1:02:17.86,1:02:19.69,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It says it right here on my cell phone!
Dialogue: 1,1:02:19.94,1:02:23.07,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Everybody,look at your cell phones right now! Everybody!
Dialogue: 1,1:02:30.87,1:02:31.87,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Is this for real?
Dialogue: 1,1:02:32.08,1:02:33.25,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:33.54,1:02:34.62,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Is this happening?
Dialogue: 1,1:02:34.79,1:02:36.37,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know! I can't tell!
Dialogue: 1,1:02:37.12,1:02:39.25,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Did you do this?
Dialogue: 1,1:02:40.46,1:02:41.67,en,,0000,0000,0000,,How could we,Art?
Dialogue: 1,1:02:41.75,1:02:42.92,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We don't have your password.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:43.26,1:02:44.55,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We'd need access to information
Dialogue: 1,1:02:44.63,1:02:46.55,en,,0000,0000,0000,,we could never get our hands on.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:46.76,1:02:48.72,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes,security questions,for instance,like,
Dialogue: 1,1:02:48.93,1:02:50.47,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know,your mother's maiden name
Dialogue: 1,1:02:50.60,1:02:52.06,en,,0000,0000,0000,,or the name of your first pet.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:52.14,1:02:53.93,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Where would we get that information,Art?
Dialogue: 1,1:02:54.43,1:02:56.06,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You certainly would never tell us.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:58.85,1:03:00.94,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We got confirmation. It's really happening. They robbed him.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:03.28,1:03:04.74,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Do not let them get away.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:04.82,1:03:06.82,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey,we left you the jet and the Rolls.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:13.79,1:03:15.12,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You got hell to pay!
Dialogue: 1,1:03:18.12,1:03:19.13,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop!
Dialogue: 1,1:03:19.83,1:03:21.63,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop! Nobody move!
Dialogue: 1,1:03:23.59,1:03:24.67,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Freeze!
Dialogue: 1,1:03:24.92,1:03:26.47,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Quarterback!
Dialogue: 1,1:03:29.34,1:03:31.35,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We are The Four Horsemen.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:31.85,1:03:32.93,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Good night.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:45.15,1:03:46.53,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Get 'em off me!
Dialogue: 1,1:03:47.28,1:03:48.86,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Get off! Get off me!
Dialogue: 1,1:03:59.21,1:04:00.58,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Get off me!
Dialogue: 1,1:04:09.01,1:04:11.18,en,,0000,0000,0000,,All right. I want everyone on the street! Everyone!
Dialogue: 1,1:04:17.93,1:04:19.89,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Quarterback! - Quarterback!
Dialogue: 1,1:04:21.35,1:04:22.86,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Fuller,meet me in front of the theater
Dialogue: 1,1:04:22.94,1:04:24.52,en,,0000,0000,0000,,and bring the tracker.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:24.61,1:04:26.98,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go! Let's go! Now! Come on! Let's go!
Dialogue: 1,1:04:27.07,1:04:28.19,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Give me the tracker.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:28.65,1:04:29.65,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:33.78,1:04:35.08,en,,0000,0000,0000,,FBI! Clear!
Dialogue: 1,1:04:35.79,1:04:36.95,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Dylan! - Damn.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:37.04,1:04:38.04,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What have you got?
Dialogue: 1,1:04:38.12,1:04:39.62,en,,0000,0000,0000,,That's him right there. Follow the red dot.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:39.71,1:04:42.75,en,,0000,0000,0000,,All right,I'll take this. Go. Box 'em. Cut 'em off that way.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:44.71,1:04:46.25,en,,0000,0000,0000,,He's turning left on Burgundy.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:22.96,1:05:24.50,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Move!
Dialogue: 1,1:05:24.58,1:05:25.92,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Move! Move!
Dialogue: 1,1:05:28.59,1:05:30.30,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I got him heading north on Bourbon.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:30.38,1:05:32.26,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Sorry. Move,move! - Hey!
Dialogue: 1,1:05:32.34,1:05:34.34,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey,excuse me. Move,move! Excuse me.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:45.81,1:05:47.48,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I've lost him at Bourbon.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:52.86,1:05:54.86,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn! Where are you?
Dialogue: 1,1:06:06.83,1:06:08.04,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:14.13,1:06:16.14,en,,0000,0000,0000,,He's heading south on Exchange Place.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:18.51,1:06:19.56,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop!
Dialogue: 1,1:06:26.56,1:06:27.90,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 1,1:06:31.36,1:06:33.49,en,,0000,0000,0000,,He's going in Napoleon House.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:35.53,1:06:37.07,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Move! Move!
Dialogue: 1,1:06:37.95,1:06:39.49,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Move out of the way!
Dialogue: 1,1:06:40.20,1:06:41.20,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 1,1:06:42.04,1:06:43.04,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Move!
Dialogue: 1,1:06:45.37,1:06:47.63,en,,0000,0000,0000,,He's in the bathroom. I have him in the bathroom.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:47.75,1:06:50.04,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No!No!No!
Dialogue: 1,1:06:51.92,1:06:53.09,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Freeze!
Dialogue: 1,1:06:53.92,1:06:55.22,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Lower your weapons!
Dialogue: 1,1:06:55.47,1:06:56.55,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 1,1:06:56.80,1:06:58.80,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm tracking myself!
Dialogue: 1,1:06:59.30,1:07:01.26,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The Horsemen left egg on the face of what they call
Dialogue: 1,1:07:01.35,1:07:03.02,en,,0000,0000,0000,,the alphabet agencies,
Dialogue: 1,1:07:03.10,1:07:04.27,en,,0000,0000,0000,,calling into question
Dialogue: 1,1:07:04.39,1:07:06.64,en,,0000,0000,0000,,the efficacy of the FBI's task force
Dialogue: 1,1:07:06.77,1:07:09.48,en,,0000,0000,0000,,as well as the man in charge of the investigation,
Dialogue: 1,1:07:09.56,1:07:11.02,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Special Agent Dylan Rhodes,
Dialogue: 1,1:07:11.11,1:07:12.78,en,,0000,0000,0000,,who was publicly ridiculed,
Dialogue: 1,1:07:12.86,1:07:15.74,en,,0000,0000,0000,,and even tackled at tonight's performance.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:16.11,1:07:17.36,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Talk about a fumble.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:17.45,1:07:19.28,en,,0000,0000,0000,,This is quickly becoming a national story,
Dialogue: 1,1:07:19.57,1:07:22.37,en,,0000,0000,0000,,as The Horsemen have now seemingly pulled off the impossible
Dialogue: 1,1:07:22.58,1:07:24.87,en,,0000,0000,0000,,for the second time in as many days.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:25.12,1:07:26.83,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Two nights ago in Vegas,The Horsemen
Dialogue: 1,1:07:26.96,1:07:28.33,en,,0000,0000,0000,,seemingly robbed a bank in Paris...
Dialogue: 1,1:07:28.62,1:07:29.79,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:30.96,1:07:32.09,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 1,1:07:32.17,1:07:33.55,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm having a drink.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:36.63,1:07:38.01,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I came to get you.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:38.59,1:07:39.80,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm worried about you.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:39.97,1:07:41.47,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You're worried about me. Well,I'm worried about you.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:41.60,1:07:42.72,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Atlas. You had him.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:42.81,1:07:44.06,en,,0000,0000,0000,,He didn't have a weapon.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:44.14,1:07:45.64,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I couldn't shoot him and you know that.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:45.77,1:07:48.60,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah,but you... You let him go.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:48.77,1:07:49.98,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't you?
Dialogue: 1,1:07:50.56,1:07:52.23,en,,0000,0000,0000,,A pretty French girl shows up out of the blue,
Dialogue: 1,1:07:52.31,1:07:54.02,en,,0000,0000,0000,,acts like she's my partner and then she lets the bad guy go?
Dialogue: 1,1:07:54.11,1:07:55.23,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Let go of my arm.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:55.32,1:07:56.99,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Who exactly are you anyway?
Dialogue: 1,1:07:59.15,1:08:01.16,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought you said you were a desk agent.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:06.20,1:08:07.45,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:09.37,1:08:10.37,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What is this?
Dialogue: 1,1:08:13.38,1:08:14.84,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What's the Eye of Horus?
Dialogue: 1,1:08:15.00,1:08:18.01,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh,certainly nothing I want to get into tonight.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:18.13,1:08:20.68,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You're dismissive enough about me when you're sober.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:21.18,1:08:23.35,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Find your way back yourself.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:27.35,1:08:30.52,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Mr. Bradley? Mr. Tresslerwould like you to join him for a drink.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:39.95,1:08:40.99,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Sir.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:41.20,1:08:42.45,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:43.82,1:08:46.04,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What is your role with them?
Dialogue: 1,1:08:46.20,1:08:47.20,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Role?
Dialogue: 1,1:08:47.41,1:08:49.12,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. You seem to know everything about them.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:49.20,1:08:51.00,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What they're gonna do. Where they're gonna be.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:51.21,1:08:52.88,en,,0000,0000,0000,,If it makes you feel any better,
Dialogue: 1,1:08:53.00,1:08:54.21,en,,0000,0000,0000,,this wasn't about you.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:54.29,1:08:57.76,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Please tell me why this was not about me.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:58.51,1:09:01.09,en,,0000,0000,0000,,This is a magic trick,Mr. Tressler.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:01.34,1:09:03.68,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Played out on a global scale.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:04.05,1:09:08.02,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You,sir,are the abracadabra.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:08.56,1:09:11.35,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The distraction,while they set up the real trick.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:11.56,1:09:15.73,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I was a $140-million distraction?
Dialogue: 1,1:09:16.57,1:09:17.73,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:18.40,1:09:22.57,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And that very ego that got you involved with them in the first place
Dialogue: 1,1:09:23.03,1:09:24.57,en,,0000,0000,0000,,is what keeps you from seeing that.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:24.70,1:09:26.24,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- You know... - "I can destroy you."
Dialogue: 1,1:09:26.37,1:09:27.74,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes,I do know.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:27.95,1:09:29.24,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Well,you won't.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:29.79,1:09:31.96,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And you won't destroy them.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:32.08,1:09:34.12,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Whatever this grand trick is,
Dialogue: 1,1:09:34.42,1:09:37.21,en,,0000,0000,0000,,it was designed a long time ago.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:37.42,1:09:41.97,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And I believe that what's about to follow is really going to amaze.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:42.80,1:09:47.35,en,,0000,0000,0000,,So I suggest you sit back and enjoy your front row seat.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:47.81,1:09:50.47,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You paid quite a lot of good money for it.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:50.68,1:09:52.73,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Whatever you stand to make
Dialogue: 1,1:09:54.85,1:09:58.40,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll double it,if you expose them now.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:58.61,1:09:59.98,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And destroy them.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:00.40,1:10:02.40,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I stand to make five million.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:03.11,1:10:04.36,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Am I flinching?
Dialogue: 1,1:10:06.49,1:10:08.08,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No,you're not.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:28.86,1:11:29.99,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:31.37,1:11:33.58,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry for your arm.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:33.66,1:11:35.25,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:35.33,1:11:37.58,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I was an asshole. I was drunk.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:39.54,1:11:42.17,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm at a loss.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:44.09,1:11:49.51,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You know,when Merritt said I hardly spent any time away from the desk,he was right.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:49.55,1:11:52.85,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a researcher. That's what I do best.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:53.97,1:11:57.85,en,,0000,0000,0000,,So what's this all about?
Dialogue: 1,1:11:58.56,1:12:01.23,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Supposedly,if you buy into it,
Dialogue: 1,1:12:01.31,1:12:02.69,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The Eye are the keepers
Dialogue: 1,1:12:02.77,1:12:03.94,en,,0000,0000,0000,,of real magic
Dialogue: 1,1:12:04.02,1:12:06.94,en,,0000,0000,0000,,and the protectors of those who practice it.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:07.03,1:12:08.95,en,,0000,0000,0000,,"Candidates for initiations
Dialogue: 1,1:12:09.03,1:12:12.20,en,,0000,0000,0000,,"must follow a series of commands with blind obedience."
Dialogue: 1,1:12:13.20,1:12:16.41,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- This isn't real. - But there are some who think it is.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:16.87,1:12:18.41,en,,0000,0000,0000,,May I?
Dialogue: 1,1:12:20.21,1:12:24.50,en,,0000,0000,0000,,According to this,they only take new people twice a century.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:24.59,1:12:28.00,en,,0000,0000,0000,,So what? The Horsemen are doing these shows in order to get into this thing?
Dialogue: 1,1:12:28.09,1:12:29.30,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- I don't know. - I don't know.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:29.38,1:12:34.39,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I mean,I guess these guys could just rob banks to rob banks.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:34.47,1:12:36.81,en,,0000,0000,0000,,They don't have to put on a show for that.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:36.89,1:12:38.39,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It's probably just a myth.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:38.48,1:12:42.60,en,,0000,0000,0000,,But it doesn't make any sense,and I don't think logic will solve this for us.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:42.69,1:12:45.27,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- You don't say? - No.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:46.53,1:12:51.15,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Ibefieve that some things are only discovered
Dialogue: 1,1:12:51.24,1:12:55.62,en,,0000,0000,0000,,if you take certain leaps.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:02.62,1:13:05.75,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Well,I gotta get to... - Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:05.84,1:13:08.01,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Thanks. Good night. - Yeah. Good night.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:08.09,1:13:09.88,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Sorry. - It's all right.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:12.38,1:13:15.85,en,,0000,0000,0000,,If The Eye did exist,we'd have to assume they were watching us,right?
Dialogue: 1,1:13:15.93,1:13:17.18,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Shit.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:17.26,1:13:19.89,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I think someone is watching us,but it isn't magic.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:19.98,1:13:22.94,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Your fears are correct. This is not and has never been your phone.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:23.02,1:13:27.73,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a clone in every way,except for this.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:27.82,1:13:29.11,en,,0000,0000,0000,,A bug.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:29.19,1:13:33.03,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Someone has heard every call,read every text.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:33.28,1:13:34.49,en,,0000,0000,0000,,That's how they were able to stay ahead of us.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:34.61,1:13:35.45,en,,0000,0000,0000,,God damn it!
Dialogue: 1,1:13:36.78,1:13:38.58,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Get me Atlas' interrogation tape.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:38.91,1:13:40.45,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes,sir. I have it on the hard drive.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:42.29,1:13:43.37,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Picture's up.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:43.83,1:13:45.58,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay,fast forward.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:45.96,1:13:47.42,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Go on,go on. Freeze!
Dialogue: 1,1:13:48.21,1:13:50.01,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. Frame by frame. Go on.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:50.88,1:13:51.92,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Play it through.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:53.05,1:13:55.34,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop. Zoom in tighter. Tighter.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:55.80,1:13:57.60,en,,0000,0000,0000,,There. That's where he took my phone.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:58.89,1:14:00.06,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that thing transmitting?
Dialogue: 1,1:14:00.22,1:14:01.64,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Only when you're making a call or sending a text.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:01.85,1:14:02.81,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Plus I removed the bug.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:02.89,1:14:04.44,en,,0000,0000,0000,,All right. Put it back in and turn on the phone.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:04.69,1:14:06.48,en,,0000,0000,0000,,They don't know that we know about the bug.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:06.69,1:14:08.69,en,,0000,0000,0000,,As of this instant,we are ahead of them.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:08.77,1:14:10.90,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We need to keep it that way. Understand?
Dialogue: 1,1:14:11.32,1:14:12.65,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Find my real phone and track it.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:12.74,1:14:16.07,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Already did. As of about 20 minutes ago,it's in New York City.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:16.28,1:14:17.32,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Good.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:17.70,1:14:19.41,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I wanna cut 'em off at the knees.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:19.49,1:14:20.58,en,,0000,0000,0000,,They got power? Cut it.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:20.79,1:14:24.08,en,,0000,0000,0000,,They got phones,electricity,water? Cut it.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:24.29,1:14:25.33,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Squeeze 'em out.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:25.42,1:14:27.17,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I want 'em to feel our presence.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:27.25,1:14:28.75,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And get me an airplane!
Dialogue: 1,1:14:31.51,1:14:33.34,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The firewall's down. Do they know about this?
Dialogue: 1,1:14:33.42,1:14:34.38,en,,0000,0000,0000,,They who?
Dialogue: 1,1:14:34.47,1:14:36.26,en,,0000,0000,0000,,"They," "them," whoever we're working for.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:36.47,1:14:37.64,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Who are we working for?
Dialogue: 1,1:14:37.76,1:14:39.85,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And are we prepared to go to jail for them?
Dialogue: 1,1:14:39.93,1:14:40.93,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop being paranoid.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:41.14,1:14:42.22,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It really does happen.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:42.43,1:14:44.02,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It happened to you. Doesn't mean it's gonna happen to us.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:44.14,1:14:45.73,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Guys,I don't know if can do this,all right.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:45.81,1:14:47.10,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to go to jail,you know?
Dialogue: 1,1:14:47.19,1:14:48.98,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Then don't screw up. You're always talking about
Dialogue: 1,1:14:49.06,1:14:50.27,en,,0000,0000,0000,,wanting to be treated like an adult.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:50.36,1:14:51.53,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Now might be a good time to start acting like one.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:51.61,1:14:53.78,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Stick to the plan. Stay here and burn it all.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:06.87,1:15:08.08,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know what I'm doing here.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:08.29,1:15:09.25,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know what you would do anywhere else.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:09.33,1:15:11.80,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm here for the pot of gold at the end of the rainbow.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:12.13,1:15:14.26,en,,0000,0000,0000,,That's it. Then I'm gone.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:14.34,1:15:16.51,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You can do whatever you want when this is over,Merritt.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:16.72,1:15:18.84,en,,0000,0000,0000,,But until then,you stick to the plan.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:18.93,1:15:20.97,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey,guys. They're here.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:22.81,1:15:24.81,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- My guys are ready to go. - Let's do this quickly...
Dialogue: 1,1:15:24.89,1:15:26.18,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- No. - What?
Dialogue: 1,1:15:26.27,1:15:27.48,en,,0000,0000,0000,,She doesn't have jurisdiction here.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:27.73,1:15:28.98,en,,0000,0000,0000,,She's Interpol. She's with me.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:29.06,1:15:30.06,en,,0000,0000,0000,,She stays.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:30.15,1:15:31.44,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What? What?
Dialogue: 1,1:15:31.52,1:15:32.52,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Stay in the car.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:34.78,1:15:35.99,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:41.62,1:15:42.66,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. Let's do it.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:47.12,1:15:48.12,en,,0000,0000,0000,,FBI!
Dialogue: 1,1:15:52.38,1:15:53.71,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Ladies first.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:54.30,1:15:55.51,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 1,1:16:01.55,1:16:03.01,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Tell me.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:03.10,1:16:04.85,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Is my money being well-spent?
Dialogue: 1,1:16:05.35,1:16:07.27,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Exceedingly well.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:09.02,1:16:10.52,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Now you tell me,
Dialogue: 1,1:16:11.31,1:16:12.98,en,,0000,0000,0000,,how do you like your Horsemen?
Dialogue: 1,1:16:13.15,1:16:15.19,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Fricasseed or fried?
Dialogue: 1,1:16:15.44,1:16:16.48,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Shredded.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:17.57,1:16:19.03,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll tell the Chef.
Dialogue: 1,1:17:34.60,1:17:35.61,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Freeze!
Dialogue: 1,1:17:42.78,1:17:43.78,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Dylan!
Dialogue: 1,1:17:44.74,1:17:45.91,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 1,1:17:48.24,1:17:49.29,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You little...
Dialogue: 1,1:17:53.79,1:17:54.79,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Come here!
Dialogue: 1,1:17:56.54,1:17:58.46,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Five is clear. Standing by for six.
Dialogue: 1,1:17:58.67,1:18:00.73,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- You little Shit! - You little Shit!
Dialogue: 1,1:18:01.01,1:18:03.22,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- What game are you playing? - What game are you playing?
Dialogue: 1,1:18:03.55,1:18:05.59,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We're all good at six. Move to seven.
Dialogue: 1,1:18:05.68,1:18:07.72,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Copy that. Going to seven. Go,go,go!
Dialogue: 1,1:18:08.39,1:18:10.39,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No,no,no,no,no. Go back!
Dialogue: 1,1:18:10.97,1:18:12.10,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 1,1:18:13.85,1:18:15.06,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Come here!
Dialogue: 1,1:18:46.09,1:18:47.22,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Come here!
Dialogue: 1,1:18:47.30,1:18:49.01,en,,0000,0000,0000,,All right,hold on,hold on!
Dialogue: 1,1:18:50.93,1:18:52.77,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Really? - Yup.
Dialogue: 1,1:18:56.94,1:18:57.94,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You...
Dialogue: 1,1:19:01.78,1:19:03.23,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You little...
Dialogue: 1,1:19:19.29,1:19:20.34,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Shit!
Dialogue: 1,1:19:38.73,1:19:39.77,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Shit!
Dialogue: 1,1:19:41.15,1:19:42.52,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Give me that!
Dialogue: 1,1:20:08.51,1:20:10.47,en,,0000,0000,0000,,All units,cover the north exit now!
Dialogue: 1,1:20:10.55,1:20:11.85,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Clear on Evan.
Dialogue: 1,1:20:11.93,1:20:13.76,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Block every possible exit.
Dialogue: 1,1:20:13.85,1:20:15.35,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Get back. Shit.
Dialogue: 1,1:20:16.85,1:20:18.98,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- FBI. Sort of. I need your car. Thanks. - What?
Dialogue: 1,1:20:19.06,1:20:20.06,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 1,1:20:22.19,1:20:23.82,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 1,1:20:39.96,1:20:41.00,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 1,1:21:10.82,1:21:11.74,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Good. Follow him!
Dialogue: 1,1:21:11.86,1:21:13.91,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't ever tell me to stay in the car. Ever.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:13.99,1:21:15.33,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't have tactical command.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:15.41,1:21:17.79,en,,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't trust me,just tell me.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:17.87,1:21:19.45,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Promise me,next time,you will back me up.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:19.54,1:21:21.58,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Could we have this conversation later,please?
Dialogue: 1,1:21:21.66,1:21:23.25,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 1,1:21:23.33,1:21:25.59,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay,fine,I promise. Now,go!
Dialogue: 1,1:21:33.05,1:21:35.55,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Where'd they go? - Where are they?
Dialogue: 1,1:21:35.64,1:21:37.31,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know. She just took some guy's car.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:37.39,1:21:38.85,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Where are they? - That way. That way.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:38.93,1:21:39.97,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Is that your car? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:40.06,1:21:41.52,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 1,1:22:07.13,1:22:08.13,en,,0000,0000,0000,,There he is!
Dialogue: 1,1:22:20.01,1:22:21.02,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Move!
Dialogue: 1,1:22:25.40,1:22:26.44,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Left!
Dialogue: 1,1:22:28.77,1:22:30.57,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We're heading east on the FDR Drive.
Dialogue: 1,1:22:30.65,1:22:32.49,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- This is not east. - North! North!
Dialogue: 1,1:22:32.57,1:22:34.61,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- We're heading north on the FDR Drive. - What?
Dialogue: 1,1:22:34.70,1:22:36.78,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We're coming to you live above the FDR,
Dialogue: 1,1:22:36.86,1:22:39.78,en,,0000,0000,0000,,where NYPD and federal agents,as you now see,
Dialogue: 1,1:22:39.87,1:22:41.79,en,,0000,0000,0000,,are engaged in a high-speed pursuit,
Dialogue: 1,1:22:41.87,1:22:43.12,en,,0000,0000,0000,,following a black sedan.
Dialogue: 1,1:22:48.29,1:22:49.29,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Fuller,where are you?
Dialogue: 1,1:22:49.54,1:22:51.34,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Right here. Trying to catch up to you now.
Dialogue: 1,1:22:51.42,1:22:53.46,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We're now trying to get you a better shot.
Dialogue: 1,1:22:55.97,1:22:57.05,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on!
Dialogue: 1,1:23:12.82,1:23:13.94,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It looks like they're turning
Dialogue: 1,1:23:14.03,1:23:16.15,en,,0000,0000,0000,,onto the 59th Street Bridge.
Dialogue: 1,1:23:18.20,1:23:19.78,en,,0000,0000,0000,,As soon as we have them within range,
Dialogue: 1,1:23:19.87,1:23:21.70,en,,0000,0000,0000,,we will bring you those pictures live.
Dialogue: 1,1:23:27.21,1:23:28.42,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Good. Just stay with him.
Dialogue: 1,1:23:35.80,1:23:37.05,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Go,go,go!
Dialogue: 1,1:23:41.05,1:23:42.60,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Behind... You're behind the bus!
Dialogue: 1,1:23:46.18,1:23:47.23,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Get over!
Dialogue: 1,1:23:50.81,1:23:51.86,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh,shit!
Dialogue: 1,1:24:15.55,1:24:16.55,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Come here!
Dialogue: 1,1:24:17.80,1:24:19.22,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Get back! Get back!
Dialogue: 1,1:24:20.72,1:24:22.01,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Dylan,let's go,man!
Dialogue: 1,1:24:22.22,1:24:23.22,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on,you...
Dialogue: 1,1:24:24.72,1:24:26.77,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Come on,man! Get out! - He's gonna die in here.
Dialogue: 1,1:24:26.85,1:24:28.23,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Leave him! There's nothing you can do!
Dialogue: 1,1:24:28.31,1:24:30.23,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go! Leave him!
Dialogue: 1,1:24:35.02,1:24:36.40,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- The Paper! - Dylan!
Dialogue: 1,1:24:36.65,1:24:38.57,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go! Let's go! Come on!
Dialogue: 1,1:25:03.76,1:25:08.02,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Today,the unfolding story of a popular and controversial group of magicians,
Dialogue: 1,1:25:08.10,1:25:10.10,en,,0000,0000,0000,,who have been fast capturing the public's imagination,
Dialogue: 1,1:25:10.18,1:25:13.52,en,,0000,0000,0000,,took a dark turn when a police action that began in Chinatown
Dialogue: 1,1:25:13.60,1:25:17.40,en,,0000,0000,0000,,developed into a dramatic,high-speed chase across the 59th Street Bridge,
Dialogue: 1,1:25:17.48,1:25:20.44,en,,0000,0000,0000,,which caused a fatal collision that took the life of Jack Wilder,
Dialogue: 1,1:25:20.53,1:25:22.82,en,,0000,0000,0000,,one of the so-called Four Horsemen.
Dialogue: 1,1:25:24.03,1:25:28.12,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The whereabouts of the other three Horsemen remain unknown at this time.
Dialogue: 1,1:25:33.00,1:25:35.67,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Dylan,they just figured out what the paper was in Jack's car.
Dialogue: 1,1:25:35.75,1:25:37.04,en,,0000,0000,0000,,So they know what it is?
Dialogue: 1,1:25:37.13,1:25:38.84,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And why the kid died trying to protect it.
Dialogue: 1,1:25:38.92,1:25:40.59,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Evans is on his way to brief us right now.
Dialogue: 1,1:25:40.67,1:25:42.22,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 1,1:25:42.30,1:25:43.59,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You're gonna wanna take this first,though.
Dialogue: 1,1:25:43.68,1:25:44.68,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 1,1:25:44.76,1:25:47.05,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Your friend Thaddeus Bradley.
Dialogue: 1,1:25:47.56,1:25:48.81,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Rhodes.
Dialogue: 1,1:25:48.89,1:25:50.52,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You do understand the function
Dialogue: 1,1:25:50.60,1:25:52.73,en,,0000,0000,0000,,of the magician's assistant,don't you,Agent Rhodes?
Dialogue: 1,1:25:53.06,1:25:54.52,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah,she's there to distract them
Dialogue: 1,1:25:54.60,1:25:55.81,en,,0000,0000,0000,,while he sets up the trick.
Dialogue: 1,1:25:57.06,1:25:59.23,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You'd be right if you weren't so wrong.
Dialogue: 1,1:25:59.65,1:26:01.40,en,,0000,0000,0000,,While you're watching the magician,
Dialogue: 1,1:26:02.24,1:26:04.49,en,,0000,0000,0000,,that lovely innocent is actually pulling the strings.
Dialogue: 1,1:26:04.70,1:26:07.83,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you find it peculiar that Interpol would send you
Dialogue: 1,1:26:07.91,1:26:11.37,en,,0000,0000,0000,,a first timer off the desk to be your assistant?
Dialogue: 1,1:26:11.83,1:26:14.00,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Why did she request to be put on the case?
Dialogue: 1,1:26:14.42,1:26:16.33,en,,0000,0000,0000,,She was assigned to the case.
Dialogue: 1,1:26:17.21,1:26:18.59,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Luck of the draw.
Dialogue: 1,1:26:19.17,1:26:22.26,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Like choosing a random card in the deck.
Dialogue: 1,1:26:22.42,1:26:26.01,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I find it odd,your sudden act of generosity.
Dialogue: 1,1:26:26.09,1:26:27.22,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What's in it for you?
Dialogue: 1,1:26:27.39,1:26:29.22,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Just trying to even the game.
Dialogue: 1,1:26:29.43,1:26:33.43,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I feel like I'm playing with somebody wearing ankle weights and flippers.
Dialogue: 1,1:26:34.60,1:26:38.36,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Keep up,Agent Rhodes. Keep up.
Dialogue: 1,1:26:43.57,1:26:44.78,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We got a problem.
Dialogue: 1,1:26:45.95,1:26:47.03,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Here's the safe.
Dialogue: 1,1:26:47.11,1:26:48.57,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No,no,no. Hey.
Dialogue: 1,1:26:48.66,1:26:49.95,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What's he doing here?
Dialogue: 1,1:26:50.12,1:26:51.70,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Giving us our first solid lead.
Dialogue: 1,1:26:51.79,1:26:53.66,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We've been investigating a private security contractor
Dialogue: 1,1:26:53.75,1:26:54.91,en,,0000,0000,0000,,called Elkhorn
Dialogue: 1,1:26:55.00,1:26:56.96,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- for the last five years. - And?
Dialogue: 1,1:26:57.04,1:26:58.71,en,,0000,0000,0000,,They've been hiding close to a half billion dollars...
Dialogue: 1,1:26:58.79,1:27:01.25,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't ask you. I asked him.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:01.63,1:27:03.97,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The money's in a vault inside a warehouse in Queens.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:04.13,1:27:06.63,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We think this vault is your magicians' final target.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:06.80,1:27:08.72,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The magician who died on the bridge...
Dialogue: 1,1:27:08.80,1:27:12.27,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You pulled our classified Elkhorn file right from his crispy little hand.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:12.64,1:27:14.64,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And despite their bullshit Robin Hood razzle-dazzle,
Dialogue: 1,1:27:14.93,1:27:16.81,en,,0000,0000,0000,,your magicians are nothing more than common thieves.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:16.89,1:27:18.10,en,,0000,0000,0000,,How did they get the file?
Dialogue: 1,1:27:19.40,1:27:22.44,en,,0000,0000,0000,,This is the part you're gonna find particularly interesting,Agent Rhodes.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:22.65,1:27:24.94,en,,0000,0000,0000,,They patched to my server after they accessed
Dialogue: 1,1:27:25.03,1:27:27.32,en,,0000,0000,0000,,your mobile command center in New Orleans
Dialogue: 1,1:27:27.41,1:27:28.99,en,,0000,0000,0000,,with codes they got from your phone.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:31.16,1:27:32.99,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You ordered us all out to chase after them.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:33.41,1:27:36.00,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The level of incompetence displayed on this case,
Dialogue: 1,1:27:36.08,1:27:38.58,en,,0000,0000,0000,,that's a magic trick in and of itself.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:38.67,1:27:40.92,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Abracadabra. I'm taking over.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:42.34,1:27:44.26,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Boss,he's taking over?
Dialogue: 1,1:27:44.80,1:27:46.80,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go,gentlemen.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:49.64,1:27:51.10,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey. I want to have a word with you.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:51.18,1:27:52.35,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't ever talk to me like that again.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:52.43,1:27:54.47,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Why the hell did you take this case? - What?
Dialogue: 1,1:27:54.56,1:27:56.73,en,,0000,0000,0000,,People say I'm "hard to read." That's an American expression.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:56.81,1:27:58.23,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you understand it?
Dialogue: 1,1:27:58.31,1:27:59.35,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:59.48,1:28:01.73,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Good,then let me make myself perfectly clear to you.
Dialogue: 1,1:28:01.81,1:28:04.19,en,,0000,0000,0000,,If I find out that you are anything other than
Dialogue: 1,1:28:04.28,1:28:05.57,en,,0000,0000,0000,,who you say you are,I swear...
Dialogue: 1,1:28:05.69,1:28:07.49,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And we French also have an expression.
Dialogue: 1,1:28:09.32,1:28:10.99,en,,0000,0000,0000,,"Faith can move mountains."
Dialogue: 1,1:28:11.07,1:28:12.74,en,,0000,0000,0000,,If we hope to capture The Horsemen,
Dialogue: 1,1:28:12.83,1:28:14.66,en,,0000,0000,0000,,then you need to have a little faith in me.
Dialogue: 1,1:28:14.91,1:28:16.91,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Because I've done nothing to deserve otherwise.
Dialogue: 1,1:28:17.00,1:28:19.75,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I just got my ass handed to me.
Dialogue: 1,1:28:19.83,1:28:21.38,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I am losing this case.
Dialogue: 1,1:28:21.46,1:28:24.80,en,,0000,0000,0000,,So faith is a luxury I don't have any time for right now.
Dialogue: 1,1:28:31.01,1:28:33.22,en,,0000,0000,0000,,More than anything in his life,
Dialogue: 1,1:28:33.30,1:28:38.68,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Jack wanted to be the most famous magician who ever lived.
Dialogue: 1,1:28:38.77,1:28:40.14,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And I can't say he achieved it,
Dialogue: 1,1:28:40.23,1:28:44.19,en,,0000,0000,0000,,but I do hope wherever he is,it is full of magic.
Dialogue: 1,1:28:45.94,1:28:48.28,en,,0000,0000,0000,,But the point is... Sorry.
Dialogue: 1,1:28:48.36,1:28:49.82,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The point is...
Dialogue: 1,1:28:49.90,1:28:56.12,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The point of why we are here is to say that we are not... We cannot quit now.
Dialogue: 1,1:28:56.20,1:28:58.75,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We've started something bigger than all of us.
Dialogue: 1,1:28:58.83,1:29:00.66,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We have to finish it.
Dialogue: 1,1:29:09.72,1:29:10.80,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Approaching the warehouse.
Dialogue: 1,1:29:10.88,1:29:13.39,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Units 5 and 6 cover the north and south entrances.
Dialogue: 1,1:29:13.47,1:29:14.72,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We are going for the vault.
Dialogue: 1,1:29:19.81,1:29:22.73,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey. Where's the safe? Where's the safe?
Dialogue: 1,1:29:26.90,1:29:27.90,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What is this?
Dialogue: 1,1:29:27.98,1:29:29.36,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Where the hell is the goddamn safe?
Dialogue: 1,1:29:29.44,1:29:31.32,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We just moved it while you were outside.
Dialogue: 1,1:29:31.40,1:29:32.57,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Evans' orders. - What?
Dialogue: 1,1:29:32.66,1:29:33.70,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I never said that.
Dialogue: 1,1:29:33.78,1:29:35.12,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Sir,you got a phone call
Dialogue: 1,1:29:35.24,1:29:36.83,en,,0000,0000,0000,,and said Washington wants the safe moved.
Dialogue: 1,1:29:36.91,1:29:38.99,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You never heard that come out of my mouth,Agent.
Dialogue: 1,1:29:39.08,1:29:39.75,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What happened?
Dialogue: 1,1:29:40.29,1:29:42.54,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You tell me what's going on,because this is bullshit!
Dialogue: 1,1:29:42.62,1:29:43.71,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 1,1:29:49.59,1:29:51.09,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 1,1:29:51.30,1:29:54.26,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Sir? Sir? What are you doing?
Dialogue: 1,1:29:54.34,1:29:56.22,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I think it's Beethoven's Concerto in D-Major.
Dialogue: 1,1:29:56.30,1:29:57.30,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Where's the safe?
Dialogue: 1,1:29:57.39,1:29:58.47,en,,0000,0000,0000,,His team is loading the truck.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:02.77,1:30:04.44,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Hey! Hey! - Hey!
Dialogue: 1,1:30:05.98,1:30:07.15,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Stop the truck! - Stop!
Dialogue: 1,1:30:08.15,1:30:10.32,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Stop! - Hey! Stop that truck!
Dialogue: 1,1:30:18.95,1:30:20.83,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell's going on? We got our orders.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:20.91,1:30:22.66,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Now you've got new orders. Open it up.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:26.63,1:30:28.42,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. Here's what I want.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:28.50,1:30:30.75,en,,0000,0000,0000,,At this moment,they think that safe's leaving this site.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:31.01,1:30:32.13,en,,0000,0000,0000,,So we stay with it.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:32.21,1:30:34.13,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We follow it all the way to... Where's it going?
Dialogue: 1,1:30:34.38,1:30:35.47,en,,0000,0000,0000,,5 Pointz. Up the street.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:35.93,1:30:38.80,en,,0000,0000,0000,,So we go to 5 Pointz. Wherever the safe goes,we go.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:39.01,1:30:40.10,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It'll lead us right to 'em.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:41.02,1:30:42.18,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You two are with me.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:54.82,1:30:56.07,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Guys.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:57.03,1:30:59.53,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Look. Office just called with this.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:59.62,1:31:01.49,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Horsemen posted it to YouTube 20 minutes ago.
Dialogue: 1,1:31:01.87,1:31:05.46,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The point of why we're here is to say that we are not...
Dialogue: 1,1:31:05.71,1:31:07.54,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We cannot quit now.
Dialogue: 1,1:31:07.71,1:31:10.21,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We've started something bigger than all of us.
Dialogue: 1,1:31:10.38,1:31:11.96,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We have to finish it.
Dialogue: 1,1:31:12.05,1:31:14.59,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Remember the name Jack Wilder when you see us live,
Dialogue: 1,1:31:14.67,1:31:16.55,en,,0000,0000,0000,,5 Pointz,Queens,7:00.
Dialogue: 1,1:31:16.80,1:31:17.89,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Their show is in a half an hour.
Dialogue: 1,1:31:17.97,1:31:19.22,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It's exactly where we're headed.
Dialogue: 1,1:31:19.39,1:31:21.51,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know,boss. I don't wanna be the naysayer,
Dialogue: 1,1:31:21.72,1:31:23.68,en,,0000,0000,0000,,but these guys are kinda tricky.
Dialogue: 1,1:31:23.77,1:31:26.39,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Rhodes,they're entertainers.
Dialogue: 1,1:31:28.90,1:31:31.07,en,,0000,0000,0000,,A stunning turnout here in 5 Pointz
Dialogue: 1,1:31:31.15,1:31:34.99,en,,0000,0000,0000,,as the renegade Horsemen taunt the FBI into a final showdown.
Dialogue: 1,1:31:35.07,1:31:36.49,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The Horsemen have invited us to their final round
Dialogue: 1,1:31:36.57,1:31:38.74,en,,0000,0000,0000,,of their three-act face-off with the FBI.
Dialogue: 1,1:31:39.24,1:31:42.58,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What do they have in store? We're about to find out.
Dialogue: 1,1:31:53.92,1:31:56.17,en,,0000,0000,0000,,All eyes on the truck. Let's see who approaches.
Dialogue: 1,1:31:56.26,1:31:57.59,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Copy that.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:13.77,1:32:15.61,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Agents Rhodes,Fuller?
Dialogue: 1,1:32:16.28,1:32:17.28,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Go,for us.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:17.44,1:32:20.07,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We've got movement. Someone's walking toward the truck.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:20.20,1:32:21.66,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a woman.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:25.41,1:32:26.58,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Freeze! - Oh,shit!
Dialogue: 1,1:32:28.37,1:32:29.87,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 1,1:32:30.96,1:32:33.29,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! It's the guy from the TV.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:33.38,1:32:34.42,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Put your guns down.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:34.63,1:32:37.46,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Look who it is. The fifth Horseman.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:37.63,1:32:38.63,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 1,1:32:38.72,1:32:40.55,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm following them,just like you are.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:40.63,1:32:42.22,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not following anybody anymore.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:42.30,1:32:44.05,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You've been ahead of us this whole time.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:44.14,1:32:45.76,en,,0000,0000,0000,,But guess what? I'm ahead of you now.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:45.97,1:32:47.60,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Your ass is mine.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:47.81,1:32:49.56,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You guys are still idiots.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:49.77,1:32:50.81,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 1,1:32:50.89,1:32:51.98,en,,0000,0000,0000,,This happens to be the former
Dialogue: 1,1:32:52.10,1:32:54.15,en,,0000,0000,0000,,rehearsal space for Lionel Shrike.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:54.61,1:32:56.44,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It's where I did my first show.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:56.65,1:32:59.45,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Now,if you wanna look like even bigger idiots,
Dialogue: 1,1:32:59.65,1:33:00.90,en,,0000,0000,0000,,why not open it?
Dialogue: 1,1:33:01.28,1:33:02.91,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And while you're doing it,Agent Rhodes,
Dialogue: 1,1:33:03.20,1:33:04.83,en,,0000,0000,0000,,would you mind reenacting your look
Dialogue: 1,1:33:05.03,1:33:06.95,en,,0000,0000,0000,,of absolute befuddlement for me?
Dialogue: 1,1:33:07.12,1:33:09.20,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It will make a wonderful cover for my DVD.
Dialogue: 1,1:33:10.54,1:33:11.79,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Open the safe.
Dialogue: 1,1:33:11.87,1:33:13.38,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Go ahead. - Open it.
Dialogue: 1,1:33:17.71,1:33:18.76,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 1,1:33:21.18,1:33:22.26,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 1,1:33:22.51,1:33:23.59,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Give me that.
Dialogue: 1,1:33:23.80,1:33:24.85,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 1,1:33:25.01,1:33:26.01,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 1,1:33:30.64,1:33:31.69,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What is this?
Dialogue: 1,1:33:32.81,1:33:33.81,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Get back!
Dialogue: 1,1:33:41.40,1:33:43.53,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Who doesn't love a good magic trick?
Dialogue: 1,1:33:44.20,1:33:46.53,en,,0000,0000,0000,,They have you chasing empty safes again.
Dialogue: 1,1:33:47.87,1:33:51.04,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Once again,misdirection.
Dialogue: 1,1:33:58.00,1:33:59.63,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The show is starting. Move out!
Dialogue: 1,1:33:59.71,1:34:02.22,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The question I'd be asking now,Agent Rhodes is,
Dialogue: 1,1:34:02.72,1:34:04.84,en,,0000,0000,0000,,"What happened to the real one?"
Dialogue: 1,1:34:25.49,1:34:27.24,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Clear! Clear 'em out!
Dialogue: 1,1:34:27.32,1:34:28.91,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on. Move 'em out. Move 'em out of the way.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:30.33,1:34:32.20,en,,0000,0000,0000,,FBI! Give me a path!
Dialogue: 1,1:34:32.83,1:34:34.42,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Clear out! Clear out!
Dialogue: 1,1:34:34.67,1:34:36.04,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What is magic?
Dialogue: 1,1:34:36.88,1:34:37.92,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Magic is deception.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:38.04,1:34:39.75,en,,0000,0000,0000,,But deception designed to delight,
Dialogue: 1,1:34:40.00,1:34:41.67,en,,0000,0000,0000,,to entertain,to inspire.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:41.88,1:34:44.22,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Look out! Clear! Clear! Look out!
Dialogue: 1,1:34:44.59,1:34:45.68,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It is about belief.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:45.76,1:34:46.76,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Faith.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:46.89,1:34:47.89,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Trust.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:51.89,1:34:53.27,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Without those qualities,
Dialogue: 1,1:34:53.35,1:34:56.77,en,,0000,0000,0000,,magic,as an art form,would no longer exist.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:57.35,1:34:59.19,en,,0000,0000,0000,,But what happens if these qualities
Dialogue: 1,1:34:59.40,1:35:01.36,en,,0000,0000,0000,,are not used for their higher purpose?
Dialogue: 1,1:35:01.57,1:35:04.36,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And instead they're used to cheat,lie.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:04.57,1:35:06.78,en,,0000,0000,0000,,For personal gain or for greed.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:06.95,1:35:08.62,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Then it's no longer magic.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:08.78,1:35:09.87,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It's crime.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:10.08,1:35:13.08,en,,0000,0000,0000,,So tonight,for our final act,
Dialogue: 1,1:35:13.16,1:35:16.00,en,,0000,0000,0000,,you're gonna help us set a few things right.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:20.13,1:35:21.30,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What's going on here,Rhodes?
Dialogue: 1,1:35:21.55,1:35:22.71,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:23.80,1:35:24.97,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Showtime.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:30.14,1:35:31.14,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Look!
Dialogue: 1,1:35:35.48,1:35:37.39,en,,0000,0000,0000,,There they are on the roof. Let's move!
Dialogue: 1,1:35:37.48,1:35:38.77,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Go,go,go!
Dialogue: 1,1:35:39.48,1:35:40.81,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Dylan! - FBI,coming through!
Dialogue: 1,1:35:42.40,1:35:43.44,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 1,1:35:43.57,1:35:44.65,en,,0000,0000,0000,,They're going in the wrong direction
Dialogue: 1,1:35:44.78,1:35:45.82,en,,0000,0000,0000,,and you know it.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:46.11,1:35:48.45,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Rhodes! I need all personnel now!
Dialogue: 1,1:35:48.57,1:35:51.91,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You need to trust me. Take your leap of faith.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:52.74,1:35:53.83,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:54.12,1:35:55.29,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to go with her.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:55.45,1:35:56.71,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Go. I got your back. I'll be right here.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:58.54,1:35:59.58,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Go ahead!
Dialogue: 1,1:35:59.67,1:36:01.17,en,,0000,0000,0000,,That's on you,Fuller.
Dialogue: 1,1:36:16.56,1:36:20.60,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go,let's go! Now,now,now!
Dialogue: 1,1:36:31.70,1:36:32.78,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Daniel?
Dialogue: 1,1:36:34.91,1:36:39.54,en,,0000,0000,0000,,As our,let's call it,year of living dangerously
Dialogue: 1,1:36:39.75,1:36:43.09,en,,0000,0000,0000,,comes to a close,in a rare moment of vulnerability,
Dialogue: 1,1:36:43.29,1:36:45.96,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'd like to express a sentiment
Dialogue: 1,1:36:46.05,1:36:47.63,en,,0000,0000,0000,,to you about our relationship.
Dialogue: 1,1:36:47.88,1:36:48.92,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 1,1:36:49.30,1:36:52.80,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Well,when I first met you,I thought you were kind of a
Dialogue: 1,1:36:54.64,1:36:55.64,en,,0000,0000,0000,,dick.
Dialogue: 1,1:36:57.14,1:36:58.18,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And?
Dialogue: 1,1:36:59.98,1:37:01.65,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No,that's it.
Dialogue: 1,1:37:01.90,1:37:02.90,en,,0000,0000,0000,,That's very nice.
Dialogue: 1,1:37:02.98,1:37:04.48,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Yeah. - I'm touched.
Dialogue: 1,1:37:04.65,1:37:06.11,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Just from the heart.
Dialogue: 1,1:37:06.32,1:37:07.90,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Well,I didn't tell you where I was touched.
Dialogue: 1,1:37:12.66,1:37:14.32,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh,God. What are we gonna do when this is over?
Dialogue: 1,1:37:14.58,1:37:15.66,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We're on our own.
Dialogue: 1,1:37:15.74,1:37:17.41,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Our instructions run out after the show.
Dialogue: 1,1:37:18.33,1:37:20.21,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if there is no "Eye",
Dialogue: 1,1:37:20.29,1:37:22.00,en,,0000,0000,0000,,if we were completely played and we spend
Dialogue: 1,1:37:22.12,1:37:24.13,en,,0000,0000,0000,,the next 20 years in jail,then,
Dialogue: 1,1:37:24.67,1:37:26.34,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I just want to say that...
Dialogue: 1,1:37:26.59,1:37:28.96,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I know. Me,too.
Dialogue: 1,1:37:30.30,1:37:32.22,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Little too sentimental for me.
Dialogue: 1,1:37:39.18,1:37:40.27,en,,0000,0000,0000,,There they are!
Dialogue: 1,1:37:43.27,1:37:46.02,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Go grab 'em! Put 'em down! Go,go,go!
Dialogue: 1,1:37:46.15,1:37:47.15,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Grab 'em!
Dialogue: 1,1:37:52.15,1:37:53.20,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Get up!
Dialogue: 1,1:37:53.66,1:37:54.82,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 1,1:37:58.62,1:37:59.79,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Shit!
Dialogue: 1,1:38:09.00,1:38:10.26,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello,New York!
Dialogue: 1,1:38:18.72,1:38:20.68,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for the magic.
Dialogue: 1,1:38:20.89,1:38:21.98,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And thank you for being such
Dialogue: 1,1:38:22.06,1:38:25.06,en,,0000,0000,0000,,an incredible and dedicated audience.
Dialogue: 1,1:38:25.48,1:38:27.48,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Unfortunately,like all good things,
Dialogue: 1,1:38:27.56,1:38:29.36,en,,0000,0000,0000,,it must come to an end.
Dialogue: 1,1:38:32.07,1:38:34.57,en,,0000,0000,0000,,So we would like to start our show tonight...
Dialogue: 1,1:38:34.66,1:38:36.20,en,,0000,0000,0000,,By saying goodbye.
Dialogue: 1,1:38:37.57,1:38:38.91,en,,0000,0000,0000,,All we wanted was to
Dialogue: 1,1:38:38.99,1:38:40.95,en,,0000,0000,0000,,bring the world to a magic show.
Dialogue: 1,1:38:41.04,1:38:42.50,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And thereby bring a little magic
Dialogue: 1,1:38:42.58,1:38:43.75,en,,0000,0000,0000,,back to the world.
Dialogue: 1,1:38:47.75,1:38:48.92,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Clear the way!
Dialogue: 1,1:38:58.68,1:39:01.89,en,,0000,0000,0000,,This has been one hell of a ride for all of us.
Dialogue: 1,1:39:02.43,1:39:04.77,en,,0000,0000,0000,,But it's time for us to disappear.
Dialogue: 1,1:39:04.94,1:39:06.27,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Good night,New York.
Dialogue: 1,1:39:06.52,1:39:07.94,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And thank you for believing in us.
Dialogue: 1,1:39:10.61,1:39:11.73,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop!
Dialogue: 1,1:39:15.24,1:39:16.24,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Freeze!
Dialogue: 1,1:39:16.66,1:39:17.82,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 1,1:39:35.92,1:39:37.22,en,,0000,0000,0000,,God damn it!
Dialogue: 1,1:40:05.83,1:40:07.04,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 1,1:40:07.71,1:40:09.71,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You were right. It's bigger than all of us.
Dialogue: 1,1:40:10.67,1:40:14.76,en,,0000,0000,0000,,This is one time I'm not happy being right.
Dialogue: 1,1:40:17.09,1:40:18.72,en,,0000,0000,0000,,So I guess this is it.
Dialogue: 1,1:40:20.76,1:40:21.93,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Is it?
Dialogue: 1,1:40:48.04,1:40:49.33,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Dylan!
Dialogue: 1,1:40:49.71,1:40:52.17,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Dylan! Dylan!
Dialogue: 1,1:40:54.63,1:40:56.59,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- You see that? - What?
Dialogue: 1,1:41:00.22,1:41:01.59,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Where's the real money?
Dialogue: 1,1:41:17.82,1:41:21.78,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You're under arrest! Hands in the air! Now!
Dialogue: 1,1:42:13.00,1:42:14.12,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I've been framed.
Dialogue: 1,1:42:15.46,1:42:16.50,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure you were.
Dialogue: 1,1:42:16.59,1:42:17.88,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah,but I can prove it.
Dialogue: 1,1:42:18.38,1:42:19.63,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I always do.
Dialogue: 1,1:42:20.01,1:42:21.97,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Just like I predicted that you'd play the fool.
Dialogue: 1,1:42:22.05,1:42:24.55,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's just drop the theatricality,all right?
Dialogue: 1,1:42:24.80,1:42:26.97,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The cameras aren't rolling in here.
Dialogue: 1,1:42:27.18,1:42:29.68,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Fellas,can I have a few minutes with my friend here alone,please.
Dialogue: 1,1:42:29.76,1:42:31.60,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 1,1:42:36.56,1:42:37.61,en,,0000,0000,0000,,All right.
Dialogue: 1,1:42:38.65,1:42:40.28,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I got information to trade.
Dialogue: 1,1:42:40.40,1:42:41.57,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I believe that's how it's done. Huh?
Dialogue: 1,1:42:41.78,1:42:43.40,en,,0000,0000,0000,,If it's of some value.
Dialogue: 1,1:42:45.86,1:42:49.03,en,,0000,0000,0000,,These bars give a man time to think.
Dialogue: 1,1:42:50.24,1:42:53.50,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And I'm pretty sure I know how they did it.
Dialogue: 1,1:42:53.96,1:42:56.08,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Remember the rabbit trick in the second show?
Dialogue: 1,1:42:57.25,1:42:59.09,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The box was never empty.
Dialogue: 1,1:43:01.42,1:43:02.59,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The room wasn't either.
Dialogue: 1,1:43:03.88,1:43:06.26,en,,0000,0000,0000,,After gaining access to the warehouse,
Dialogue: 1,1:43:06.59,1:43:08.68,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The Horsemen left the real safe
Dialogue: 1,1:43:08.76,1:43:11.18,en,,0000,0000,0000,,and transformed the whole room
Dialogue: 1,1:43:11.26,1:43:13.77,en,,0000,0000,0000,,into a giant rabbit box.
Dialogue: 1,1:43:15.35,1:43:17.52,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You go charging in there,
Dialogue: 1,1:43:17.77,1:43:20.19,en,,0000,0000,0000,,thinking the safe was already gone.
Dialogue: 1,1:43:20.44,1:43:21.40,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 1,1:43:21.48,1:43:22.78,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Stop!
Dialogue: 1,1:43:22.98,1:43:24.40,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Missing the trick. Again.
Dialogue: 1,1:43:24.49,1:43:25.53,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Which was to make you think
Dialogue: 1,1:43:25.78,1:43:27.32,en,,0000,0000,0000,,the safe had already been stolen,
Dialogue: 1,1:43:27.41,1:43:29.62,en,,0000,0000,0000,,so you'd drop your guard and leave.
Dialogue: 1,1:43:30.20,1:43:33.16,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Now,while you were busy playing with balloon animals,
Dialogue: 1,1:43:33.37,1:43:35.96,en,,0000,0000,0000,,someone was breaking into the warehouse.
Dialogue: 1,1:43:54.47,1:43:55.64,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Who?
Dialogue: 1,1:43:57.06,1:43:58.56,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Jack Wilder.
Dialogue: 1,1:43:59.31,1:44:00.65,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Holy shit.
Dialogue: 1,1:44:00.86,1:44:03.23,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No. No way. He died right in front of my eyes.
Dialogue: 1,1:44:04.03,1:44:06.15,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Unless,of course,he didn't.
Dialogue: 1,1:44:13.49,1:44:14.74,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It's locked.
Dialogue: 1,1:44:15.54,1:44:16.75,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Weren't you listening?
Dialogue: 1,1:44:17.25,1:44:18.33,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing's ever locked.
Dialogue: 1,1:44:19.71,1:44:22.50,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Well done,Mr. Wilder! Good work.
Dialogue: 1,1:44:22.67,1:44:24.50,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You're a big boy now,Jack.
Dialogue: 1,1:44:24.67,1:44:27.05,en,,0000,0000,0000,,He escaped in a standard FBI vehicle,right?
Dialogue: 1,1:44:30.84,1:44:32.18,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Led you to the bridge.
Dialogue: 1,1:44:32.43,1:44:34.06,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Where the other Horsemen were waiting
Dialogue: 1,1:44:34.18,1:44:36.06,en,,0000,0000,0000,,with an identical replacement car.
Dialogue: 1,1:44:37.06,1:44:38.06,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It only took a split second
Dialogue: 1,1:44:38.18,1:44:39.14,en,,0000,0000,0000,,for you to lose contact with it
Dialogue: 1,1:44:39.23,1:44:40.23,en,,0000,0000,0000,,and make the switch.
Dialogue: 1,1:45:02.54,1:45:05.55,en,,0000,0000,0000,,When you crawled into that burning car,
Dialogue: 1,1:45:05.92,1:45:07.92,en,,0000,0000,0000,,quite heroically,I might add,
Dialogue: 1,1:45:09.80,1:45:11.89,en,,0000,0000,0000,,you almost died trying to rescue
Dialogue: 1,1:45:11.97,1:45:14.97,en,,0000,0000,0000,,what I assume was a cadaver from the morgue.
Dialogue: 1,1:45:16.47,1:45:20.14,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Why go through such an elaborate and dangerous plan
Dialogue: 1,1:45:20.89,1:45:22.40,en,,0000,0000,0000,,just to frame one guy?
Dialogue: 1,1:45:22.73,1:45:23.77,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 1,1:45:23.90,1:45:25.32,en,,0000,0000,0000,,They never kept any of the money they took.
Dialogue: 1,1:45:25.40,1:45:27.82,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah,that's the part I haven't been able to put together yet.
Dialogue: 1,1:45:27.90,1:45:30.61,en,,0000,0000,0000,,But I just gave you information that is substantially more important.
Dialogue: 1,1:45:30.74,1:45:32.45,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- No. Not really. - What?
Dialogue: 1,1:45:32.53,1:45:37.08,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I finally got a chance to really look into Lionel Shrike.
Dialogue: 1,1:45:37.37,1:45:40.12,en,,0000,0000,0000,,His comeback attempt. His accident.
Dialogue: 1,1:45:41.08,1:45:44.58,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The insurer who denied the family's claim?
Dialogue: 1,1:45:44.79,1:45:46.00,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Tressler Insurance.
Dialogue: 1,1:45:47.92,1:45:50.17,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The bank that carried the note?
Dialogue: 1,1:45:51.26,1:45:52.93,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Credit Republican of Paris.
Dialogue: 1,1:45:53.13,1:45:54.76,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Credit Republicain de Paris.
Dialogue: 1,1:45:56.10,1:45:57.51,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you make of that?
Dialogue: 1,1:45:57.60,1:45:59.77,en,,0000,0000,0000,,A sucker is born every minute.
Dialogue: 1,1:46:00.52,1:46:03.10,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What if all this was just leading up to
Dialogue: 1,1:46:03.19,1:46:05.90,en,,0000,0000,0000,,us getting mugged in Central Park at 2:00 a.m.?
Dialogue: 1,1:46:05.98,1:46:08.69,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No,I'm telling you,we're right where we need to be.
Dialogue: 1,1:46:08.78,1:46:09.86,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We just have to find...
Dialogue: 1,1:46:09.94,1:46:11.07,en,,0000,0000,0000,,That?
Dialogue: 1,1:46:13.61,1:46:15.32,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The Lionel Shrike tree.
Dialogue: 1,1:46:16.28,1:46:18.79,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And the card encased in glass.
Dialogue: 1,1:46:20.12,1:46:21.75,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What do we do now?
Dialogue: 1,1:46:38.39,1:46:39.85,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh,nice!
Dialogue: 1,1:46:55.70,1:46:57.16,en,,0000,0000,0000,,So,here's my new theory.
Dialogue: 1,1:46:57.66,1:47:01.08,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The legend is that the "Eye" is everywhere.
Dialogue: 1,1:47:01.74,1:47:02.91,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Waiting
Dialogue: 1,1:47:03.33,1:47:07.08,en,,0000,0000,0000,,for the truly great magicians to distinguish themselves
Dialogue: 1,1:47:08.04,1:47:09.84,en,,0000,0000,0000,,from the mediocre ones.
Dialogue: 1,1:47:10.67,1:47:11.88,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe that was you.
Dialogue: 1,1:47:12.51,1:47:14.76,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Deep down inside you wanted nothing more
Dialogue: 1,1:47:14.84,1:47:17.47,en,,0000,0000,0000,,than to be part of the "Eye," but you were never invited.
Dialogue: 1,1:47:17.55,1:47:20.72,en,,0000,0000,0000,,So you try to destroy them. But instead what happens?
Dialogue: 1,1:47:21.18,1:47:22.68,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You pissed them off.
Dialogue: 1,1:47:24.39,1:47:27.44,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The Eye isn't real.
Dialogue: 1,1:47:27.52,1:47:30.61,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay,then,explain then. Who's behind all this?
Dialogue: 1,1:47:30.86,1:47:32.19,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Somebody with an obsession.
Dialogue: 1,1:47:32.44,1:47:33.86,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Meticulous. - Who?
Dialogue: 1,1:47:33.94,1:47:37.28,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Somebody prepared to sacrifice everything.
Dialogue: 1,1:47:37.36,1:47:39.95,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Somebody so prepared to lose
Dialogue: 1,1:47:40.03,1:47:42.54,en,,0000,0000,0000,,that they wouldn't even be a suspect until the trick was done.
Dialogue: 1,1:47:42.62,1:47:45.46,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want a profile. I need a name. Who? Who?
Dialogue: 1,1:47:45.54,1:47:47.21,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know who.
Dialogue: 1,1:47:47.58,1:47:49.79,en,,0000,0000,0000,,But they had to have access to the warehouse
Dialogue: 1,1:47:49.88,1:47:51.21,en,,0000,0000,0000,,to plant the mirrors.
Dialogue: 1,1:47:52.55,1:47:56.38,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Always a step ahead of me. And the FBI.
Dialogue: 1,1:47:56.47,1:47:59.72,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Got past them not once,not twice,but consistently.
Dialogue: 1,1:48:00.05,1:48:02.68,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Almost as if they were on the...
Dialogue: 1,1:48:15.57,1:48:16.95,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The inside.
Dialogue: 1,1:48:29.08,1:48:30.12,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You.
Dialogue: 1,1:48:34.75,1:48:35.76,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 1,1:48:36.59,1:48:38.93,en,,0000,0000,0000,,That is the question,isn't it?
Dialogue: 1,1:48:39.76,1:48:41.30,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You're right.
Dialogue: 1,1:48:41.93,1:48:44.26,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't tell you how long I've waited
Dialogue: 1,1:48:44.35,1:48:46.31,en,,0000,0000,0000,,to see the look on your face.
Dialogue: 1,1:48:48.77,1:48:50.27,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 1,1:48:51.35,1:48:52.77,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you want from me?
Dialogue: 1,1:48:53.61,1:48:55.11,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What do I want?
Dialogue: 1,1:48:55.53,1:48:58.44,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I want you to spend the rest of your life in this cell,
Dialogue: 1,1:48:58.53,1:49:02.53,en,,0000,0000,0000,,staring at four walls and wondering how you missed it.
Dialogue: 1,1:49:03.20,1:49:06.29,en,,0000,0000,0000,,How you let yourself be so blinded by your ego
Dialogue: 1,1:49:06.87,1:49:09.29,en,,0000,0000,0000,,that you convinced yourself that you were one step ahead
Dialogue: 1,1:49:09.37,1:49:12.13,en,,0000,0000,0000,,when you were always two steps behind.
Dialogue: 1,1:49:16.80,1:49:18.01,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Dylan?
Dialogue: 1,1:49:18.97,1:49:19.97,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 1,1:49:21.01,1:49:23.14,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Dylan! How did this happen?
Dialogue: 1,1:49:30.81,1:49:32.48,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Dylan!
Dialogue: 1,1:49:32.60,1:49:33.60,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 1,1:49:34.31,1:49:35.32,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 1,1:49:39.32,1:49:41.49,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh,my God.
Dialogue: 1,1:49:42.49,1:49:44.37,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I did not see that coming.
Dialogue: 1,1:49:44.49,1:49:45.74,en,,0000,0000,0000,,That's impossible!
Dialogue: 1,1:49:45.83,1:49:46.83,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No way.
Dialogue: 1,1:49:46.91,1:49:49.33,en,,0000,0000,0000,,That was actually pretty good.
Dialogue: 1,1:49:49.75,1:49:50.83,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,1:49:51.25,1:49:53.46,en,,0000,0000,0000,,When I said,"Always be the smartest guy in the room."
Dialogue: 1,1:49:53.54,1:49:54.58,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We were in agreement.
Dialogue: 1,1:49:54.83,1:49:56.00,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. Right.
Dialogue: 1,1:49:56.38,1:49:57.38,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Henley.
Dialogue: 1,1:49:58.17,1:50:00.01,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I've never seen her speechless.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:00.09,1:50:01.67,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I take that as a huge compliment.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:02.38,1:50:05.05,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey,man,I'm so sorry for kicking your ass. Really.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:05.85,1:50:07.35,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey,listen,for the record,
Dialogue: 1,1:50:07.51,1:50:11.02,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I have always been a 100% believer.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:11.18,1:50:13.44,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And the amount of energy I have expended to keep
Dialogue: 1,1:50:13.52,1:50:15.65,en,,0000,0000,0000,,these infidels on point...
Dialogue: 1,1:50:15.73,1:50:17.77,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Merritt,you're in.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:18.61,1:50:19.69,en,,0000,0000,0000,,God bless.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:19.78,1:50:20.82,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Come.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:21.86,1:50:25.03,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The real magic is taking four strong solo acts
Dialogue: 1,1:50:25.24,1:50:27.12,en,,0000,0000,0000,,and making them all work together.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:27.37,1:50:29.66,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And that's exactly what you did.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:30.62,1:50:31.70,en,,0000,0000,0000,,So welcome.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:35.04,1:50:37.09,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome to the Eye.
Dialogue: 1,1:51:44.28,1:51:46.36,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It was all connected.
Dialogue: 1,1:51:46.99,1:51:49.99,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Credit Republican. Tressler Insurance.
Dialogue: 1,1:51:52.44,1:51:52.63,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Bonjour
Dialogue: 1,1:51:55.07,1:51:55.34,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Bonjour
Dialogue: 1,1:51:59.38,1:52:00.67,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And Elkhorn?
Dialogue: 1,1:52:00.79,1:52:02.71,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What's the connection to Shrike?
Dialogue: 1,1:52:05.21,1:52:08.43,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Elkhorn started as a safe manufacturer.
Dialogue: 1,1:52:08.76,1:52:10.89,en,,0000,0000,0000,,They used cheap steel.
Dialogue: 1,1:52:12.47,1:52:13.76,en,,0000,0000,0000,,They cut corners.
Dialogue: 1,1:52:13.85,1:52:17.06,en,,0000,0000,0000,,When he got to the bottom of the river,the safe warped.
Dialogue: 1,1:52:17.14,1:52:18.52,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And he was trapped.
Dialogue: 1,1:52:20.06,1:52:21.65,en,,0000,0000,0000,,He was your father.
Dialogue: 1,1:52:23.52,1:52:26.86,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The morning before the show didn't feel like any other day.
Dialogue: 1,1:52:27.90,1:52:32.91,en,,0000,0000,0000,,When my father said he had to go to work,he could see that I didn't want him to leave.
Dialogue: 1,1:52:35.16,1:52:40.29,en,,0000,0000,0000,,So he gave me his watch,and he told me to count the seconds until he came back.
Dialogue: 1,1:52:41.46,1:52:44.17,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I have never let his watch stop since then.
Dialogue: 1,1:52:44.25,1:52:46.38,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And from that moment on,
Dialogue: 1,1:52:46.46,1:52:49.01,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I created a persona.
Dialogue: 1,1:52:49.63,1:52:51.55,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I planned. I worked out every detail.
Dialogue: 1,1:52:51.64,1:52:54.93,en,,0000,0000,0000,,But the one thing that I couldn't imagine happening
Dialogue: 1,1:52:55.35,1:52:56.52,en,,0000,0000,0000,,was you.
Dialogue: 1,1:52:58.18,1:53:01.15,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And I know that the logical conclusion for you
Dialogue: 1,1:53:01.65,1:53:04.40,en,,0000,0000,0000,,is to take this case to its resolution.
Dialogue: 1,1:53:04.48,1:53:07.53,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And for you to turn me in.
Dialogue: 1,1:53:12.66,1:53:13.70,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,1:53:15.66,1:53:19.50,en,,0000,0000,0000,,But you know how I feel about resolution and logic.
Dialogue: 1,1:53:20.87,1:53:22.21,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And you also know
Dialogue: 1,1:53:23.08,1:53:27.42,en,,0000,0000,0000,,that I think some things are best left unexplained.
Dialogue: 1,1:53:33.93,1:53:35.72,en,,0000,0000,0000,,One more secret to lock away.
Dialogue: 1,1:54:03.29,1:54:04.79,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Come in close.
Dialogue: 1,1:54:05.29,1:54:06.54,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Closer.
Dialogue: 1,1:54:06.63,1:54:08.88,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Because now you know our secret.
Dialogue: 1,1:54:08.96,1:54:11.30,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We could be anywhere. Watching you.
Dialogue: 1,1:54:11.92,1:54:15.55,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We're looking for someone to help us with our next trick.
Dialogue: 1,1:54:15.64,1:54:18.18,en,,0000,0000,0000,,On the count of three,open your eyes
Dialogue: 1,1:54:18.26,1:54:20.22,en,,0000,0000,0000,,and tell me what you see.
Dialogue: 1,1:54:21.23,1:54:22.31,en,,0000,0000,0000,,One.
Dialogue: 1,1:54:22.44,1:54:23.44,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Two...
Dialogue: 1,1:55:55.28,1:55:57.15,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Please,stop,stop,stop.
Dialogue: 1,1:55:57.53,1:56:01.24,en,,0000,0000,0000,,All right,stop the van. Stop the van. I'm gonna jump out of the van.
Dialogue: 1,1:56:02.24,1:56:03.70,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh,thank God.
Dialogue: 1,1:56:05.66,1:56:07.75,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 1,1:56:07.83,1:56:10.25,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Great,another shit hole.
Dialogue: 1,1:56:10.33,1:56:12.25,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay,feeling it.
Dialogue: 1,1:56:12.34,1:56:16.51,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm exhausted,and hungry,and cranky.
Dialogue: 1,1:56:17.55,1:56:19.43,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Check out this place.
Dialogue: 1,1:56:19.51,1:56:22.30,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Where'd you bring us? - Was there no landfill where we were?
Dialogue: 1,1:56:22.39,1:56:24.27,en,,0000,0000,0000,,This place is awesome.
Dialogue: 1,1:56:25.81,1:56:26.81,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Is this our new gear?
Dialogue: 1,1:56:26.89,1:56:28.44,en,,0000,0000,0000,,There'd better not be,like,matching jumpsuits in there.
Dialogue: 1,1:56:28.52,1:56:29.56,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You know I don't wear spandex.
Dialogue: 1,1:56:29.65,1:56:32.02,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- It's Locked. - Guys,the cards.
Dialogue: 1,1:56:32.11,1:56:34.65,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- What card? - What do you mean, "what card"?
Dialogue: 1,1:56:38.74,1:56:39.74,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
